thubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/7fcab1c75f204956b57160a3673bf9ec465c2b44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:15:35Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:15:35Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"message":"MR11 monthly forecast/actual rules and Dispatch monthly dispatched table\n\nMonthly columns start from BD''s forecast. Design''s Total Quantity Ordered replaces it when\nhigher, or when lower once every level is completed; Total Processed replaces that when\nhigher, or when lower once every Planning row''s Order Status is Completed. The difference\ngoes to the current month first. An ended month shows the m2 dispatched in it (actual):\nLocal from its daily columns, Overseas from the rise in Cumulative Dispatched between\nmonths. Month headers say ACTUAL or F''CAST (MR11 page and Excel export).\n\nThe Dispatch page has a hideable table of m2 dispatched per month for each project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Op