am counts as completed when all its levels are)\n- Actual Formwork Order Completion Date per level (Typical / Upper ...), one date when equal\n- Shell Plan approval history: every Approved / Reapprove with revision and dates is kept with\n  each MR11 and shown in its own table on the Shell Plan & Design page (can be hidden)\n- CEO dashboard groups design by the latest completion date\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4102e2af79d465d7f9f5a1f25d1af7f8b301804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/f4102e2af79d465d7f9f5a1f25d1af7f8b301804"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/422fb7fec14a1ad8ac41435c6a6696e671d1917f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/422fb7fec14a1ad8ac41435c6a6696e671d1917f","node_id":"C_kwDOURCihNoAKDQyMmZiN2ZlYzE0YTFhZDhhYzQxNDM1YzZhNjY5NmU2NzFkMTkxN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/8375a7a7ef63c55e2459a790c74f1b799f155036","sha":"8375a7a7ef63c55e2459a790c74f1b799f155036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/8375a7a7ef63c55e2459a790c74f1b799f155036"}],"sha":"422fb7fec14a1ad8ac41435c6a6696e671d1917f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/422fb7fec14a1ad8ac41435c6a6696e671d1917f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/8375a7a7ef63c55e2459a790c74f1b799f155036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:08:55Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:08:55Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"message":"Shell Plan & Design combined department, stream from project number, LME Check fix\n\n- Shell Plan and Design share one workbook and one page (''Shell Plan & Design'', kept under\n  DESIGN); either role can open and upload it, and SHELLPLAN requests are served from it\n- MR11 reads the Shell Plan columns from the Design file when it has them (an older separate\n  Shell Plan file is then ignored)\n- A 6-digit project number carries the stream as its last digit (251242 = 25124 stream 2);\n  MR11 uses that stream for matching and shows it\n- LME rate may be the aluminium market price: the adjustment is (rate - 3060) / 1000 x 22.5,\n  and a ''Check'' takes that adjustment instead of the raw rate\n- Shell Plan or Design users get both groups of columns highlighted\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e74a375c036f9e527ce67a65d790cccc9a0ff942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/e74a375c036f9e527ce67a65d790cccc9a0ff942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/8375a7a7ef63c55e2459a790c74f1b799f155036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyi