R11: monthly actual/forecast from BD, blue-font rows stop at Planning, row colours\n\n- Monthly ACTUAL / F''CAST columns (Jan-26..Dec-27, yearly totals) now come from the\n  BD row''s own month columns (AG..BF) instead of the Finance file\n- Blue-font BD rows only go as far as Planning: no Production or Dispatch values\n- Excel theme colours (e.g. Blue, Accent 4) are now read for font and fill\n- The BD row''s font colour runs across the whole MR11 row (page and Excel export)\n- Shell Plan / Design cells of filled rows show the full row fill colour\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fab73a0b01cb76ca32ed63bce81a4425c0786b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/7fab73a0b01cb76ca32ed63bce81a4425c0786b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/13a136e344069a4345c35428b34b7c958643f1f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"