an/Design\n\n- BD columns A..AF read by the new header names (Project No., Project Shortname,\n  Product Type, Formwork Type, LME, LME Rate (USD)); old names kept as aliases\n- BD columns match the whole header name, so a blank PO date / NCA date / LME Rate\n  no longer picks up the PO / NCA / LME column next to it\n- Empty formatted BD rows are skipped instead of copying the project above\n- A BD row with a fill colour keeps its own Shell Plan & Design cells; rows without\n  a fill (any font colour) merge across their project & stream\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4647e65de455a2e3000b54eb02aea920a61637e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/a4647e65de455a2e3000b54eb02aea920a61637e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/d800c6d3dfd21766bdb14abd02a69fed4f10c2ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://githu