om/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/35428dfc9f797593626cd2ccd2118baf8fa98ca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:01:30Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:01:30Z","email":"aiteswar26@gmail.com","name":"Aiteswar123"},"message":"MR11: LME rate column, 3-decimal LME, correct Planning totals and Produced Date\n\n- LME Rate (USD) from BD column Z added to MR11 after LME\n- LME Rate and LME Adjusted shown with 3 decimals (page and Excel export)\n- An LME Adjusted of \"Check\" takes the LME rate; Final Selling Price\n  is recalculated to include it\n- Planning: project number taken from BD by short name; matching uses the\n  short name when both sides have one; streams must match exactly\n  (stream-1 series were being added to stream-2 projects)\n- Produced Date: latest day with output across all date columns and all\n  matching Production rows; the Day/Date column (Normal, Quick Deck...)\n  is no longer shown as a date\n- Total Produced, Total Dispatched, ATD and revised ETD found by header\n  name, so added or moved template columns cannot shift them\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94eb6b39b9994e8c9303530cc52aa6f775bf7112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/94eb6b39b9994e8c9303530cc52aa6f775bf7112"},"url":"https://api