wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/11ec27604ab4a13df306fae924f079bb39654dd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:04:07Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:04:07Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"message":"Survive slow or dropped database connections without losing data\n\n- Run the Vercel functions in sin1, next to the Supabase database in\n  Singapore, instead of the default iad1 (Washington).\n- Retry a database read once when the connection drops or times out.\n- A fresh instance that could not reach the database retries loading on the\n  next request instead of serving without the uploaded workbooks.\n- An MR11 run built without a department''s latest workbook is not saved over\n  the database''s MR11, so a failed read cannot replace a complete MR11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa728246c3d84ea93837c87f3a403823208141e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/fa728246c3d84ea93837c87f3a403823208141e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/11ec27604ab4a13df306fae924f079bb39654dd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194689808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/11ec27604ab4a13df306fae924f079bb39654dd1","node_id":"C_kwDOURCihNoAKDExZWMyNzYwNGFiNGExM2RmMzA2ZmFlOTI0ZjA3OWJiMzk2NTRkZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316","sha":"02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316"}],"sha":"11ec27604ab4a13df306fae924f079bb39654dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/11ec27604ab4a13df306fae924f079bb39654dd1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194689808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:53:59Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:53:59Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"message":"Keep users, MR11 history and the newest uploads across restarts\n\nUsers, role assignments and the MR11 engine''s series history only lived in\neach server''s memory, so a Vercel restart (or a second instance) lost them.\n\n- Users and roles are read from and written to Supabase (login, admin\n  console create / permission change / delete); demo accounts are seeded\n  in supabase/schema.sql, which no longer resets the admin password.\n- Each saved MR11 run carries the engine history and dispatch tracker; the\n  engine and a fresh instance restore them from the latest run.\n- Requests wait until a fresh instance has loaded from the database, the\n  department list reads the active files from the database, a reload never\n  replaces a department switched after it began, and an MR11 built from\n  replaced workbooks is not saved over a newer one.\n- Accounts created in the admin console can log in with their own password\n  (bcrypt was loaded with require(), which ES modules do not have).\n- The in-memory compound-key lookup now matches, so a planning quantity''s\n  last-changed date is kept while the quantity stays the same.\n- scripts/persistence-test.mjs (npm run test:persistence) checks all of this\n  end to end against a local PostgreSQL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a105d081d2cc180c3e6a1b1223adb4a893cd97e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/3a105d081d2cc180c3e6a1b1223adb4a893cd97e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194689808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316","node_id":"C_kwDOURCihNoAKDAyODg5ZWM1MGNhMjc1MmY1MjMwY2YyYTU0NjcxOTQ3NjAyYzYzMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/a8747c1c4671843a3cda75cf008573503694c015","sha":"a8747c1c4671843a3cda75cf008573503694c015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/a8747c1c4671843a3cda75cf008573503694c015"}],"sha":"02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/02889ec50ca2752f5230cf2a54671947602c6316"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194689808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commits/a8747c1c4671843a3cda75cf008573503694c015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:31:27Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:31:27Z","email":"megakil.aqil@gmail.com","name":"andiaqil03"},"message":"Read the Supabase URL from Vercel''s integration variables\n\nThe Vercel Supabase integration provides the connection string as\nDATABASE_POSTGRES_URL, so fall back to it (and POSTGRES_URL) when\nDATABASE_URL is not set. pg treats sslmode=require as verify-full, which\nrejects Supabase''s certificate chain, so rewrite it to no-verify to match\ngetSslConfig. Also ignore the local .vercel link folder.\n\