d) and month filters across the page\n- Pipeline totals: design -> processed -> produced -> dispatched\n- Monthly actual vs forecast (completed months actual; empty forecast defaults to 100,000 m2)\n- Breakdown by region, or by project when a month is selected\n- Raw Data overlay reusing the MR11 table, extracted into Mr11Table\n- Ignore package-lock.json (project uses bun.lock)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69beec5ba83aefcab8c27a4cef98ea099e742206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/69beec5ba83aefcab8c27a4cef98ea099e742206"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/128d289984d06e9de3c450e776040fd0d158cba1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194689808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiaqil03","id":194689808,"login":"andiaqil03","node_id":"U_kgDOC5q7EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiaqil03","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/commit/128d289984d06e9de3c450e776040fd0d158cba1","node_id":"C_kwDOURCihNoAKDEyOGQyODk5ODRkMDZlOWRlM2M0NTBlNzc2MDQwZmQwZDE1OGNiYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"htt