s,\n  on the MR11 page and in the Excel export\n- Removed position-based column writes that overwrote Processed Date,\n  Produced Date, Total Dispatch and Dispatched Date with wrong values\n- NCA Remarks reads BD''s second Remarks column\n- LME Adjusted / Final Selling Price follow the BD formulas when the\n  cell has no saved result or an Excel error (\"Check\" for Freeze)\n- Excel reader keeps formula results of 0 (ExcelJS drops them)\n- supabase/schema.sql matches the columns the app uses; local\n  PostgreSQL helper (npm run db:start / db:stop / db:status)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46c2aaf94581bd1f7bb5d28abe08c48e59b60e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/trees/46c2aaf94581bd1f7bb5d28abe08c48e59b60e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzatmyintellx05/MFE/git/commits/002d2bca4712e596870f49667c7db602ba2c848a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203938592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aiteswar123","id":203938592,"login":"Aiteswar123","node_id":"U_kgDODCfbIA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aiteswar123","user_view_type":"public"},"