79c5f11a27b889ba3f9385c1fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:59:21Z","email":"agent@example.com","name":"Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:59:21Z","email":"agent@example.com","name":"Agent"},"message":"feat(deploy): Dokploy Compose stack, self-contained production images, GHCR deploy workflow\n\n- deploy/compose.prod.yml: postgres 16 (two DBs, roles promptdesk/promptdesk_chat\n  via initdb, kept distinct), per-app Redis (requirepass + noeviction), one-shot\n  migrate service (profile, required:false depends_on), api Traefik-routed with\n  /internal -> noop@internal, chatworker private-only; Dokploy network external.\n- deploy/docker/{api,chatworker}.Dockerfile: self-contained bookworm-slim images\n  (npm ci per app, dual prisma generate, nest build, non-root, GIT_SHA baked,\n  healthchecks on /version and /health).\n- deploy/migrate.sh: dual-schema prisma migrate deploy, SKIP_MIGRATIONS=1 no-op.\n- deploy/env.production.example, deploy/tiers/{16gb,8gb}.env, deploy/README.md.\n- .github/workflows/deploy.yml: test -> GHCR build (pinned actions, GIT_SHA,\n  :sha + :production) -> runner compose smoke (migrate incl. SKIP pass,\n  up --wait, /version grep) -> pointer move -> webhook -> poll /version.\n- .github/workflows/pages.yml: apps/web + apps/support to Cloudflare Pages.\n- api: public GET /version controller (gitsha + service) + spec; wired into AppModule.\n- deleted .github/workflows/deploy-infra.yml (cross-repo dispatch is gone).\n- root .dockerignore for repo-root buildx contexts.","tree":{"sha":"255a321424da80de8feb15b08940b15e84abbc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/promptdesk/git/trees/255a321424da80de8feb15b08940b15e84abbc52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/promptdesk/git/commits/f43eaba5185ee279c5f11a27b889ba3f9385c1fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/