/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/766af43280c194579dec80f8adf19140a04bb881","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKDc2NmFmNDMyODBjMTk0NTc5ZGVjODBmOGFkZjE5MTQwYTA0YmI4ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","sha":"a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985","sha":"edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985"}],"sha":"766af43280c194579dec80f8adf19140a04bb881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/766af43280c194579dec80f8adf19140a04bb881"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:26:44Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:26:44Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Fix the popup layout: tree row positioning leaked into the popup''s rows\n\nThe UI refresh made `.row` absolutely positioned for the virtualized tree; the popup reused the\nclass name, so its origin, buttons and checkboxes stacked on top of each other. The popup rows are\nnow `.field`, and the absolute positioning is scoped to `.virtual-inner > .row`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"e341832666bfc5e696e0bee218d525eaf9be5505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/e341832666bfc5e696e0bee218d525eaf9be5505"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKGVkZmYzNjdkNzRhYjk2MjZjMTVjNDgxOTZmYzdiYThkZDVjMGE5ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","sha":"a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f"}],"sha":"edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/edff367d74ab9626c15c48196fc7ba8dd5c0a985"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:48:21Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:48:21Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Milestone D: sessions with before/after comparison, provider attribution, children diffs, commit priority\n\nLibrary\n- useContext changes carry provider { component, path } (Provider fiber lookup for React 18 and 19)\n  and changedKeys/totalKeys for object values; reasons mention the provider and partial key changes\n- elements serialize as { $type: ''element'', name, key?, props } so children can be diffed leaf by leaf;\n  re-created children get their own reason and fix advice\n- commitPriority from the Scheduler priority React passes to onCommitFiberRoot; info() counts\n  scheduled roots vs commits\n\nPanel\n- Record / Stop sessions; Sessions view with a compare table (per-component avoidable deltas, totals,\n  wasted time, fixes no longer needed); summaries persist per origin and travel with exports\n- context list names the provider and flags partial key changes with split advice (splitContext fix)\n- element values render as <Name> with props; children fix; commit priority tag in Commits and reports\n- custom hook names deliberately not attempted (needs re-running components with a stub dispatcher)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"4d80e1d4685d19369c83ee108b1ce3e8966cb4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/4d80e1d4685d19369c83ee108b1ce3e8966cb4e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKGExOWE2NjFmOTA5Yjk4ODAxZWZkZGYxNTljMDkyYTU3ZjNjNzliMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9","sha":"5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9"}],"sha":"a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/a19a661f909b98801efddf159c092a57f3c79b1f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:35:49Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:35:49Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Extension UI refresh and the panel outside DevTools (side panel, own window)\n\n- Chrome side panel (`side_panel` + `sidePanel` permission) and \"Open in window\", from the toolbar\n  popup and from new Side panel / Window buttons in the DevTools panel; Firefox maps to sidebar_action\n- one relay transport (createRelayTransport) with two adapters: devtoolsIO (inspectedWindow.eval)\n  and standaloneIO (chrome.scripting.executeScript command bridge in the MAIN world, chrome.tabs for\n  navigation and active-tab following); sidepanel.html / panel.html?tabId= boot standalone\n- UI: new light/dark palette and spacing, icon toolbar whose labels collapse in narrow layouts,\n  segmented views, summary strip (renders, avoidable, wasted, top offender, best fix; clickable),\n  tab chip in standalone mode, stacked compact layout under 720px\n- tests: standalone transport (pinned / follow / undock), popup open buttons, summary strip,\n  fake chrome gains scripting/windows/sidePanel/tabs; e2e drives sidepanel.html against the app\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"d5f8fef80fd29eb390755dbc4deb41fdee24f461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/d5f8fef80fd29eb390755dbc4deb41fdee24f461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKDU5NzM1NDBlYmRkNzFjN2YyNjJiODNiN2U5M2FhMWI5NTY1MTRmYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850","sha":"6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850"}],"sha":"5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/5973540ebdd71c7f262b83b7e93aa1b956514fb9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:19:11Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:19:11Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"README: document the DevTools extension (install unpacked, connect a page, inject or run the package)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"630067cff8ed13945a34f96f7870d6d9d341d831","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/630067cff8ed13945a34f96f7870d6d9d341d831"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKDZmOWRkYWJkNjFiZDcxNDNiN2EwYmYwN2Q4MGVjNTkxZGI0MWU4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405","sha":"b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405"}],"sha":"6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/6f9ddabd61bd7143b7a0bf07d80ec591db41e850"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:09:09Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:09:09Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Milestone C: TypeScript panel, virtualized tree and stream, shortcuts, leaf diffs, root-cause page\n\n- extension/src/panel.ts is the source; tsup (third entry) writes the committed extension/panel.js,\n  CI fails when it is stale\n- tree and live stream are windowed (fixed row heights, overscan); the stream keeps all buffered\n  reports; panel.html?demo&flood=N generates N synthetic reports (5000 ingest + render in ~20 ms)\n- keyboard: / search, f fix tab, Esc clear highlight; details tab persisted per origin\n- `different` object props show the differing leaves with full paths (filters.page: 1 → 2)\n- root-cause page: every commit a component started, affected components, aggregated fixes\n- flash only for rows that mount within a second of their report (virtualized rows scrolled into\n  view later stay quiet)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"4a3f1d072f230c0951797c2f915c41484e7d29b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/4a3f1d072f230c0951797c2f915c41484e7d29b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKGI3YTUzNGQ3YmU3YTBlNjQ3ZDBlYTA2ODRhNzI0NWJjNGQxYjY0MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb","sha":"d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb"}],"sha":"b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/b7a534d7be7a0e647d0ea0684a7245bc4d1b6405"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:56:23Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:56:23Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Milestone B: self time, memoized flag, duplicate-copy detection, defer-to-React-DevTools toggle, runtime tests\n\n- selfDuration is now own render time (actualDuration minus direct children); treeDuration keeps the subtree value\n- memoized on every report; unmemoized components with avoidable prop changes get the React.memo reason and fix first\n- bridge info() reports source (''page'' | ''extension'') and injected; the panel warns when both copies are present\n- per-origin \"Let React DevTools create the hook\" toggle: inject-deferred.js flag + setTimeout(0) in inject.js;\n  wired through background (deferHook), popup and panel Settings\n- Elements sidebar: null inspect result means \"no React component\", not \"library missing\"\n- jsdom tests for background.js, popup.js and sidebar.js on a shared fake chrome (89 tests total)\n- e2e covers deferred injection and the page-owned-library case\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"621f31800358704c1fc3760caee4ecfba35a09c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/621f31800358704c1fc3760caee4ecfba35a09c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKGQ1ZGRiYTU0YzQ2YjczM2ZiMjMxZWJmNGUwNzlhNWJiODk3NmM2Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb","sha":"7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb"}],"sha":"d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/d5ddba54c46b733fb231ebf4e079a5bb8976c6cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:36:14Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:36:14Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Extension roadmap v0.2–v0.5: store packaging, zero-config injection, root-cause analysis, cross-browser builds\n\nLibrary (0.2.0, bridge protocol 2)\n- commitId and source (React 18 _debugSource / React 19 _debugStack) on every report\n- bridge: info(), pull(since), configure()/getOptions(), highlight(), flashAvoidable(), inspect(node)\n- in-page overlay (src/overlay.ts); instance id -> fiber registry; getRenderers()/isProductionReact()\n- attach() wraps hook.inject so react-refresh hooks (Vite) expose the React version too\n- IIFE bundle (extension/vendor/rerender-lens.js) for injection; VERSION define\n\nExtension\n- manifest: action popup, storage/scripting/activeTab, local host permissions, optional host permissions\n- background: per-origin relay/injection registration, badge, reconcile on startup\n- inject.js (MAIN world bootstrap), popup to enable a site, Elements-panel sidebar for $0\n- panel: 3-state status + protocol/production warnings, polling fallback via inspectedWindow.eval,\n  batching, Offenders/Commits/Fixes views, root-cause ranking, render cascade, context attribution,\n  fix snippets, source links, hover highlight, Markdown copy, JSON export/import, settings drawer,\n  per-origin persistence, resizable split\n- packaging: scripts/build-extension.mjs (+ dependency-free zip writer) -> Chrome/Edge/Firefox zips,\n  manifest version synced from package.json; CI artifact + Chrome Web Store upload on release\n- store listing, privacy policy and publishing notes in extension/store/\n- Playwright e2e (relay, badge, injection, panel) against the example app; /plain.html page without the library\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0114APukjwqCYqnVgfz7viMP","tree":{"sha":"35a419ac22042d480dfafb60e746fff1afd6525c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/35a419ac22042d480dfafb60e746fff1afd6525c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKDdiZmEwNTY5MDg3ZDU1M2M5NWY5ZTU0YWRhNTIyYjg4Y2I1Nzk5YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d","sha":"f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d"}],"sha":"7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/7bfa0569087d553c95f9e54ada522b88cb5799bb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:50:04Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:50:04Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Add Chrome DevTools extension with a React DevTools style Re-renders panel\n\nManifest V3, plain JS, no build step. content.js relays the library''s\nwindow messages to background.js, which routes them per tab to the panel.\nThe panel shows a component tree (built from report paths) with avoidable\ncounts, a details pane (why it rendered, triggering ancestor, props with\nchanged keys highlighted, state and hooks, history), and a live stream.\nTree and stream update incrementally so clicks are never lost to a\nrebuild; light and dark themes follow DevTools. panel.html?demo previews\nthe panel with sample data; extension/test/panel.test.ts drives it in jsdom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LMuWy8PZR48ZfucpvJdpxv","tree":{"sha":"ecb7699c6a5ea154baef21e78b3b53461553fb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/trees/ecb7699c6a5ea154baef21e78b3b53461553fb28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/git/commits/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d","node_id":"C_kwDOURJo69oAKGY4Y2ZhYjU3MGQ2Mjk4ZWQ4MDMzMjM0Y2E1ZmQ1MDI4M2Y5YjRhMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commit/1bd063bc2fb295f6db9081fcfcd4d6438f41d239","sha":"1bd063bc2fb295f6db9081fcfcd4d6438f41d239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/1bd063bc2fb295f6db9081fcfcd4d6438f41d239"}],"sha":"f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/f8cfab570d6298ed8033234ca5fd50283f9b4a2d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NexaLeaf/rerender-lens/commits/1bd063bc2fb295f6db9081fcfcd4d6438f41d239/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:36:55Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:36:55Z","email":"palanisamy.muthusamy@zoominfo.com","name":"Palanisamy Muthusamy"},"message":"Rebuild tracker on fiber inspection; add example app, parent attribution, hot-reload handling\n\nPhase 1 dogfooding in a Vite + React 19 app showed the createElement-wrapper\ndesign breaks Fast Refresh: a wrapped component never receives its edits\nbecause refresh families are keyed by the original function and Vite injects\nmodule-local $RefreshReg$, so there is no way to join a family from outside.\n\nThe tracker now observes commits through the React DevTools global hook and\nwalks the fiber tree, like React DevTools does. Nothing is patched or wrapped:\n- Fast Refresh works, state is preserved, refresh commits are skipped\n- no import-order tricks, no jsxImportSource, no default-import requirement\n- configure() applies live without remounting\n- memo comparators, forwardRef, classes handled by React itself\n\nNew in reports: parent (nearest ancestor that rendered, and why), owner,\npath, instanceId, selfDuration. Hook diffing reads state nodes and context\ndependencies from the fiber. New options: ignoreHotReload,\nmaxReportsPerComponent. Removed the jsx-runtime entries.\n\nexamples/vite-react: three deliberate re-render bugs, verified in Chrome.\nTarball smoke-tested on React 18.3 and 19.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: 