, baked vertex-colour gradients, plate inner shadow, clean physical lighting\n\n- camera level with the target (no tab tops visible), fov 24 @ z 7.0\n- bakeVerticalGradient(): top-light → bottom-shade vertex colours on body, tiles and the unit sphere (limbs);\n  plate floor gets a soft inner shadow under its top edge; materials use vertexColors\n- NoToneMapping with physical-unit light intensities (hemisphere 2.6, key 1.45, fill 0.45), env 0.18\n- palette nudged to the hero''s mint/emerald/spring green; softer, wider contact shadow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac80f3b105ecb63f13b22f66ad39bf2e2e7b8ad9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/trees/ac80f3b105ecb63f13b22f66ad39bf2e2e7b8ad9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/commits/569ca19ff84f5e3892b78287abe0079779b6abf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/569ca19ff84f5e3892b78287abe0079779b6abf9","node_id":"C_kwDOURPO8doAKDU2OWNhMTlmZjg0ZjVlMzg5MmI3ODI4N2FiZTAwNzk3NzliNmFiZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573","sha":"951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573"}],"sha":"569ca19ff84f5e3892b78287abe0079779b6abf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/569ca19ff84f5e3892b78287abe0079779b6abf9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:57:18Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:57:18Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"Match the hero illustration: oval body, blocky cross with notch, flat ear tabs, solid eyes, green cheeks, soft light\n\n- body is an oblate ellipsoid (1 × 0.8 × 0.88), lifted so the feet rest on the ground\n- plate = bar + lower stem with a pale notch between the ears (no dark stem up); square corners\n- ear tabs stand straight up from the bar''s top edge; side tiles flush with the bar ends\n- solid near-black glossy eyes with a white + soft-green highlight; iris texture and brows now opt-in\n- tone-on-tone green cheeks, green tongue, chunky tilted arms, big feet; hero palette; soft lighting\n- expressions from the sheet (idle open smile, sleepy tiny ''o'', happy eyes open); subtler ear motion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5592b941ff24f437fe44390bbb0c650c3fe72b08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/trees/5592b941ff24f437fe44390bbb0c650c3fe72b08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/commits/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573","node_id":"C_kwDOURPO8doAKDk1MWI3MzM3NzhjZWFhMzM4MDE1YmViMWI5N2Y3MTIxZDJiN2Q1NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a","sha":"22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a"}],"sha":"951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/951b733778ceaa338015beb1b97f7121d2b7d573"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:46:54Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:46:54Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"Retune Filly to design sheet v2: emerald palette, green-iris eyes + brows, tab ears, higher plate, closed-smile idle, arm raises\n\n- palette: dark emerald plate, medium-green tiles/limbs, near-white mint body, iris/pupil/brow colours\n- eyes: canvas iris texture on the eyeball (gaze = rotation), bigger radius, oval highlight; eyebrow arcs driven by brow/eyeScale\n- geometry: plate bar −0.22..+0.52 with stem up between the ears, ear tabs 0.37×0.54 upright, side tiles placed explicitly so they read as full squares at the bar ends\n- poses: idle/listening/blink/sleepy closed smile, happy ^^ eyes + arms up, listening/talking/surprised arm raises\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d92efade042ea007a62904886c9ac91d61b9461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/trees/3d92efade042ea007a62904886c9ac91d61b9461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/commits/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a","node_id":"C_kwDOURPO8doAKDIyMTI5ZTZkMzNkNjNjNWIxN2Y5NWNjMjM0MmQ0ZTM1OWY0ZTE3OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4","sha":"b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4"}],"sha":"22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/22129e6d33d63c5b17f95cc2342d4e359f4e179a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commits/b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:16:34Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T09:16:34Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"Tune likeness from art-director critique, fix packaging/React issues from review, add README + single-file demo\n\n- Relative imports in src (tsc emitted ''@/…'' aliases into d.ts — consumers couldn''t resolve types)\n- paused/offscreen canvas rendered blank (frameloop ''never'' ignores invalidate) → ''demand''\n- interactive={false} now really click-through; seed change no longer replays an enter impulse\n- three-bvh-csg / three-mesh-bvh externalised (dist 223 kB → 58 kB)\n- Visual: flatter lens, rounder ears, pinker cheeks, glossier vinyl, darker limbs/plate,\n  straighter ear perk / outward droop, happy roll + raised arms, thinking hand at mouth corner,\n  bigger surprised ''o'' with tongue hint, sparks at face height, zZ kept in frame\n- scripts/singlefile.mts + build:demo; README with care_filly_fe integration guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f35307caa292cb3424ec7894080052d8b4635253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/trees/f35307caa292cb3424ec7894080052d8b4635253"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/git/commits/b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_filly_character/commit/b9cb5cefaf9db32f0046b81efe927d4799db91b4","node_id":"C_kwDOURPO8doAKGI5Y2I1Y2VmYWY5ZGIzMmYwMDQ2YjgxZWZlOTI3ZDQ3OTlkYjkxYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.