itter":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:54:51Z","email":"sanketghodke03@gmail.com","name":"Sanket Ghodake"},"message":"fix(security): remediate supply chain CVEs and harden k8s pod security\n\n- Add dependency overrides for sharp (>=0.35.4), qs, tmp, cookie, uuid, and esbuild\n- Enforce Kubernetes Restricted Pod Security Standard (UID 10001, readOnlyRootFilesystem, tmp emptyDir, pinned v2.0.0, namespace forge-system)\n- Eliminate unprivileged capability additions in caddy-gateway (container ports 8080/8443)\n- Calibrate watchdog execution timeouts in verify-checks and verify-gate\n- Add Supply Chain & Infrastructure Hardening living documentation (SR-SEC-001, HLR-NET-001, LLR-SUB-007)\n- Add Playwright E2E security-iac-headers test journey\n- Fix branding test environment isolation lifecycle\n\nSigned-off-by: Sanket Ghodake <sanketghodke03@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c85adcca1bf2a784767cd36783e04e49c85385a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanket-ghodake/sg_forge/git/trees/0c85adcca1bf2a784767cd36783e04e49c85385a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanket-ghodake/sg_forge/git/commits/c73c3de420f79094f17fb6f5359ad8c56f6c97db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68549809?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanket-ghodake","id":68549809,"login":"sanket-ghodake","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NTQ5ODA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/repos","site_admin":