at(forge-apps): achieve full submodule toolchain parity, 21-gate verification, and autonomous independence\n\n- Added standalone portable CLI wrappers in portables/bin/: trivy, syft, osv-scanner, lizard AST, type-coverage, repomix, autocannon, axe, ctop\n- Upgraded run.sh and run.bat across all submodules with 20+ toolchain commands and dynamic .env port binding\n- Upgraded submodule verify-gate.ts to 21 deterministic quality checks (Trivy + OSV-Scanner)\n- Added Invariant 14 (Submodule Toolchain Parity & Autonomous Independence Directive) to AGENTS.md\n- Synchronized multi-agent directives across all 24 workspace targets\n- Hardened sync-submodules.ts to propagate all scripts, toolchains, and package.json commands\n- Safely purged ghost desktop-monitor directory while preserving .env entry\n\nSigned-off-by: Sanket Ghodake <sanketghodke03@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"15493b4f62c067b7e24cba9f8edd0195dcb2e797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanket-ghodake/sg_forge/git/trees/15493b4f62c067b7e24cba9f8edd0195dcb2e797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanket-ghodake/sg_forge/git/commits/ffe0e50d8f689d0c4b17933b2d4d2256aadc39a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68549809?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanket-ghodake","id":68549809,"login":"sanket-ghodake","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NTQ5ODA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanket-ghodake/repos","sit