"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/82096b3e7e43054a0c3d0c6a81ce3a6950bdc7ea","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDgyMDk2YjNlN2U0MzA1NGEwYzNkMGM2YTgxY2UzYTY5NTBiZGM3ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5","sha":"400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5"}],"sha":"82096b3e7e43054a0c3d0c6a81ce3a6950bdc7ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/82096b3e7e43054a0c3d0c6a81ce3a6950bdc7ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:52:13Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:52:13Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"refactor(docs): simplify the docs app after review\n\nBehaviour, copy, DOM, class names, the exposed module and the headers the\ncontainer smokes assert are unchanged; the suite is the same 625 tests.\n\n- vitest.config.ts resolves packages/ui/package.json with this repository''s\n  dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)) idiom rather than a file URL.\n- The Inventory''s cache-mode comment credits docker/storybook.nginx.conf, the\n  config that actually serves /storybook/index.json, not the design one.\n- tsconfig.json records that the main program already sees @types/node through\n  vitest/globals, so `node` in `types` is there for the Module Federation DTS\n  pass alone, which copies the array into a program of the exposed files only.\n- The two build modules name the workspace root once instead of counting\n  ../../../ at every read.\n- The loaded inventory is its own component, so the story total is computed\n  where it is rendered instead of defaulting to 0 while loading.\n- The token gallery''s three tables share one table shell.\n- contrastRowsFor drops its `measurable` flag for a helper that returns null.\n- .swatches and .spaceList were the same seven declarations; they share a rule.\n- Both container smokes take the prefix redirect and the immutable-asset\n  headers from shared assertions in scripts/lib/container-smoke.sh.","tree":{"sha":"909b02812105386480ab48a0ebf8421678c5a2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/909b02812105386480ab48a0ebf8421678c5a2d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDQwMDI0MmQ3OTM0OTU3YjZmYzM5OTY1N2M1ZGUwNmIzMmI0YWQ0ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a","sha":"dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a"}],"sha":"400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/400242d7934957b6fc399657c5de06b32b4ad4e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:20:48Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:20:48Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"refactor(docs): the build-time modules leave the browser source root\n\nFour modules under `src/` were Node-only — the share map, the build-info\nplugin, the dev proxy and the html-lang plugin — and were type-checked\nagainst the DOM lib and run in jsdom. That already cost one real defect: a\n`new URL(literal, import.meta.url)` read as an asset reference by a\nclient-environment pipeline, carried since as a ten-line comment. They live\nin `apps/docs/build/` now, with their own `docs-build` Vitest project under\na Node environment; `fileURLToPath` there needs only its one-line reason,\nand the next config helper written beside them inherits the environment\nrather than the trap.\n\nThe directory sits at the same depth as `src/`, so the two manifest reads\nkeep their `../../../` paths — the pinning test that reads\n`packages/ui/package.json` a second, independent way still passes.\n`tsconfig.json` includes `build`, and `@types/node` (already a devDependency\nof this app) is named in `types`.\n\nThe README gains a section on the app itself: what it is, its dev and build\ncommands, the Storybook dependency the inventory has in development, and the\nimage and the smoke that check it.","tree":{"sha":"a0a766c4ff2b39f7053eeb1f74b47132b36a2a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/a0a766c4ff2b39f7053eeb1f74b47132b36a2a6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKGRjNmM2ODk3NDE4NGM4OWQ2MmM0NzkzNzg5ZThjOGFkMzgwYzM4MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/94ca120679f0f10f98de2d777b05cc6b6f5c1e80","sha":"94ca120679f0f10f98de2d777b05cc6b6f5c1e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/94ca120679f0f10f98de2d777b05cc6b6f5c1e80"}],"sha":"dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/dc6c68974184c89d62c4793789e8c8ad380c380a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/94ca120679f0f10f98de2d777b05cc6b6f5c1e80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:14:46Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:19:00Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(docs): the spacing list fits a phone, the deferred root test acts its unmount, and the copy stops narrating the plan\n\nThe spacing rows were a fixed three-column grid, so at 390px the 6rem and\n8rem bars overflowed the row, the section and the shell''s main column. They\nare one column on a phone now, with the bar on its own row and the triple\nrestored at 48rem.\n\n`deferred-root.test.ts`''s first test left `root.unmount()` to a microtask\nthat ran after the test body returned, outside any act() scope, which React\nreported on every run; it is awaited inside `act()` now, and the containers\nthe file appends by hand are removed in an `afterEach` that Testing\nLibrary''s own cleanup cannot do for them.\n\nThe rest is drift and noise: the two Alerts nested under h3 subsections take\n`headingLevel={4}`; `THEME_NAMES` is pinned to the tokens package''s own\nthemes so a third one fails loudly, and the literal row count beside the\nderived assertion is gone; the compositions form drops the planning-document\nlabel from visitor copy, names its note `form-note`, is driven by\n`userEvent` like every other test here, and gains the blocker case; one\ntyped `stubHostToast()` in `test/host-toast.ts` replaces two local copies;\nthe Overview reads the Base UI range at build time and stops counting its\nconsumers; the inventory revalidates instead of bypassing the cache, drops\nan inert `rel`, and keeps the `bun run storybook` remedy out of a production\nbuild; `DOCS_VERSION` is the library''s version, which is what the stamp and\nthe portfolio''s card already showed; comments name files and spec sections\ninstead of plan task numbers; and both container smokes now stop on a\nsignal rather than cleaning up and carrying on.","tree":{"sha":"8957e9aba22bef9c1216cf4893975baa1696dc95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/8957e9aba22bef9c1216cf4893975baa1696dc95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/94ca120679f0f10f98de2d777b05cc6b6f5c1e80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju