"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/67cceb37e54fbc1caca439a397f48e3cb90cb103/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:53:30Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:53:30Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"style(ui): one rule for the two label names and the two frames\n\n.legend was a byte-for-byte copy of .label under a second name, and the two\nframes differed by one gap. Both are grouped selectors now, with .inlineFrame\noverriding the single declaration it changes. Both class names stay: a radio\ngroup''s name is a plain element rather than a <label>, and RadioGroup''s own\ntest reads it by the class that says so.","tree":{"sha":"522f0f8c79cbfc043dd13b5895fd62041fc547b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/522f0f8c79cbfc043dd13b5895fd62041fc547b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/67cceb37e54fbc1caca439a397f48e3cb90cb103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/67cceb37e54fbc1caca439a397f48e3cb90cb103","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDY3Y2NlYjM3ZTU0ZmJjMWNhY2E0MzlhMzk3ZjQ4ZTNjYjkwY2IxMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/07f299449546e4c97e20629628ab74745b56ea96","sha":"07f299449546e4c97e20629628ab74745b56ea96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/07f299449546e4c97e20629628ab74745b56ea96"}],"sha":"67cceb37e54fbc1caca439a397f48e3cb90cb103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/67cceb37e54fbc1caca439a397f48e3cb90cb103"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/07f299449546e4c97e20629628ab74745b56ea96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:52:32Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:52:32Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"refactor(ui): one control surface for the checkbox box and the radio dot\n\nThe two stylesheets restated the same twenty-odd lines: the input background,\nthe strong border, the accent fill when checked, the danger border when\ninvalid, the dimming when disabled and the motion triple. That surface is\n.controlBox in field.module.css now, worn beside each component''s own class\nthe way Select''s trigger already wears .control; the box keeps its square\ncorner and the tick colour, the dot keeps its round one. Switch''s track stays\nout on purpose — a different surface colour, no invalid state, and an\noverride that would tie on specificity across two emitted stylesheets.\n\nWith the colour gone from both component stylesheets, the dist assertion is\nback over every component stylesheet rather than Select''s alone, which is the\nclaim ruling R1 had to narrow. Measured: restoring the background to the box\nfails it.","tree":{"sha":"f1b6fe98e37db77e112b4b66e201095839e05a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/f1b6fe98e37db77e112b4b66e201095839e05a4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/07f299449546e4c97e20629628ab74745b56ea96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co