ifer-design/commits/7d6949cfaaff605102a1a43c286b7db024fdb05c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:49:55Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:49:55Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"refactor(ui): document the shared frame props once\n\nlabel, name, description, error, required and disabled were restated with\ntheir TSDoc in five interfaces, and the required paragraph — the long one\nabout Base UI''s hidden companion input and noValidate — was byte-identical\nin four of them. FieldFrameProps in Field.tsx carries the set now and the\nfive extend it, each restating only what its own anatomy rewords: every\nframe its label and its description, Switch its error, Field its name and\nits required, because Field''s control is a real input and the browser does\nreport a message on that one. The props themselves are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"3a088cd523831c4df1b1b5a512fecf92204753a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/3a088cd523831c4df1b1b5a512fecf92204753a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/7d6949cfaaff605102a1a43c286b7db024fdb05c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.g