witch one shared inline frame\n\nThe two wrote the same twenty lines around a different control: an inline\nfield root, a label wrapping the control and the text, the required mark and\nthe shared messages. That frame is InlineField in Field.tsx now, exported\nacross modules but off the barrel, exactly as FieldMessages is, and each\ncomponent is its own props plus the control it puts in the row. The rendered\nDOM is byte-identical, generated ids aside — measured on both components\nwith a description, an error and a required mark.","tree":{"sha":"e8255e75264d2de9d8a6cf1b386f636ffc0bcc56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/e8255e75264d2de9d8a6cf1b386f636ffc0bcc56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/76df3f3498fc3642d232f9c7a62d79fe7b26d4fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/76df3f3498fc3642d232f9c7a62d79fe7b26d4fa","nod