:"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/423ecee7207e0ecef018e9bd6562499a74633106/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:28:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:28:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"docs(ui): the noValidate hazard on all five, and the review''s minors\n\n`required` on `Select`, `Checkbox`, `RadioGroup` and `Switch` lands on Base UI''s\nhidden companion input, which a browser refuses to report a validation message\non — so the submit fails silently. `Field` warned about it; the four that make\nit worse now say the same thing.\n\nThe rest of the review''s minors: both trailing `not.toHaveFocus()` assertions\nassert where the focus went, so deleting the tab under test fails them; a\n`description` React rendered away as `false` no longer joins `aria-describedby`\nas an empty node; the composed form is axe''d in its error state and `Date`\njoins `TextInput`''s axe loop; the icons are sized through `> svg` like the rest\nof the library; the select surface''s comment stops claiming its rows are its\nchildren; and the inline rows record why they carry no touch-target floor.","tree":{"sha":"cec0ca8388be1a9fb18cea52090cbe32fadf6631","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/cec0ca8388be1a9fb18cea52090cbe32fadf6631"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/423ecee7207e0ecef018e9bd6562499a74633106","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/423ecee7207e0ecef018e9bd6562499a74633106","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDQyM2VjZWU3MjA3ZTBlY2VmMDE4ZTliZDY1NjI0OTlhNzQ2MzMxMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737","sha":"54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737"}],"sha":"423ecee7207e0ecef018e9bd6562499a74633106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/423ecee7207e0ecef018e9bd6562499a74633106"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:24:41Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:24:41Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(ui): dim a disabled RadioGroup''s name, and hold the required line on all five\n\nThe radio group''s name is a hand-rolled span, so nothing wrote `data-disabled`\non it and `.legend[data-disabled]` was half a dead rule: a disabled form dimmed\nfive labels and left the sixth at full contrast. It carries the attribute now,\nwith a test that fails when it is removed.\n\nRequired parity: `Switch` gains the `Required` story it lacked, so its\nrequired-mark test stops borrowing `WithError`, and `aria-required` and the\nrequired mark — real on all five frames, asserted on one — are now asserted on\n`Field`, `Select`, `RadioGroup` and `Switch` too.","tree":{"sha":"769ca30be6eb29fcb62ee795a8b3bd594c7bf2b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/769ca30be6eb29fcb62ee795a8b3bd594c7bf2b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDU0Y2U3MGQxNTM3MjBiNDFiOTkxNDAyYzQ4Mjk4NDc5M2E2NzA3Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a","sha":"8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a"}],"sha":"54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/54ce70d153720b41b991402c482984793a670737"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:23:08Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:23:18Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"refactor(ui): one-argument change callbacks across the Tier 3 controls\n\n`Select`, `RadioGroup`, `Checkbox` and `Switch` took Base UI''s\n`(value, eventDetails)` shape straight through, so four of the six controls\ndiverged from `TextInput`''s `(value)` and a consumer could not read the second\nargument without a cast. Each wrapper now adapts, and the tests assert the exact\nargument list the consumer receives, so a pass-through cannot creep back.\n\nThe composed form is the proof: the adapter''s props spread uniformly into all\nfive controls and the four hand-written lambdas are gone. `category` becomes\n`string | null` there, which is what `Select` has always spoken.","tree":{"sha":"06455258ebee11f7313cb238a7ca01bcf936f40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/06455258ebee11f7313cb238a7ca01bcf936f40d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDhmZGZhZTk3ODNiYzJjMTljNTY3OTJmNjdiYzdkNDUxNzFjYzBmMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/200cde217eefb3ba5693a17ad4dc16fd473ae561","sha":"200cde217eefb3ba5693a17ad4dc16fd473ae561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/200cde217eefb3ba5693a17ad4dc16fd473ae561"}],"sha":"8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/8fdfae9783bc2c19c56792f67bc7d45171cc0f2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/200cde217eefb3ba5693a17ad4dc16fd473ae561/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:21:05Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T02:21:05Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(ui): let Base UI own Select''s aria-invalid, and cover Home/End/Escape\n\nBase UI 1.8.0 renders `aria-invalid` on the trigger from `Field.Root invalid`,\nso the wrapper''s own attribute was dead code and the changeset''s claim that it\nis not was shipping to npm. The test that asserted it now asserts our `error` →\n`invalid` plumbing instead, and fails when `Field.Root`''s `invalid` is broken.\n\nAlso: `sideOffset` joins the library''s default of 8 (Popover, Menu, Tooltip,\nNavMenu), the `nativeLabel={false} render={<span />}` decision gets the guard it\nnever had, and Home, End and Escape join the keyboard coverage spec §9 asks for.","tree":{"sha":"f74a90e097d36ddf0fd11bcf79996b199dcdc296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/f74a90e097d36ddf0fd11bcf79996b199dcdc29