avatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/dde5022cf109874a3128b84b6d5c3fdae0f15b62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:22:29Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:22:29Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(ui): close the review findings on the toast contract, tooltip naming and popup layering\n\n- ToastManager.update() no longer accepts id, so it can''t corrupt the store; close()\n  documents that omitting toastId closes every toast.\n- Tooltip''s doc comment states the real accessible-name rule (the trigger''s own\n  aria-label wins, as IconButton''s always does) instead of the false \"never drift\"\n  claim, with a new OnIconButton story and covering test.\n- popup.module.css: .dialogLayer now shares .layer''s z-index of 50, with the comment\n  rewritten to record why DOM append order now decides stacking between them; the\n  tooltip variant''s max-width is clamped to the viewport again.\n- Popover.test.tsx: the modal test also runs axe and asserts the scrim is present, a\n  new test asserts trap-focus renders no scrim, and the modal test''s name matches what\n  it checks.\n- StatusDot''s data-hidden attribute is documented as a retained public styling hook.\n- Reflowed ToastOptions.title''s doc comment to the file''s column convention.","tr