:"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/0995f42415809393949ba6b7d9abe65259d3e57a","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDA5OTVmNDI0MTU4MDkzOTM5NDliYTZiN2Q5YWJlNjUyNTlkM2U1N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35","sha":"9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35"}],"sha":"0995f42415809393949ba6b7d9abe65259d3e57a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/0995f42415809393949ba6b7d9abe65259d3e57a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:17:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:17:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"docs(design-system): phase 4 plan B — Tier 2, the floating surfaces\n\nThirteen tasks across two repositories. Popover first and alone, because\nits popup, positioner and animation skin is what every other component\nin the tier is built from; Dialog (centre and sheet), Menu, Tooltip and\nToast follow on that skin.\n\nOpens with the visually-hidden dedup, which had grown to seven copies in\nsix files with DataTable''s second one already missing four declarations.\nTier 1 added three of those copies and this tier would have added five\nmore, so it goes first.\n\nImplements §5.3''s provider rule: the shell mounts the single toast region\nand passes a manager through the contract as an optional `hostToast`,\ndeliberately narrowed to string payloads so the contract never depends on\n@base-ui/react. Remotes branch on the presence of the manager rather than\non the `federated` flag, which is what makes standalone mode fall out\ncorrectly. Sharing @base-ui/react as a strict singleton is last and\nseparable, because the spec is explicit that sharing is a bundle-size\nchange and is not what makes toast work.\n\nNavMenu migrates onto the shared skin as its own task. It is a live\npublished component, so the plan states the delta and settles that it is\nnot breaking: the props are untouched and only the generated class name\nand the transition change.\n\nTwo ordering facts the plan turns on. A caret on a 0.x version pins the\nminor, so the new --color-scrim token means both apps must bump\n@calcifer-design/tokens, not just ui — the same trap that made 0.2.0 need\nthree deliberate consumer bumps. And the npm release approval between\nTasks 9 and 11 is the one gate CI cannot verify, because it needs a human\nwith 2FA.\n\nThe tests are written against Base UI 1.8.0 as probed in this repo''s\njsdom rather than from its documentation: focus lands a frame late\neverywhere, onOpenChange is two-argument, Toast.Close is aria-hidden\nwhile collapsed, and axe''s region rule fires on non-modal popups.","tree":{"sha":"bf07823b98e830e59afd2e24fa929e2cd290febc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/bf07823b98e830e59afd2e24fa929e2cd290febc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/9beda3cbbe80bbe889ae7d8c222fd343739efe35","node_id":"C_kwDOURhjnNoAKDliZWRhM2NiYmU4MGJiZTg4OWFlN2Q4YzIyMmZkMzQzNzM5ZWZlMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commit/99de53196680dc37993f441cbe6f7a16dcfd289e","sha":"99de53196680dc37993f441cbe6f7a16dcfd289e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/99de53196680dc37993f441cbe6f7a16dcfd289e"