ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/commits/10c97cb7383ed6526a30e80f70af362fb81d1a88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:51:09Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:51:09Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(storybook): compress and cache the container''s responses\n\nThe nginx config aliased /storybook/assets/, a directory Storybook 10 does\nnot emit — it emits JS and CSS flat at the build root plus four sb-*\ndirectories — so the location matched nothing and all 12.36 MB was served\nuncompressed with no-store on every visit.\n\nServe through root instead of alias, with the build copied into a\nstorybook/ subdirectory; turn on gzip for the MIME types nginx actually\nassigns; and mark only content-hashed filenames immutable, leaving the\nstable-named runtime revalidating so a stale preview can never pair with a\nfresh index.html.","tree":{"sha":"9b0cf2d1d1034ae36b4d9aed79730a4aa123b288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/trees/9b0cf2d1d1034ae36b4d9aed79730a4aa123b288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansrodz/calcifer-design/git/commits/10c97cb7383ed6526a30e80f70af362fb81d1a88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user