:"https://api.github.com/users/confessonline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/confessonline/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/confessonline","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-remote-mcp-servers/commits/cc180f710d8a70c598890a080b7335f3b92133a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:34:28Z","email":"121014865+confessonline@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Confess.Online"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:34:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add ai.confess.online 🤖🤖🤖 (#393)\n\n* Add ai.confess.online\n\n* Use the auth marker the endpoint check reports\n\n* Both auth markers: the handshake is open, confessing needs a machine key\n\nThe check probes initialize without a key and now gets a result, so it reads\nthe endpoint as open. tools/call still needs a machine key. One marker cannot\nsay both; the list''s own precedent is the two-marker line.\n\n* The line the machine host opens with\n\n* One marker: the handshake answers without a key\n\n* Description within 120 characters","tree":{"sha":"2b50731c19d0ea8a4bcfd9a27f47e8a825c41206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-remote-mcp-servers/git/trees/2b50731c19d0ea8a4bcfd9a27f47e8a825c41206"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-remote-mcp-servers/git/commits/cc180f710d8a70c598890a080b7335f3b92133a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b50731c19d0ea8a4bcfd9a27f47e8a825c41206\nparent 3d66d6526167967b21fba47510053aad3ba3ea93\nauthor Confess.Online <121014865+confessonline@users.noreply.github.com> 1791455668 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791455668 -0700\n\nAdd ai.confess.online 🤖🤖🤖 (#393)\n\n* Add ai.confess.online\n\n* Use the auth marker the endpoint check reports\n\n* Both auth markers: the handshake is open, confessing needs a machine key\n\nThe check probes initialize without a key and now 