.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/26873a46aacb9ba0ee88f0e027a553b7b74c839d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:30Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:30Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Tambah ''Lupa password?'' di halaman login Super Admin\n\nHalaman ini tidak pernah punya jalan pemulihan mandiri -- App A sudah\npunya sejak awal, App B tertinggal. Karena koleksi admins hanya untuk\nSuper Admin dan tidak ada ''Super Admin di atas Super Admin'' untuk\nmengatur ulang lewat panel (beda dari Guru BK yang baru dapat fitur\nitu), email reset resmi Firebase lewat sendPasswordResetEmail adalah\nsatu-satunya jalur yang mungkin di sini.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"923e80692f8de32e1c1aa8d785b8a5c6cc748119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/923e80692f8de32e1c1aa8d785b8a5c6cc748119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/26873a46aacb9ba0ee88f0e027a553b7b74c839d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-s