://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/028114f14b9bc8aae7d7f156012d7f38ea02a003/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:22Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:22Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Perbaiki zona waktu, nuansa warna mati, dan validasi kursor API\n\nZona waktu (lib/waktu.ts baru di kedua app): tanggal/jam sebelumnya\ndiformat toLocaleString(''id-ID'') tanpa zona, mengikuti jam MESIN\nPERENDER. App A dirender server (UTC) lalu dihidrasi browser (WIB) --\njam pesan sempat tertulis 7 jam lebih awal lalu berkedip benar saat\nhidrasi. App B dirender penuh di server tanpa hidrasi ulang, jadi\naudit log, run retensi terakhir, cap ekspor Excel/PDF, dan tanggal\ntopbar meleset 7 jam TANPA ada tanda kesalahan sama sekali. Kedua\nmodul dipatok ke Asia/Jakarta.\n\nNuansa warna yang tidak pernah menghasilkan CSS: brand-200/300/800/900\ndi App A dan admin-100/200/300/800 di App B dipakai di banyak\nkomponen tapi tidak pernah didefinisikan di palet -- Tailwind diam-diam\ntidak menghasilkan kelas untuk itu (border jadi abu-abu bawaan, avatar\ntopbar App B tanpa latar & tanpa warna huruf sama sekali). Ditambahkan\nmengikuti tangga warna yang sama dengan nuansa yang sudah ada.\n\n/api/guru/tickets: parameter lastCreatedAt yang bukan angka (mis.\n?lastCreatedAt=abc) sebelumnya membuat Timestamp.fromMillis(NaN)\nmelempar error tak tertangani (500). Sekarang divalidasi dan ditolak\nrapi dengan 400.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7af9d29cde040c8fe819e074c803ce8d1ec1974d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/7af9d29cde040c8fe819e074c803ce8d1ec1974d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/028114f14b9bc8aae7d7f156012d7f38ea02a003","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/028114f14b9bc8aae7d7f156012d7f38ea02a003","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKDAyODExNGYxNGI5YmM4YWFlN2Q3ZjE1NjAxMmQ3ZjM4ZWEwMmEwMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad","sha":"692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad"}],"sha":"028114f14b9bc8aae7d7f156012d7f38ea02a003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/028114f14b9bc8aae7d7f156012d7f38ea02a003"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:02Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:02:02Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Tambah ''Atur Ulang Password'' Guru BK di panel Super Admin\n\nServer Action resetPasswordGuruAction memasang password baru lewat\nadminAuth.updateUser() pada UID yang sama, jadi penugasan tiket dan\nlangganan notifikasi guru itu tetap utuh -- beda dari jalan memutar\nhapus-lalu-buat-ulang akun yang sebelumnya satu-satunya opsi lewat\npanel dan menghasilkan UID baru.\n\nDilengkapi penjaga UID (menolak UID yang bukan Guru BK terdaftar,\nsupaya action ini tidak bisa dipakai mengganti password akun mana\npun di proyek), pencabutan sesi yang sedang berjalan, dan audit log\nyang membaca nama dari Firestore (bukan dari argumen pemanggilan).\n\nTurut membetulkan cincin fokus ConfirmDialog yang mati\n(focus:ring-brand-500 -- App B tidak punya warna ''brand'' sama\nsekali, seharusnya ring-admin-500).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e4e919d77944b97125c9c298c6ed28477265b40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/1e4e919d77944b97125c9c298c6ed28477265b40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKDY5MmJkNDA3ZDVhMjg3MzUxZmViOTY5Y2RiYjI3ODY4NGJiNDdhYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56","sha":"f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56"}],"sha":"692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/692bd407d5a287351feb969cdbb278684bb47aad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:01:52Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:01:52Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Redesign halaman login Guru BK\n\nKartu login dengan ikon bulat, kolom isian berikon (amplop, gembok),\ntombol Lihat/Sembunyikan password, dan tautan ''Lupa password?'' yang\nmemanggil sendPasswordResetEmail langsung. Sebelumnya form polos\ntanpa jalan pemulihan mandiri kalau lupa password.\n\nTombol ''Masuk dengan Google'' sempat ditambahkan lalu dihapus lagi\ndalam pengerjaan ini: penyedia Google tidak pernah diaktifkan di\nproyek Firebase, dan tombol yang selalu menjawab\nauth/operation-not-allowed lebih membingungkan guru daripada tidak\nada sama sekali. Riwayat itu tidak tersisa di kode akhir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81f68d7af5d447e427fdd3ed3f0412f6ed9001cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/81f68d7af5d447e427fdd3ed3f0412f6ed9001cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKGY2NjUxMTAxYTVmNDBjNTY0MjdiNGQ0M2Q2YzZlNzQ2NjcyMjZjNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175","sha":"fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175"}],"sha":"f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/f6651101a5f40c56427b4d43d6c6e74667226c56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:01:42Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:01:42Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Redesign panel Guru BK jadi tata letak 3 kolom yang responsif\n\n- Layout baru guru/(panel): daftar curhatan, ruang chat, dan panel\n  samping (piket, prioritas, ringkasan status) hidup satu layar,\n  mengikuti pola aplikasi chat. Sebelumnya /guru dan /guru/[kode]\n  dua halaman terpisah dengan daftar tiket satu kolom.\n- Daftar curhatan (DaftarCurhatan.tsx) dan panel samping\n  (PanelSamping.tsx) baru, dibungkus GuruShell yang menyesuaikan\n  jumlah kolom per breakpoint (1 kolom di HP, 2 di tablet, 3 di\n  desktop lebar).\n- ChatThread direstyle dari tema gelap ke terang supaya menyatu\n  dengan panel guru yang seluruhnya terang; ditambah prop\n  tampilkanHeader untuk menghindari judul ganda saat dipakai di\n  dalam kartu info tiket.\n- TicketRow dipindah ke types/ticket.ts sebagai tipe bersama.\n- TicketListClient.tsx & halaman guru lama dihapus, digantikan\n  komponen di atas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6fee98f4d888f8f4ac270b7054784f6bc486ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/e6fee98f4d888f8f4ac270b7054784f6bc486ec6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKGZlM2ZiNWUxYjgwMjE1N2JkNGY5ZGFiZTlkODdlNTgwODliMzMxNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a","sha":"a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a"}],"sha":"fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/fe3fb5e1b802157bd4f9dabe9d87e58089b33175"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:18:53Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:18:58Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Fix ticket-takeover, rate-limit bypass, and pagination/UX regressions in App A\n\nSecurity:\n- Stop showing Nama Samaran alongside Kode Konseling on the guru ticket\n  detail page — together they were exactly the two factors\n  resetPasswordSiswaAction checks, letting any guru who opened a ticket\n  reset and take over that student''s account.\n- Revoke all existing student sessions (sesiSiswa cleared) when a password\n  is reset, so a prior takeover (or a borrowed device) doesn''t keep access\n  after the password changes.\n- Replace client-cookie-based attempt limiting (bypassable by not storing\n  cookies, e.g. curl) with a server-side, target-keyed limiter backed by\n  Firestore for cek-balasan, lupa-password, and lupa-kode.\n- lupa-kode: reject ambiguous matches (more than one ticket matching the\n  same nama samaran + password) instead of returning every matching code,\n  and cut the candidate pool bcrypt has to walk per request.\n- Move the Kode Konseling handoff from cek-balasan to lupa-password off the\n  URL (was a query param, landing in browser history/referrers) into a\n  one-time sessionStorage handoff.\n- Use timing-safe comparison for the retensi cron secret and the legacy\n  session token fallback.\n\nFunctional regressions:\n- /api/guru/tickets (the \"load more\" pagination endpoint) now normalizes\n  kategori and computes prioritas the same way the first page does — it\n  previously always returned prioritas: false and could crash on\n  pre-multi-kategori tickets.\n- Fix \"Tugas Saya\" pagination to cursor off the raw (unfiltered) page\n  instead of the already-filtered list, so it no longer refetches the same\n  50 rows forever or hides the \"load more\" button entirely for guru with\n  a small assigned-ticket count.\n\nUX:\n- Keep the Turnstile consent widget mounted (hidden via CSS) instead of\n  unmounting it once the curhat form appears, so long-form submissions no\n  longer fail against an expired token and lose the student''s writing.\n- cek-balasan now checks the server-side session on load, so \"Buka\n  Percakapan Sekarang\" after a password reset opens the conversation\n  directly instead of bouncing back to a login form.\n- Serve the homepage background photo from a cacheable image route instead\n  of inlining it as base64 in force-dynamic HTML on every visit.\n- Pause chat polling while the tab is hidden.\n- Fix JamLayananBadge''s \"besok pagi\" copy for Friday evening/Saturday\n  (next business day is Monday), add periodic refresh, and reserve layout\n  space to avoid shifting content.\n- Fix EmergencyButton stealing focus on initial page load.\n- Add autoComplete/aria-pressed to the password-reset form, and a note that\n  nama samaran doubles as a recovery credential.\n- Update stale post-curhat copy that contradicted the new password-reset\n  feature.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c803e4f5c13e6fa2afd5a45ea1451792a3fcacc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/3c803e4f5c13e6fa2afd5a45ea1451792a3fcacc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKGExYmMxMGM4NDAzZjMyMWJlOTY4YWU2ZTZhZTk4M2Y0ZTQyMzdhNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a","sha":"2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a"}],"sha":"a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a1bc10c8403f321be968ae6e6ae983f4e4237a5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:48Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:48Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Rapikan UI beranda, consent gate, dan komponen bersama\n\nTambah komponen Button standar supaya gaya tombol seragam, dan\nJamLayananBadge yang menampilkan jam layanan WIB (07.30, Senin-Jumat).\n\nBeranda diringkas: tiga kartu info dihapus. ConsentGate di CurhatFlow\ndipadatkan dari lima poin jadi tiga poin berbullet plus badge jam\nlayanan; pemanggilan TurnstileWidget tidak diubah. EmergencyButton,\nLogoutButton, CekBalasanFlow, ConfirmDialog, dan layout ikut\ndisesuaikan.\n\nSekalian hapus dua berkas tak terpakai: package-lock.json di root\n(hanya stub kosong, tiap app punya lockfile sendiri) dan foto gedung\nsekolah yang tidak dirujuk dari mana pun.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"908d4e68718c5e05ebd5061a66725281bf834165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/908d4e68718c5e05ebd5061a66725281bf834165"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKDI4NDdlMDliZTFlOWI3NTBhZjk5ODA0ZTZkNGUxZjhkZTFlMTNiMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3","sha":"a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3"}],"sha":"2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/2847e09be1e9b750af99804e6d4e1f8de1e13b1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:44Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:44Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Pindahkan daftar tiket guru ke komponen client dengan pagination\n\nHalaman /guru sebelumnya memuat dan mengolah seluruh daftar tiket di\nserver (~87 baris logika). Sekarang halaman itu tipis, dan daftar tiket\nditangani TicketListClient yang mengambil data bertahap 50 per halaman\nlewat endpoint baru /api/guru/tickets.\n\nEndpoint dilindungi getAuthenticatedGuru, dan cursor pagination memakai\nFirestore Timestamp (bukan Date biasa) supaya startAfter() akurat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67c295187c940078a5b01e36e63882835d6e30ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/67c295187c940078a5b01e36e63882835d6e30ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKGE4OTBhODBhZTAzMWJhNmRlMDQ1ZGI1MTIzZDgyZmJhN2UxNzczYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727","sha":"696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727"}],"sha":"a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/a890a80ae031ba6de045db5123d82fba7e1773c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commits/696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:34Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:46:38Z","email":"dikyridho05@gmail.com","name":"dikyridho05"},"message":"Tambah fitur lupa password siswa\n\nSiswa yang lupa password bisa memulihkan aksesnya dengan membuktikan\nkepemilikan tiket lewat Kode Konseling + Nama Samaran, lalu langsung\nmembuat password baru dan otomatis masuk ke percakapannya.\n\nServer action dilindungi rate limit (maks 5 percobaan / 10 menit) dan\npesan error dibuat seragam supaya tidak membocorkan apakah sebuah kode\nbenar-benar ada. Password baru disimpan lewat hashPassword.\n\nLupaKodeFlow ikut disesuaikan agar kedua alur pemulihan konsisten.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"086865349ba64aadfc2b78b7ea2cddbf2aa1eef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/086865349ba64aadfc2b78b7ea2cddbf2aa1eef2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/696e47803813f8c1f6d752071adc6d07c12f2727","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKDY5NmU0NzgwMzgxM2Y4YzFmNmQ3NTIwNzFhZGM2ZDA3