 (judul/pesan) — konsisten\ndengan prinsip privasi di getStatistikCurhatan(). Hapus tiket memakai\nrecursiveDelete() per kode, pola yang sama seperti retensi otomatis, jadi\nsubcollection pesan ikut terhapus. Setiap penghapusan dicatat ke audit log.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"581c79235e54003a41a3422d01324c388d37daf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/trees/581c79235e54003a41a3422d01324c388d37daf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/git/commits/d55ee34fc4de884d6ec5775b8b0f047e58e8e036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307681051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it","id":307681051,"login":"dikyridho05-ship-it","node_id":"U_kgDOElbXGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dikyridho05-ship-it","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dikyridho05-ship-it/ruang-aman-bk/commit/d55ee34fc4de884d6ec5775b8b0f047e58e8e036","node_id":"C_kwDOUR4Q39oAKGQ1NWVlMzRmYzRkZTg4NGQ2ZWM1Nzc1YjhiMGYwNDdlNThlOGUwMzY","parents":[{