api.github.com/users/MahadShehzad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MahadShehzad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MahadShehzad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MahadShehzad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MahadShehzad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MahadShehzad/Enterprise-System/commits/669c6d1a99450ba4a17fe20156122008ced7255d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:13:20Z","email":"immahad77@gmail.com","name":"Mahad Shehzad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T08:13:20Z","email":"immahad77@gmail.com","name":"Mahad Shehzad"},"message":"Add SQL Server backend: ASP.NET Core API + EF Core, wire Angular to it\n\n- server/: ASP.NET Core 10 Web API, EF Core, SQL Server (AcmeAdmin db).\n  Entities + DbContext + Seed (mirrors the old mock data). Controllers for\n  auth, bootstrap, employees, departments, meetings, projects, leave, users,\n  tenants. Migrations auto-apply on startup.\n- Angular: provideHttpClient + app initializer that loads GET /api/bootstrap\n  into DataStoreService signals; every mutation calls the API and patches the\n  signal from the response. AuthService.login -> POST /api/auth/login.\n- proxy.conf.json routes /api to :5103; angular.json serve uses it.\n- Replaced core/data/mock-data.ts with nav-catalogue.ts (static menu config).\n- npm scripts: api, db:update, dev (runs API + web via concurrently).\n\nVerified: db seeded (10 employees etc.), login + CRUD round-trip to SQL Server,\nedit persists across a page reload. ng build / ng test / dotnet build all pass.","tree":{"sha":"366ff52f1f728379a78767ce173b42c00d7fab86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MahadShehzad/Enterprise-System/git/trees/366ff52f1f728379a78767ce173b42c00d7fab86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MahadShehzad/Enterprise-System/git/commits/669c6d1a99450ba4a17fe20156122008ced725