","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/a746da4b4f74831aca7299ddb7b2a46b40a24ca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:21:02Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:21:02Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"demo: bump security to 1.3.0 — verifying the client-side refetch fix\n\nWith a tab open on the build that has the client-side navigation refetch\n(previous commit), checking whether an ordinary in-app click now shows\nthis without any reload.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4c64a406c29c76d4fe940558a16eb53a082e0db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/c4c64a406c29c76d4fe940558a16eb53a082e0db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/a746da4b4f74831aca7299ddb7b2a46b40a24ca0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/a746da4b4f74831aca7299ddb7b2a46b40a24ca0","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGE3NDZkYTRiNGY3NDgzMWFjYTcyOTlkZGI3YjJhNDZiNDBhMjRjYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9","sha":"7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9"}],"sha":"a746da4b4f74831aca7299ddb7b2a46b40a24ca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/a746da4b4f74831aca7299ddb7b2a46b40a24ca0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:19:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:19:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix: client-side refetch on navigation (shouldRevalidate did not fix it)\n\nFollow-up to the previous commit: deployed shouldRevalidate, kept a tab\nopen on the fixed build, bumped security to 1.2.0, clicked an ordinary\nin-app link. Network trace still showed only\n`/payments?__loader=__app%2Fpayments%2Fpage&__ssrDirect=true` — the shared\n__app layout loader still never re-ran, and the sidebar still showed\nsecurity''s *previous* version. Modern.js''s route codegen does wire up a\nper-route shouldRevalidate, but whatever decides which routeIds go into\nthat single __loader query value isn''t consulting it for this SSR-direct\nnavigation path.\n\nGiven a framework internal that doesn''t behave as documented isn''t worth\nchasing further, moved the fix to something directly verifiable: AppSidebar\nnow keeps a small bit of client-side state for remoteVersions (seeded from\nthe server-rendered value, so the first paint is still SSR''d) and\nre-fetches it client-side on every pathname change via a plain useEffect —\nindependent of whatever the router''s revalidation heuristic decides.\nshell''s own version doesn''t need this (build-time constant).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"613172e714786a25bdc7e486caa94f203088231b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/613172e714786a25bdc7e486caa94f203088231b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDdlM2YyOThlMWVlZjliYzVhYzFlYWVkZGUwMzNmMzA4ZmI3MDNmZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c","sha":"536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c"}],"sha":"7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/7e3f298e1eef9bc5ac1eaedde033f308fb703ff9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:15:23Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:15:23Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"demo: bump security to 1.2.0 — second-order test of the revalidation fix\n\nWith a tab already open on the *fixed* shell build (shouldRevalidate on\n__app/layout.data.ts, previous commit), this checks whether an ordinary\nin-app click now shows this without any reload at all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80fa483d48f9dd2b274a230f9851b846b237d4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/80fa483d48f9dd2b274a230f9851b846b237d4dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDUzNmY1NDUyN2Y5NWQ3ZGI1YTNhMDMyNjcwYjEyYWY0ZTdjODY4M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2","sha":"165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2"}],"sha":"536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/536f54527f95d7db5a3a032670b12af4e7c8683c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:14:13Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:14:13Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix: shared layout data went stale on in-app navigation (needed a hard refresh)\n\nVerified live: kept a browser tab open from before deploying security''s\n1.1.0 bump, then clicked an ordinary in-app link (Overview -> Accounts, no\nreload — confirmed via performance.getEntriesByType(''navigation'').length\nstaying at 1). The request Modern.js''s router made was:\n\n  GET /accounts?__loader=__app%2Faccounts%2Fpage&__ssrDirect=true\n\n— naming only the leaf route''s loader, never __app/layout. So everything\nthat lives on the shared layout loader (remote versions, the entitlements\nbadge, notifications, unreadCount) stayed frozen at whatever it was on the\nlast full page load, no matter how much in-app navigation happened after —\nexactly what was reported: the sidebar didn''t show security''s new version\nwithout a hard refresh.\n\nFix: `export const shouldRevalidate = () => true;` in __app/layout.data.ts\nforces that loader to re-run on every navigation, matching how the leaf\nroutes already behave by default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c9e0cc76e4160fc92982aabc12eae13d544ff7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/2c9e0cc76e4160fc92982aabc12eae13d544ff7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDE2NWM3ZGYxNjlmMGIxZTEwZmU2MTc0N2U4M2FiNDM4YjRkNzViZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd","sha":"460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd"}],"sha":"165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/165c7df169f0b1e10fe61747e83ab438b4d75be2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:11:09Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:11:09Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"demo: bump security to 1.1.0 — another solo remote release\n\nVerifying that a remote''s version shows up in the sidebar footer through a\nnormal in-app navigation, not just a hard refresh — the shared __app layout\nloader (shell/src/routes/__app/layout.data.ts) has no shouldRevalidate\noverride, so React Router''s default data-router behavior re-runs it on\nevery client-side navigation, fetching each remote''s manifest fresh every\ntime. This commit changes nothing but security/package.json''s version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44e28563ce0398d76c9fc02182910f4d64235886","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/44e28563ce0398d76c9fc02182910f4d64235886"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDQ2MDMzNjkwOWVlNmYyM2U4MTRlZTgyMTRkNTQxMTc2NmZmYjUxZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642","sha":"9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642"}],"sha":"460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/460336909ee6f23e814ee8214d5411766ffb51fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:07:16Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:07:16Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat: show shell + remote versions persistently in the sidebar footer\n\nMoves version display out of the \"How this page was rendered\" popover\n(hidden behind a click) into the sidebar footer (always on screen):\n\n  Versions\n  shell      v1.0.0\n  accounts   v1.1.0\n  payments   v1.0.0\n  security   v1.0.0\n  twofactor  v1.0.0\n\n- shell/modern.config.ts: SHELL_VERSION compiled in at build time via\n  source.define (from shell/package.json) — the production image never\n  ships package.json, only .output/, so this can''t be a runtime file read.\n  Displaying the shell''s own version costs nothing (no fetch).\n- __app/layout.data.ts: fetchRemoteVersions() moved back into the loader,\n  server-side, eager. This reverses the previous lazy-on-popover-open\n  change on purpose — that optimization was for a rarely-opened debug\n  panel; a value that''s now always on screen belongs in the first\n  server-rendered HTML, not a post-hydration client round trip.\n- render-stamp.tsx: reverted to just the SSR/CSR comparison tool it was\n  before — the version list doesn''t belong in two places at once (that\n  would double the already-not-free no-cache fetch again).\n- app-sidebar.tsx: renders the versions block in SidebarFooter, hidden\n  when the sidebar is collapsed to icon-only.\n- Docs + README updated to point at the sidebar instead of the popover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"717d05bdb80d259bb3945e67807c89d5758ba882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/717d05bdb80d259bb3945e67807c89d5758ba882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDkxNDRkYmY1NTU0NDljNjRmYThiNmZjNzBiZjQ5N2QxNzJjN2E2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1","sha":"5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1"}],"sha":"9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9144dbf555449c64fa8b6fc70bf497d172c7a642"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:46:41Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:46:41Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"perf: fetch remote versions lazily (client, on popover open) not on every nav\n\nmf-manifest.json is Cache-Control: no-cache by design (§08a) — a genuine\nnetwork round trip every time, no ETag/Last-Modified from the origin to\nmake that revalidation cheap. Measured on prod: MF''s own SSR resolution\nalready re-fetches each remote''s manifest + remoteEntry.js on every full\npage load (confirmed via container request logs, no in-process caching\nacross requests) — and the version-display feature added on top of that\nwas silently *doubling* the manifest fetch count, server-side, on every\nsingle __app navigation, for a debug popover almost nobody opens.\n\nMoved fetchRemoteVersions() out of the layout loader entirely. It''s now\nplain (no server-only env-var dependency — takes {name, origin}[]) and\nruns client-side, once, only when the \"How this page was rendered\" popover\nactually opens (mirrors the existing lazy \"Compare\" button in the same\ncomponent). layout.data.ts now exposes `remotes: {name, origin}[]` instead\nof a separate remoteOrigins/remoteVersions pair — one source of truth for\nboth the preconnect hints and the popover''s fetch target. Removed the now-\nunused remoteOrigins() helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4accd90920276e35a71ef28079281973bade94d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/4accd90920276e35a71ef28079281973bade94d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDVlOTY1Y2RhMDU1YmIwMjkyZDQwZGU5ZDQ1N2MwZjViMDAyZWRmYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/b6d08ca89fc22307643d9c1d5aa1ce83adb911f7","sha":"b6d08ca89fc22307643d9c1d5aa1ce83adb911f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/b6d08ca89fc22307643d9c1d5aa1ce83adb911f7"}],"sha":"5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/5e965cda055bb0292d40de9d457c0f5b002edfb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/b6d08ca89fc22307643d9c1d5aa1ce83adb911f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:35:45Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:35:45Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix: the cache-header fix itself was silently inert (stale Docker bind mount)\n\ndeploy/Caddyfile was `./Caddyfile:/etc/caddy/Caddyfile:ro` — a *single-file*\nbind mount. Those pin to the host file''s inode at container-create time;\n`deploy/up.sh`''s `git reset --hard` replaces the file (new inode) rather\nthan editing it in place, so the caddy container kept serving the Caddyfile\nfrom whenever it was first created, weeks ago — `caddy reload` \"succeeded\"\nevery deploy against content that never actually changed. Confirmed via\n`caddy adapt`''s compiled JSON having zero `\"handler\": \"headers\"` entries\neven though the Caddyfile parsed without any error.\n\nFix: Caddyfile moves into its own deploy/caddy/ folder, mounted as a\n*directory* (./caddy:/etc/caddy:ro) instead of a single file — directory\nmounts re-resolve on every access, so `caddy reload` (added in the previous\ncommit) now actually sees what''s on disk.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bc8833b2606bbcb2a09393f6dd6a6299d3f4d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/4bc8833b2606bbcb2a09393f6dd6a6299d3f4d8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/b6d08ca89fc22307643d9c1d5aa1ce83adb911f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use