s://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/f7e7f783a37525690af2d4d6f242d222905d5772/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:24:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:24:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"demo: bump accounts to 1.1.0 — a solo remote release\n\nNothing else changed. This is the live proof for docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §08a:\nafter this deploys, the shell''s \"How this page was rendered\" popover should\nshow accounts v1.1.0 while payments/security/twofactor/shell are still\nwhatever they were — and their containers shouldn''t even recreate, since\nDocker''s layer cache gives them an identical image digest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2140e66af9e6dc2084259e8c329a7b2e0db44d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/e2140e66af9e6dc2084259e8c329a7b2e0db44d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/f7e7f783a37525690af2d4d6f242d222905d5772","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/f7e7f783a37525690af2d4d6f242d222905d5772","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGY3ZTdmNzgzYTM3NTI1NjkwYWYyZDRkNmYyNDJkMjIyOTA1ZDU3NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c","sha":"df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c"}],"sha":"f7e7f783a37525690af2d4d6f242d222905d5772","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/f7e7f783a37525690af2d4d6f242d222905d5772"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:24:38Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:24:38Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat: independent per-app versioning + correct Module Federation cache policy\n\nAnswers \"how do you version remotes separately and avoid stale-cache bugs\":\n\n- deploy/Caddyfile: split Cache-Control by path, same on all 5 hosts.\n  remoteEntry.js and mf-manifest.json are the two *fixed*-name files a shell\n  (or another remote) uses to discover a remote — they get `no-cache`, always\n  revalidated. Everything else under /static/* is Rspack-hashed by content —\n  a new build is a new URL — so it gets `public, max-age=31536000, immutable`.\n  Previously neither file shape set Cache-Control at all.\n- deploy/up.sh: reload Caddy on every deploy (`caddy reload --config`) — the\n  Caddyfile is bind-mounted, so `docker compose up` alone won''t pick up a\n  content-only change to it.\n- scripts/gen-package-json.mjs: never reset an app''s package.json \"version\"\n  on regen — only fill it in the first time the file doesn''t exist. Module\n  Federation reads that version straight into mf-manifest.json\n  (metaData.buildInfo.buildVersion) with zero extra config, so this is what\n  lets accounts ship 1.4.0 while shell/payments/security/twofactor haven''t\n  rebuilt and still say whatever they were.\n- shell/src/lib/remote-versions.ts (new): server-side fetch of each remote''s\n  mf-manifest.json, same file MF''s own runtime already reads to resolve a\n  remote. Wired into the __app layout loader and surfaced in the existing\n  \"How this page was rendered\" popover — a live, provable list of what\n  version of each remote is actually running, not a claim in a doc.\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md + architecture.html: new §08a covering both halves,\n  plus a pass fixing pre-existing drift in the Deploy section (stale \"four\n  apps\"/\"three remotes\" counts predating twofactor, a stale SSR-federation\n  \"known limitation\" callout superseded by the vendored MF patch, a garbled\n  table cell, wrong npm-script descriptions) and the §02 composition diagram\n  (missing twofactor entirely, and mis-attributing its exposed modules to\n  security).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58985dcaaded74db8a6780d3260a1491d90f7755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/58985dcaaded74db8a6780d3260a1491d90f7755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGRmMGU5MzdmMjY5MDFkMzVkMDA1MmEzOGVjZTU1NzMyODUwOWI0NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54","sha":"0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54"}],"sha":"df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/df0e937f26901d35d0052a38ece557328509b44c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T21:06:39Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T21:06:39Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix: patch out @modern-js/runtime''s stray console.info on every navigation\n\n@modern-js/runtime@3.5.0 ships a leftover `console.info(\"args\", t)` inside\n`mergeLoaderDataStr` — the inline script it streams for deferred loader\ndata. It fired in the browser console on every navigation that used\n`defer()` (`[info] args {0: ''__app/page'', 1: ''cashflow''}` …), and\n`output.performance.removeConsole` can''t reach it because it lives in a\nstring literal inside the framework, not in app code.\n\nVendored patch strips the call from all three dist builds (cjs / esm /\nesm-node). Wired into scripts/gen-package-json.mjs alongside the existing\nmodule-federation patch; applied to all five apps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a3aa89e826707aedc1dfbbcd691b356b7595947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/0a3aa89e826707aedc1dfbbcd691b356b7595947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDAzMTQ1MTUxMjhkZTk5NGRhYzZmOWZhY2UyOTliOWU3YWJkY2RkNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3","sha":"16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3"}],"sha":"0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/0314515128de994dac6f9face299b9e7abdcdd54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T20:52:47Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T20:52:47Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"chore: drop deprecated tsconfig baseUrl\n\nTypeScript 5.9 warns that `baseUrl` stops working in TS 7.0. The `@/*`\npath mapping already uses `./src/*` (resolved relative to tsconfig since\nTS 4.1), and Modern.js defaults baseUrl to the tsconfig directory for its\nRspack alias — so removing the line is a no-op. Verified: typecheck +\n`modern build` clean on shell and twofactor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a64e72564cc2353070fc48540495e23f5b7627ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/a64e72564cc2353070fc48540495e23f5b7627ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDE2YTQxN2M3MTM0YzgxZDRiZTY4YmYxYWQ2Yzg5YTYzYzUyMWMwYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/e05fce786ac99fc0620ebbc1db1a0c08be46f07b","sha":"e05fce786ac99fc0620ebbc1db1a0c08be46f07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/e05fce786ac99fc0620ebbc1db1a0c08be46f07b"}],"sha":"16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/16a417c7134c81d4be68bf1ad6c89a63c521c0c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/e05fce786ac99fc0620ebbc1db1a0c08be46f07b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T20:14:36Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T20:14:36Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"chore: delete dead code across all five apps\n\n- Remove 66 unused shadcn/ui primitives (checkbox, collapsible, form,\n  input-otp, scroll-area, select, table, tabs, textarea, dialog, sidebar,\n  command, popover, sheet, chart, skeleton, … — per app, only what nothing\n  imports). Verified by a fixpoint reference scan + `tsc` on all 5 apps.\n- Drop `mock/session.ts` from the remotes: they have no auth and never\n  imported it. Removed from `scripts/sync-mock.mjs` (shell-only now).\n- Delete orphaned `hooks/use-mobile.ts` (only `ui/sidebar` used it) and\n  `lib/ssr.ts` (shell-only concept) from the remotes; delete the unused\n  `patterns/charts.tsx` + `patterns/skeletons.tsx` copies in payments/security.\n- shell/mock/session.ts: drop the unused `cleared*Cookie` helpers, un-export\n  cookie-name constants + `readEntitlementOverride` (internal only), inline the\n  one-use `PendingLogin` type.\n- Remove 8 no-op `getSession(request);` calls from `__app` child loaders —\n  `__app/layout.data.ts` already guards the whole subtree.\n- Drop unused kit exports (`SectionTitle`, `CardsRowSkeleton`, `useChangingPage`)\n  and an unused `TabsContent` import.\n\nNet: 98 files, +22 / -9061. No behaviour change; typecheck + mock sync clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2539a673d7d3e4c66ac15e42dd87b446bbe29d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/c2539a673d7d3e4c66ac15e42dd87b446bbe29d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/e05fce786ac99fc0620ebbc1db1a0c08be46f07b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","rece