ub.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/3a45b1e6ec54dfd8c4f54da24de5d2b5f4945243/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:51:04Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:51:04Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"simplify: remove the Federation Lab, slim the entitlements plumbing\n\nThe lab page didn''t change how remotes load (it can''t — SSR federation needs\nbuild-time remotes) and only added confusion. Removed the route, the \"Lab\"\nsidebar group and command-menu entry, and remoteRegistry().\n\nEntitlements, trimmed to the essentials:\n- no more /entitlements resource route — the toggle POSTs to the Settings\n  action (intent=entitlements), which redirects back\n- no more top-bar popover — a plain count badge that links to Settings\n- EntitlementToggles drops the optimistic state machine; switches reflect the\n  loader, the redirect refreshes them\n- reverted the startTransition-on-mount workarounds (only needed with the 5th\n  header control, now gone)\n\nFeature is unchanged: pick a persona at sign-in, flip grants in Settings, shell\n+ remotes react. Docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0a49bbf5cfaa2ccc96e928915ed432d19090b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/a0a49bbf5cfaa2ccc96e928915ed432d19090b57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/3a45b1e6ec54dfd8c4f54da24de5d2b5f4945243","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakan