gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/265289545287427a0f9b971f71ca0ff2eae5ce6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T05:28:25Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T05:28:25Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"entitlements: redirect after toggle + resilient <Await> (local black screen)\n\nOn local dev (full mock latency) toggling a switch fired an in-place\nrevalidation that aborted still-streaming defer() promises; the rejection hit\nthe route boundary, and error.tsx then rendered the {message,stack} object into\na <p>, which blanked the page.\n\n- /entitlements action now redirects back to the current path (`from`) — a\n  clean navigation re-runs loaders without aborting in-flight defers.\n- error.tsx coerces any error value to a string before rendering.\n- every streamed <Await> gets an errorElement (<AwaitError>, degrade + Retry)\n  so one section can''t take down the route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f6e975b54508efc67001ce346ddb569e08144d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/7f6e975b54508efc67001ce346ddb569e08144d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/265289545287427a0f9b971f71ca0ff2eae5ce6a","verific