"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/8b32a5e1af8b8d7e5a376541151cb91a71a633ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:42:01Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:42:01Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat: entitlement personas — host→shell→remote grants, live toggles\n\nSign-in now picks one of two personas (Premier: all grants / Personal: core\nbanking only). getSession() resolves persona defaults, optionally overridden by\na persona-scoped bank_entitlements cookie. The app layout puts the effective\nEntitlement[] into a context; useCan() gates shell nav + route guards, and the\nshell route wrappers pass plain booleans (allowInternal, allowRecurring,\nallowExport, allowAdvanced, cards.virtual) to the router-free remote views, which\ndefault them to true so the standalone apps are unchanged. `wealth` also filters\nthe investment account server-side (accounts/data recomputes net worth).\n\n- 7 flags in src/mock/types.ts; PERSONAS in src/mock/seed.ts (synced).\n- Top-bar Entitlements popover + Settings card → action-only /entitlements route\n  rewrites the cookie; React Router revalidation re-renders the tree, no reload.\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §05a + architecture.html flow diagram + persona matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fff4475339e8db92b27e974b6bda26c982082f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/fff4475339e8db92b27e974b6bda26c982082f75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/8b32a5e1af8b8d7e5a376541151cb91a71a633ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/8b32a5e1af8b8d7e5a376541151cb91a71a633ea","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDhiMzJhNWUxYWY4YjhkN2U1YTM3NjU0MTE1MWNiOTFhNzFhNjMzZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b","sha":"dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b"}],"sha":"8b32a5e1af8b8d7e5a376541151cb91a71a633ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/8b32a5e1af8b8d7e5a376541151cb91a71a633ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:59:29Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:59:29Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"deploy: build the shell from repo root so cross-remote @source works\n\nshell/src/styles.css @source-scans ../../accounts/src (etc.) so Tailwind emits\nthe utility classes the federated remote views use. With the shell''s Docker\ncontext set to shell/ only, those paths pointed outside the context and Tailwind\nsilently skipped them — every remote-only class (container queries, rarer\nutilities) was missing from the shell''s stylesheet on the VM deploy.\n\ndeploy/Dockerfile.shell builds with context=repo root and recreates the sibling\nsrc layout (/accounts/src etc.) so the relative @source paths resolve. Root\n.dockerignore keeps that context lean. The four remotes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67d6c91e109b86ec292872f911141d5285267ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/67d6c91e109b86ec292872f911141d5285267ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGRjNWU4NzVlNDZhYzdkMGYxZTM1OGI4YjViYzQ2MzMyYTZmNGEwMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/5dede9a760d36d5ce38dd1b1b0a46736a21da51f","sha":"5dede9a760d36d5ce38dd1b1b0a46736a21da51f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/5dede9a760d36d5ce38dd1b1b0a46736a21da51f"}],"sha":"dc5e875e46ac7d0f1e358b8b5bc46332a6f4a00b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ha