.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/13d884ed3e41f9a938647db2073e1791373fd8f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:44:35Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:44:35Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(accounts): tolerate an accounts remote that predates loadRecentActivity\n\nRender deploys all services in parallel; if the shell goes live a few seconds\nbefore the accounts remote, its MF runtime caches the old data module (no\nloadRecentActivity) and every /accounts render throws until the shell restarts.\nThe loader now feature-detects the export and streams an empty list otherwise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"984836a4a98508d98ebba99889980c8219d05eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/984836a4a98508d98ebba99889980c8219d05eed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/13d884ed3e41f9a938647db2073e1791373fd8f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":