.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/106d1a3374d1786b9c95360acc3e182e5257488d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:41:00Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:41:00Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(accounts): flat card grid + streamed recent activity\n\nThe page put each account type in its own section, and with one account per type\nthat meant four stacked rows of a single half-width card — mostly whitespace.\nNow: one responsive grid (sm 2-up, xl 4-up) of all accounts in type order, each\ncard carrying its type badge; and a streamed \"Recent activity across every\naccount\" list below to fill the page. Cards flex-col with the sparkline pinned\nto the bottom so they align.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00e2880ffcea9dd0660432bb1b352b1649ae18ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/00e2880ffcea9dd0660432bb1b352b1649ae18ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/106d1a3374d1786b9c95360acc3e182e5257488d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","rec