"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:39:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:39:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"perf/seo: OG + manifest + favicon; gate the txn sheet to keep /accounts/:id SSR-clean; docs\n\n- shell/modern.config.ts: favicon.svg, /manifest.webmanifest, robots.txt, Open Graph +\n  twitter:card tags.\n- /accounts/:id — mount the transaction <Sheet> (and its Suspense) only when ?txn is set,\n  so a fresh SSR render and hydration see the same tree (was throwing React #421).\n- ARCHITECTURE.md / DEPLOYMENT.md: the mono palette + @source rule, the loading-state\n  model, recharts-free list routes, preconnect, and the free-tier keep-warm runbook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"449431728f409fc7b2c0963ba2964da0dc0aa9a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/449431728f409fc7b2c0963ba2964da0dc0aa9a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/e5546cd5a8f0cf3c731c12a87899c87273a0b702","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/e5546cd5a8f0cf3c731c12a87899c87273a0b702","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGU1NTQ2Y2Q1YThmMGNmM2M3MzFjMTJhODc4OTljODcyNzNhMGI3MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f","sha":"67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f"}],"sha":"e5546cd5a8f0cf3c731c12a87899c87273a0b702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/e5546cd5a8f0cf3c731c12a87899c87273a0b702"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:30:06Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:30:06Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat: transactions & statements, money movement, budgets & goals, profile & notifications, card controls\n\nNew mock surface (shell/src/mock, synced via scripts/sync-mock.mjs to the 3 data apps):\nstatements, recurring rules, budgets + budget progress, savings goals, notifications,\nprofile + account nicknames; Card gains categoryLocks / virtualCards / freezeReason;\nTransaction gains note; Transfer gains kind; getTransactions gains sort/dir.\n\nTransactions & statements (accounts + shell)\n- Row click opens a shell <Sheet> with accounts/TransactionDetail — re-categorise + note\n  via per-field useFetcher. Sortable table headers (?sort=&dir=).\n- /statements route + accounts/StatementsView, grouped by account, browser-side CSV export.\n\nMoney movement (payments + shell)\n- TransferView: \"To a payee\" / \"Between my accounts\" tabs; internal transfer keeps 2FA.\n- PayeesView: add / edit / remove / favourite via a DropdownMenu + dialog form.\n- ActivityView: Scheduled / Recurring / History tabs; cancel a scheduled transfer,\n  pause/resume a recurring rule (per-row useFetcher).\n\nBudgets & goals (accounts + shell)\n- /budgets route + accounts/BudgetsView: category budgets vs last-30-day spend with inline\n  limit editing; savings goals with contributions.\n- Dashboard right rail gains BudgetSummaryCard + SavingsGoalCard.\n\nProfile & notifications (shell)\n- /settings (profile, alert prefs, per-account nicknames) and /notifications (read/unread,\n  mark all read). NotificationBell reads the app-layout loader; unread badge count.\n\nCard controls (shell /cards)\n- Editable monthly limit, category-lock chips, add/remove virtual card, report lost &\n  replace — all per-control useFetcher spinners.\n\nChrome\n- Sidebar regrouped (Banking / Activity / Account) with the new destinations; command\n  menu + breadcrumb labels updated.\n\nResilience\n- mf-runtime-plugin: a fetch hook retries the federation manifest/entry for ~40s (covers a\n  free-tier cold start) and refuses non-JSON so a wake-up page is never cached as a\n  manifest; error.tsx shows a \"warming up, retrying\" page instead of a bare 500;\n  scripts/keep-warm.mjs pings every service for a ~10-min cron.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"077533ea5c5a23ad616e0b545abd42e0d4d31e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/077533ea5c5a23ad616e0b545abd42e0d4d31e23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDY3ZDgzODNjY2FjN2NiNTRjYzYzMTBhOGNlMTY4NDIyZDE2YjQ2MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/dedbdb275817aad2ebd281ccbf271c27001149fb","sha":"dedbdb275817aad2ebd281ccbf271c27001149fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/dedbdb275817aad2ebd281ccbf271c27001149fb"}],"sha":"67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/67d8383ccac7cb54cc6310a8ce168422d16b461f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/dedbdb275817aad2ebd281ccbf271c27001149fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:46:21Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:46:21Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat: stock shadcn black-and-white theme + per-control loading UX + layout pass\n\nDesign\n- Replace the indigo / cool-neutral tokens with the stock shadcn neutral\n  palette (oklch) across all 5 apps. Keep muted green/red money ink; charts\n  go monochrome; retune --pos/--neg to bank tones.\n- BalanceSparkline is now a hand-authored inline SVG — drops recharts from the\n  /accounts, /accounts/[id] and dashboard account-card render paths.\n- New kit primitives: StatTile, SectionCard, DataList, Spinner, PendingButton;\n  tighter PageHeader; quieter RemoteTag / render-stamp.\n- Dashboard recomposed (net-worth panel + inline trend, stat strip, account\n  cards, streamed analytics, right rail). AccountsView / PayeesView /\n  SecurityView / widgets / QuickTransferCard / SecurityStatusCard relaid out.\n\nLoading UX\n- A filter chip / action button now spins on itself; the full-page nav\n  treatment (top bar + soft blur) fires only for real page-to-page moves.\n  NavTransition compares nav.location.pathname to the current pathname.\n- New usePendingHref()/useChangingPage(); AccountDetailView takes pendingHref\n  and shows per-chip / per-search / load-more spinners with a dimmed (not\n  blurred) results area.\n- security devices / sessions / two-factor pages switched from whole-page\n  useNavigation to per-control useFetcher (pendingId / pendingIntent).\n\nFixes\n- SidebarInset gains min-w-0 so the app never scrolls sideways on tablet widths.\n- shell styles.css @sources the sibling remotes'' src so every federated\n  utility class actually ships in the host stylesheet.\n- __app layout preconnects to the remote origins.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9362d0457f72a46d76ceeb6df74e5a861c7a5b1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/9362d0457f72a46d76ceeb6df74e5a861c7a5b1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/dedbdb275817aad2ebd281ccbf271c27001149fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: