api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/e03825eeb42e5528401006bda1aff1e48e2b0bbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:32:28Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:32:28Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(2fa): OTP slots rendered zero-size — use classes the host shell emits\n\nTwoFactorChallenge passed `size-12` to InputOTPSlot, but `size-12` appears\nnowhere in shell/src so the host''s Tailwind build never emitted `.size-12`;\ntailwind-merge had already stripped the base `h-9 w-9`, leaving the slot divs\nwith a border but no width/height — they collapsed to nothing.\n\n- ui/input-otp.tsx (all 4 apps): bump the slot base to `h-12 w-12 text-lg`\n  (standard utilities, now literally present in shell/src so they''re emitted)\n- TwoFactorChallenge: drop the `size-12 text-lg` override, use the base\n- styles.css (all 4): add the `caret-blink` keyframe + `--animate-caret-blink`\n  so the fake caret actually blinks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ca8f796f656f19c240016fa692146c2fb0311dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/0ca8f796f656f19c240016fa692146c2fb0311dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/e03825eeb42e5528401006bda1aff1e48e2b0bbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"http