,"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/7dbbfad023150445882e0ac5925879ed37b209c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:23:36Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:23:36Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(shell): kill remaining dashboard hydration mismatches (render badge + date TZ)\n\n- render-stamp: the SSR badge formatted the server timestamp with\n  toLocaleTimeString, which renders in the runtime''s timezone — server (UTC)\n  and browser produced different text (\"10:20:33\" vs \"12:20:33\"). Slice the\n  time out of the ISO string instead.\n- format.ts (all 4 apps): pin timeZone:\"UTC\" on every toLocale* date call so\n  the server and browser format the same instant identically (\"Sep 7\" not\n  \"Sep 6\" for clients east/west of UTC).\n\nTogether with e42d813 (greeting/date moved to the loader) this clears\nReact #418/#422/#425 on a fresh authenticated load of /.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f685ee81945edb89889727bcc649bdd4f0a1e8e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/f685ee81945edb89889727bcc649bdd4f0a1e8e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/7dbbfad023150445882e0ac5925879ed37b209c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av