1c264b23ac1dc4a42ee158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:02:54Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:02:54Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"feat(deploy): fall back to RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL for assetPrefix\n\nRender injects RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL (the full https://<svc>.onrender.com) into\nevery service. Chaining it into each config''s assetPrefix means a remote\nself-configures on Render with no origin var of its own; only the shell still\nneeds the three remote URLs set explicitly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ac3c0c5506dfb05c3d16cedca0f99894232fd07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/2ac3c0c5506dfb05c3d16cedca0f99894232fd07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/f992a3f3fc7d65a5881c264b23ac1dc4a42ee158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/f992a3f3fc7d65a5881c264b23ac1dc4a42ee158","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKGY5OTJhM2YzZmM3ZDY1YTU4ODFjMjY0YjIzYWMxZGM0YTQyZWUxNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889","sha":"9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889"}],"sha":"f992a3f3fc7d65a5881c264b23ac1dc4a42ee158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/f992a3f3fc7d65a5881c264b23ac1dc4a42ee158"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:48:54Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:48:54Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(deploy): set MODERN_MF_AUTO_CORS so browser-side federation works\n\nSSR federation worked after the previous fix, but the browser''s own\ncross-origin fetch of each remote''s mf-manifest.json (for hydration +\nclient-side navigation) was blocked by CORS -- \"No ''Access-Control-Allow-\nOrigin'' header\", then \"Failed to get manifest #RUNTIME-003\", then SPA\nnavigation stopped working. The plugin only adds the CORS header when\nMODERN_MF_AUTO_CORS is set.\n\n  - scripts/start.mjs: set MODERN_MF_AUTO_CORS=true on every app (build + run)\n  - docs/DEPLOYMENT.md: env-var table row, Render steps, render.yaml env\n    group, Dockerfile ENV, docker-compose anchor, §7 CORS note, smoke-test\n    browser-console + SPA checks and a triage list\n  - README: known-limitations note\n\nVerified in a real browser: login -> dashboard -> SPA nav to /accounts and\n/payments -> back. Console clean, federated views render on client nav.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4197262b86511826ef9b8d4377081b495a079518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/4197262b86511826ef9b8d4377081b495a079518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889","node_id":"C_kwDOUSEz2doAKDk0ODRhMDJlNWQ2ZTRlOThhYzc1ZGRmMWJiNGIxNWExM2UxMmI4ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commit/6c1d9a63e800164dda2d76fe6410d21fda376a84","sha":"6c1d9a63e800164dda2d76fe6410d21fda376a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/6c1d9a63e800164dda2d76fe6410d21fda376a84"}],"sha":"9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/9484a02e5d6e4e98ac75ddf1bb4b15a13e12b889"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883082?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hakangenc1","id":4883082,"login":"hakangenc1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMwODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakangenc1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/commits/6c1d9a63e800164dda2d76fe6410d21fda376a84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:37:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:37:59Z","email":"sanials4life2@gmail.com","name":"Hakan"},"message":"fix(deploy): patch @module-federation/modern-js-v3 SSR static middleware; deploy via modern deploy\n\nThe plugin''s production static middleware (serves the SSR remote entry at\n/bundles/static/*) had two bugs that broke every deploy:\n\n  1. path.join(\"/\", \"/bundles\") -> \"\\bundles\" on Windows, so the SSR remote\n     entry never matched and the shell received an HTML page instead of JS\n     (\"Failed to load Node.js entry ... Unexpected token ''<''\").\n  2. Content-Length was the JS string length, not the UTF-8 byte length, so\n     any remote chunk with a non-ASCII byte was truncated on the wire\n     (\"Unexpected token ''}''\") -- affects Linux too.\n\nVendored fix as <app>/patches/@module-federation__modern-js-v3@2.8.2.patch\n(pnpm.patchedDependencies), plus a canonical copy at /patches for\ngen-package-json.mjs.\n\nProduction path is now `modern deploy` -> `node .output/index` per app, which\nwires the plugin''s staticServePlugin so SSR federation works in production:\n  - each app package.json gets `deploy` + `start` scripts\n  - root `npm run deploy`; `npm run start` runs .output/ (deploys if missing)\n  - .gitignore: .output\n  - .gitattributes: force LF for *.patch (pnpm apply is line-exact)\n\nVerified: npm run start -> all 4 routes 200, federated regions in the SSR HTML.\ndocs/DEPLOYMENT.md + README updated (Render/Docker commands, §7 rewritten).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb09a2cfd098668a5792a85a9ba83ef8a176c94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/trees/cb09a2cfd098668a5792a85a9ba83ef8a176c94a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hakangenc1/MF-Modern.js-v3/git/commits/6c1d9a63e80