acy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-132004","id":237226299,"login":"Arjun-132004","node_id":"U_kgDODiPJOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-132004","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arjun-132004/newrust/commits/27832adb0afa90b1b38cf5c918bf45d54635e282/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:33:07Z","email":"arjuntm@tecneural.com","name":"Arjun-132004"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T10:33:07Z","email":"arjuntm@tecneural.com","name":"Arjun-132004"},"message":"build: add sqlx offline query data so the image builds without a database\n\n`sqlx::query_as!` validates its SQL against a live database AT COMPILE TIME.\nThere is none inside `docker build`, so every CI and container build of this\ncrate failed with:\n\n    error: `SQLX_OFFLINE=true` but there is no cached data for this query,\n    run `cargo sqlx prepare` to update the query cache\n\n`cargo sqlx prepare` records the answers in `.sqlx/`, which is what sqlx''s own\ndocumentation recommends committing so builds need no database.\n\nGenerated against Postgres 16 with migrations/001_create_users_table.sql\napplied, then verified: `SQLX_OFFLINE=true cargo build --release` with the\ndatabase stopped and DATABASE_URL unset completes cleanly.\n\nRe-run `cargo sqlx prepare` and commit the result whenev