il":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Prepare 0.1.1\n\nThe workspace, the chart, e2e/package.json, and the requirements between\nHlin''s own crates, which go to 0.1.1 because hlin-ui now needs hlin-stream''s\nBrandSummary and the front ends need hlin-ui''s `bar`. The changelog''s\nUnreleased section becomes 0.1.1: Aurora 0.5.0 in light and dark\n(COLLIERY-I-0608), and white-labelling (COLLIERY-I-0609).\n\nA patch rather than 0.2.0 because Aurora 0.5.0 accepts hlin-view below 0.2,\nand hlin-view, hlin-manifest, hlin-bridge and hlin-module have not changed\nsince 0.1.0; everything else adds. Verified: 1096 Rust tests, fmt and clippy\nclean, one hlin-view (0.1.1) in Cargo.lock.","tree":{"sha":"07b0f346472723ee5b3611adbafe8c5993f20267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/07b0f346472723ee5b3611adbafe8c5993f20267"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/713b775f1fa333092f64946a90894a31cc46ced7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/713b775f1fa333092f64946a90894a31cc46ced7","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDcxM2I3NzVmMWZhMzMzMDkyZjY0OTQ2YTkwODk0YTMxY2M0NmNlZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62","sha":"4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62"}],"sha":"713b775f1fa333092f64946a90894a31cc46ced7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/713b775f1fa333092f64946a90894a31cc46ced7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Prove the brand in a browser, on a branded demo (HLIN-T-0105)\n\n`angreal demo up --with brand` is the Aurora demo white-labelled from\ndemo/brand/: \"Acme Operations\", an SVG logo and favicon, and a stylesheet\nthat moves Aurora''s accent to magenta in both themes. brand.spec.js asserts\nthe name in the bar and the tab, the logo drawn, the favicon served, and\nthe brand''s accent in the chrome and in a module''s frame, in light and dark;\non every other flavour, that the page is Hlin and the sheet is empty.\n\nVerified: 1096 Rust tests; fmt and clippy clean; on --with brand, the brand\nspec and both theme tests passed; on the gallery demo, the whole suite had\n81 passed and 32 skipped (other flavours'' specs).","tree":{"sha":"2a9ac018d094ecfdb800e954dc6b9b28f1f621a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/2a9ac018d094ecfdb800e954dc6b9b28f1f621a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDRiOGMyOGExMmY0ZWJhMjc0YjQ2NTg0Y2JjY2Y4ZDVhZWNlNTRiNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b","sha":"b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b"}],"sha":"4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/4b8c28a12f4eba274b46584cbccf8d5aece54b62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Say how to brand Hlin, in the chart and the README (HLIN-T-0104)\n\nconfig.brand in the chart: a name, and the keys of a ConfigMap you create\nfor the logo, favicon and stylesheet, mounted whole at /etc/hlin-brand so an\nupdate reaches the shell. The chart refuses a key with no ConfigMap, and a\nConfigMap with no key. Rendered with helm 3.16: nothing without a brand;\n[brand] and the mount with one; lint clean.\n\nThe README''s \"White-labelling\" says what each setting does, what the\nstylesheet may override, and what is not branded (the identity provider''s\npages, the binary, the image and the crates).","tree":{"sha":"120b67ab766a296a5774a0139222178a86a86eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/120b67ab766a296a5774a0139222178a86a86eea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGI2YjIwN2ZiNDc3Y2U4OWM4Nzc4YWI2YzA1Y2Y3Y2VjNWFkMWJlMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d","sha":"cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d"}],"sha":"b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/b6b207fb477ce89c8778ab6c05cf7cec5ad1be0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:04Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:04Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Draw the operator''s name, logo and colours (HLIN-T-0103)\n\nThe bar shows the brand''s logo and name, and nothing before /api/config\nanswers, so another name never shows first; the tab title is the name, and\nthe front ends'' index.html titles are empty. The messages that named Hlin\nuse the name. /brand/style.css is linked after the pack''s styles, and when it\nloads every module is told the page''s colours again, so modules and widgets\nfollow a brand with no change of their own. ClientConfig.brand defaults to\nHlin, for a shell that sends none.\n\nThe bar now wraps when it outgrows a line (a logo, a long name and a pack''s\nswitch did at 1280px), with the pack''s controls at the right, and the\ncatalogue sticks below the bar''s measured height instead of at 49px.","tree":{"sha":"880e8f347e84c33049bba66e9131ad3ae1187c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/880e8f347e84c33049bba66e9131ad3ae1187c62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGNmMDJjNmM4ODhkYzhiODYxMTQ4MzMxMzhkMDBmNzEwOGJmYjFmMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8","sha":"a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8"}],"sha":"cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/cf02c6c888dc8b86114833138d00f7108bfb1f2d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:04Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:47:04Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Take an operator''s brand in the shell''s configuration (HLIN-T-0102)\n\n`[brand]` in hlin.toml: a name (default \"Hlin\"), and a logo, favicon and\nstylesheet as files. Each file is checked at startup (there, readable, of\nits kind by extension, at most 1 MiB) and read again on every request, so a\nConfigMap updated in place is served without a restart.\n\nRoutes, unauthenticated because a page must look like itself before anybody\nsigns in: /brand/style.css (an empty sheet when none is set, so the front\nend can always link it), /brand/logo and /favicon.ico (404 when none; the\nfavicon was answered with index.html before). Brand files are served with\nnosniff and a CSP that runs nothing. /api/config carries brand.name and\nbrand.logo.","tree":{"sha":"ed438356e30ddaf9b8c90b4029df33e5ffcca0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/ed438356e30ddaf9b8c90b4029df33e5ffcca0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGEzYmQ3MzkyMGI4Yzk0OTI5MjE0MDI0N2FmOGY2OTI2YmVlMDliZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9","sha":"fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9"}],"sha":"a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/a3bd73920b8c949292140247af8f6926bee09bf8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:22Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:22Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Offer Aurora''s Light / Dark / System switch in the bar (HLIN-T-0101)\n\nApp takes an optional `bar`: the front end''s own controls, drawn at the end\nof the bar and read by nothing in hlin-ui. frontend-aurora puts Aurora''s\nThemeToggle there, and frontend-gallery does under ?pack=aurora only; under\nthe demo pack it clears the restored theme rather than offer a switch that\nchanges nothing. Both index.html files carry THEME_INIT_SCRIPT, and a test\nin each front end fails if Aurora''s script changes.\n\nbridge.spec.js asserts the resolved accent, and drives the switch: Light,\nthen Dark, each changing the chrome and a module in its frame at once, and\nDark surviving a reload. It skips where Aurora is not drawing.\n\nVerified: 1087 Rust tests; fmt and clippy clean; the browser suite on the\ngallery demo, 80 passed and 30 skipped (other flavours'' specs); the two\ntheme tests on the aurora flavour, and on the default demo one passed and\nthe switch test skipped.","tree":{"sha":"59ef4a4f44e3280d912379be740a928fc369ea7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/59ef4a4f44e3280d912379be740a928fc369ea7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGZhNzZjNDc5YWZhOTYzNDI2MGRiYWIzM2VkYWUzZTk1NjFjMGRlYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8","sha":"0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8"}],"sha":"fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/fa76c479afa9634260dbab33edae3e9561c0dec9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:17Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:17Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Send a module the theme''s colours as the page resolves them (HLIN-T-0100)\n\nAurora 0.4+ writes each token as light-dark(<light>, <dark>) and switches\nwith data-theme on <html>. The shell sent each --hlin-* role as declared\ntext, so a frame got an expression it could not resolve under the page''s\nscheme, and the light-or-dark judgement could not parse the surface and fell\nback to the operating system. And it re-sent the theme only when the OS\npreference changed, so no module heard a theme switch.\n\nEach role is now resolved on a hidden probe in <body> (color: var(<role>),\nread back as rgb(...)), and a MutationObserver on <html>''s attributes calls\nretheme as the media listener does. hlin-ui still knows nothing of Aurora:\nany pack that writes an expression or switches on <html> is covered.","tree":{"sha":"189c0b53f328b93625f36b1c3f8e624717743e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/189c0b53f328b93625f36b1c3f8e624717743e5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDA4NDlkYWU5YjA2YTY5NTRmMTdhNmY4YjA3NmM5NjhiYTAyODMyZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed","sha":"2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed"}],"sha":"0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/0849dae9b06a6954f17a6f8b076c968ba02832d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:27:10Z","email":"dstorey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Take Aurora 0.5.0 from crates.io (HLIN-T-0099)\n\nThe two front ends and the checklist and feed modules move from 0.3.1 to\n0.5.0, and compile with no change; Cargo.lock still has one hlin-view, the\npatched path. The design system is \"Aurora\" now that it has a light theme,\nand the prose that named it says so.","tree":{"sha":"c6faa49317d2c8c55a4fe99db3c9104e104ac31d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/c6faa49317d2c8c55a4fe99db3c9104e104ac31d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDJhNDU1OWRlZjc4MDAxY2JkYjE5MGViNWMwYjBiYzk4ZGZkMTBmZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/367bbfaa1c154ae5d8f8b4a1e388dc296b7bfb54","sha":"367bbfaa1c154ae5d8f8b4a1e388dc296b7bfb54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/367bbfaa1c154ae5d8f8b4a1e388dc296b7bfb54"}],"sha":"2a4559def78001cbdb190eb5c0b0bc98dfd10fed","url"