rs/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/8f5defb08648a15252525629f423bb56d93240fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:35:57Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:36:51Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Test that a panel waiting for room mounts when the frame it waited on stays\n\nThe intermittent timeouts in `e2e twenty` and `twenty-measure` (HLIN-T-0098)\nwere all the waiting-panel race fixed in 3c264f2: the browser reports each\npanel''s intersection observers in no fixed order, so one scroll could choose\na frame to make room that was, in the same report, coming back into view. With\nthe fix reverted, `e2e twenty` failed 1 of 8 (shoutbox empty on the second\nbrowser) and `twenty-measure` 1 of 8 (`status` loading with no frame in the\nmiddle screen); with it, 0 of 64 across both.\n\nThe fix had no test of its own. This one makes the race certain: every module\nignores `suspend`, the tall frame asked to go is the only one out of view, and\na scroll brings it back while the waiting panel is in view. Without the fix it\nfails 6 of 6; with it, 10 of 10, and 10 of 10 with every core busy.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"2baed7406176cf5de17574d8dbf7bff6208c948c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/2baed7406176cf5de17574d8dbf7bff6208c948c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/8f5defb08648a15252525629f423bb56d93240fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/8f5defb08648a15252525629f423bb56d93240fb","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDhmNWRlZmIwODY0OGExNTI1MjUyNTYyOWY0MjNiYjU2ZDkzMjQwZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/e536b96bae3c9ada86175d01352e6034aa36d2bf","sha":"e536b96bae3c9ada86175d01352e6034aa36d2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/e536b96bae3c9ada86175d01352e6034aa36d2bf"}],"sha":"8f5defb08648a15252525629f423bb56d93240fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/8f5defb08648a15252525629f423bb56d93240fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/e536b96bae3c9ada86175d01352e6034aa36d2bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:03:09Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:03:09Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Prove and measure the twenty in containers (HLIN-T-0095)\n\nThe twenty suites take `--against compose`: signed in through Dex once\nby a global setup (one signIn helper, now shared with the collab suites),\nthe session''s cookies handed to every context and cache left cold. What\ndiffers between the processes and the containers is in\ntwenty-deployment.js: where a widget''s own UI is, and how a platform goes\ndown and comes back (SIGKILL and `demo restart`, or `docker compose\nstop` and `start`). Own UIs are published nowhere, so the suite runs a\nsmall proxy on the compose network and opens them by name; `/` and a 404\nfor `/hlin/nope` are checked from there. The kill-and-recover check runs\ntwice in one session.\n\nProving it found `docker compose stop` took ten seconds: no server here\nhandles SIGTERM, and as PID 1 it ignores one. `init: true` makes it 0.2 s.\n\nThe numbers match the process-based ones within the runs'' spread;\nrecorded in HLIN-I-0013''s Results. The README calls the containerised\ntwenty the reference for how a platform serves Hlin.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"fe4a01d4407605c029f8a394d0c7c4d4e9017ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/fe4a01d4407605c029f8a394d0c7c4d4e9017ae9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/e536b96bae3c9ada86175d01352e6034aa36d2bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey",