ile another frame is\nsuspended. If that frame came back into view first, its suspension was\ncancelled and nothing asked for room again, so the waiting panel stayed\nblank until it next entered the viewport. Cancelling a suspension now calls\nmount_waiting(), as a frame leaving already did.\n\nSeen as \"a shout reaches a second browser\" failing in `angreal e2e twenty`,\non the base commit too (2 of 2 after the counter test, 1 of 3 full runs);\npassing after it.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"ab38494b16b7c75350cbf657ea1dee2803c5310d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/ab38494b16b7c75350cbf657ea1dee2803c5310d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/3c264f223986e37793847ee1d0bd05f15974773c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/3c264f223986e37793847ee1d0bd05f15