w follow HLIN-T-0093''s pattern: one components crate each, its\nown UI at `/` mounting it with the direct client, and a module that is only\n`pub use` of the components and `hlin_widget_module::mount`.\n\n- deploys is the first widget to stream through the client trait:\n  `widget.stream` is a streamed same-origin fetch of its own\n  `/api/deploys/log` on its own page, and the bridge''s streaming in its\n  module. An end because the widget is going stops following.\n- converter asks for nothing with either client; its test now reads the\n  components, the module and the own UI for any request.\n- Server tests: each writing widget''s own `/api/` and Hlin''s `/hlin/api/`\n  over the same handlers and data; deploys'' log streamed at its own\n  `/api/`; oncall''s rota the same both ways.\n- e2e twenty: the eight in OWN_UI, drawn at their roots, the log streaming\n  on its own page, a shout on its own page reaching its module.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"f609c546c336e659e3235d2bbbd23048f3f48b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/f609c546c336e659e3235d2bbbd23048f3f48b46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/4220bfa491c8bb49a86ccdfc2ce901531ac72783","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a