/api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/b4d46a5ebab473f29a2bb16fcee37c3cd00d161f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T01:14:06Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T01:14:06Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Widgets four to twelve on shared components (HLIN-T-0096)\n\nNotes, dice, stopwatch, quote, sparkline, kanban, status, weather and\npomodoro now follow the pattern HLIN-T-0093 set: one components crate\neach, mounted at the widget''s own root with the direct client and in its\nHlin module with the bridge. Each module is a `pub use` and a mount.\n\n- components/: the old module''s UI as `#[component] pub fn <Name>`, its\n  stylesheet inlined; written against hlin_widget_ui only. No change to\n  the Client trait: visible, time_range (the sparkline), restored and\n  on_suspend (the note''s draft) were already there.\n- ui/: `direct::mount(<Name>)`, an ordinary Trunk site.\n- The servers: `run_with(…, Builds)` and an `embed` feature.\n- Tests: each widget writes through its own /api/ as the local user and\n  reads it back, through /hlin/api/ where the widget is shared.\n- e2e: the nine in OWN_UI; a test draws each own UI at its port and rolls\n  the dice on its own page into its module on \"Twenty\".\n\nChecks: angreal check all; angreal test all (1078 passed); e2e twenty 8\npassed; twenty-measure 4 passed.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"dce8bbb81bb9f38ef2a42d5749f05f1a1a412258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/dce8bbb81bb9f38ef2a42d5749f05f1a1a412258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/b4d46a5ebab473f29a2bb16fcee37c3cd00d161f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/b4d46a5ebab473f29a2bb16fcee37c3cd00d161f","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGI0ZDQ2YTVlYmFiNDczZjI5YTJiYjE2ZmNlZTM3YzNjZDAwZDE2MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/137e2760291147e6667f