rl":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/04b48339f55ddf542cfba15abe047d8d9ad40dbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:46:30Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:46:30Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Each widget serves its own UI at the root and Hlin under /hlin (HLIN-T-0093)\n\nA widget''s Hlin module is now a re-export of the components its own UI is\nbuilt from, as the owner asked. Proved on clock, counter and poll.\n\n- hlin-widget-ui (new): the Client trait the components are written\n  against, the Widget handle over it (load, send, Try again, refusal\n  words), and the shared stylesheet. Its `direct` feature is the own UI''s\n  client: same-origin fetch to /api/ and the widget''s event stream.\n- hlin-widget-module: the Hlin client and `mount`; the old start/Widget\n  stay as legacy.rs until the other seventeen are converted.\n- hlin-widget-support: `site()` nests Hlin''s surface under --hlin-base\n  (/hlin) with its own 404 fallback, serves the same api() handlers at\n  /api/ for the own UI, and falls back to the UI''s index.html. /api/ acts\n  as --local-user, demo only, off by default and warned about. `dist!`\n  embeds both builds under a widget''s `embed` feature.\n- Per converted widget: components/, ui/ and a module/ that is a `pub use`\n  and a mount.\n- Demo: /hlin base URLs; every module and own UI built in parallel and\n  fingerprinted per build.\n- The crate docs say how to convert a widget, for HLIN-T-0096 and 0097.\n\nChecks: angreal check all; angreal test all (1069 passed); e2e twenty 7\npassed, including the own UIs in step with their modules; twenty-measure 4\npassed; the standard suite 77 passed.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"a6408cef2940525ca3d7699d227e5a9e2b8c3887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/a6408cef2940525ca3d7699d227e5a9e2b8c3887"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/04b48339f55ddf542cfba15abe047d8d9ad40dbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"publ