wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/f85f503f0befe2be4ee0eb924fe46729c9407658/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:56:30Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:56:30Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Close HLIN-T-0092 and HLIN-I-0012\n\nTwenty platforms on one surface, measured and fixed. The last task found a\nproduct bug: the event stream resent the same hlin-token on every reconnect,\nso any platform restarted more than two minutes after a surface opened was\nnever resubscribed. Each attempt now signs afresh.\n\nVerified on main: 1052 Rust tests; collab sign-in 9 and walkthrough 3; the\nagent''s runs of Aurora (77), twenty (6), and twenty-measure three times in a\nrow on one demo (4 each).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"0a8be3a8740ff8e164f458b1e994f9187668c90a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/0a8be3a8740ff8e164f458b1e994f9187668c90a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/f85f503