an be read from its log. A HEAD has no body to\ncompress, only a length that would be wrong, so it is passed through.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"716bdb8127deb8c111951e003e9443f3b0d7fc6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/716bdb8127deb8c111951e003e9443f3b0d7fc6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/774d7455da59aaa75bd22b395d96fc4df98f9c78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/774d7455da59aaa75bd22b395d96fc4df98f9c78","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDc3NGQ3NDU1ZGE1OWFhYTc1YmQyMmIzOTVkOTZmYzRkZjk4ZjljNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/9cfd33ba151161830211589de163e4f4f3f66904","sha":"9cfd33ba151161830211589de163e4f4f3f66904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/9cfd33ba151161830211589de163e4f4f3f66904"}],"sha":"774d7455da59aaa75bd22b395d96fc4df98f9c78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/774d7455da59aaa75bd22b395d96fc4df98f9c78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/9cfd33ba151161830211589de163e4f4f3f66904/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:38:45Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:08:36Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Compress each served file once, and keep it (HLIN-T-0091)\n\nThe shell compressed module assets and its own frontend on every request,\nand in the demo''s debug shell brotli over the frontend''s wasm took 223 ms\neach time. Now `compressed` keeps what it compresses, keyed by a SHA-256 of\nthe uncompressed bytes and the encoding, and reuses it for every request\nand viewer; a file that changes under the same name is a new key.\n\nThe first request for a file is answered at brotli 4 and kept; behind it,\none at a time, the file is compressed again at brotli 11 (a fifth fewer\nbytes for the frontend''s wasm) and that replaces it. The frontend is\ncompressed at its best in the background when the shell starts. Kept\nbytes are bounded by a new `[compression] cache_bytes`, 64 MiB by default,\nleast recently used first out; a file larger than the whole budget is sent\nas it is, and 0 turns compression off. `/p/` stays outside the layer.\n\ntower-http''s compression layer is replaced, so its features are dropped.\nThe dev profile optimises brotli, miniz_oxide, crc32fast and sha2, which\nthe debug demo shell otherwise runs three to twenty times slower.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"e9f4601bfb75a01f6ebe102466e53185b4bd505c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/e9f4601bfb75a01f6ebe102466e53185b4bd505c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/9cfd33ba151161830211589de163e4f4f3f66904","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstore