widget\nfile server now accepts 8-16 digits and sends ETags) and HLIN-T-0089 (a\nstream''s rate is the platform''s pace, not the shell''s catch-up).\n\nVerified together on main: 1034 Rust tests; Aurora 76 passed, 0 failed;\ncollab sign-in 9 and walkthrough 3; twenty 6; twenty-measure 4.\n\nHLIN-T-0091 tracks compressing each file once: per-request brotli in the\ndebug shell made loopback cold first content slower, 588 to 817 ms.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"36ac2937c1d51ed2e8750df742e05393e0f030c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/36ac2937c1d51ed2e8750df742e05393e0f030c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/b218724a5fd8dc4ad5dc1d7d666fe0660224f0f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/b218724a5fd8dc4ad5dc1d7d666fe0660224f0f0","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toA