nd a platform\nthat compressed its own file has it passed back as sent, not compressed\nagain. `/p/` is outside the layer: an answer there may be streamed.\n\nEvery module and frontend runs `wasm-opt -Oz` on a release build, at the\nbinaryen release now pinned in each Trunk.toml, told which features rustc\nemits (without them it refuses the wasm, which is why it was off). `demo up\n--release` checks it can be had first; offline and never downloaded, it\nsays so and builds with the release profile and no wasm-opt.\n\n`twenty-measure` reports what module and shell assets weighed as sent, and\nasserts a warm visit fetches no module wasm again.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"844386064ba8e8c123c7558da129606460c68e8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/844386064ba8e8c123c7558da129606460c68e8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/fb40422ef7d71220831cad0bab16774ebe26cb81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions