name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Serve a module''s files with an ETag, and know a short Trunk hash (HLIN-T-0088)\n\nKanban''s wasm was downloaded whole on every visit because its name was\n`hlin-widget-kanban-module-ef8fd81f1008991_bg.wasm`: Trunk writes its\nu64 hash in hex without leading zeros, so one build in sixteen gets\nfifteen digits. The widgets'' file server took exactly sixteen for a hash,\nserved the file `no-cache` with no validator, and the shell passed that on,\nso every revalidation was the whole file.\n\nA hash is now eight to sixteen hex digits, and every file carries an ETag\nfrom its content and answers a matching If-None-Match with 304, so a name\nmisjudged as unhashed, and every entry document, costs a round trip rather\nthan the file. The same in the checklist and feed samples'' copies.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"0014b2e6a0dec9d20041bc99a02e1c7bf0b4f753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/0014b2e6a0dec9d20041bc99a02e1c7bf0b4f753"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/df8b07a35efb8a9212a5efdfc5aa7d27bf2b3463","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","sit