tps://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/437bb5bd76c0d18e9e999a3b5f124a3d97c4d9d5","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDQzN2JiNWJkNzZjMGQxOGU5ZTk5OWEzYjVmMTI0YTNkOTdjNGQ5ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/39ba6fa4f1fe84656d85e8acddac7269b1ea4bc6","sha":"39ba6fa4f1fe84656d85e8acddac7269b1ea4bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/39ba6fa4f1fe84656d85e8acddac7269b1ea4bc6"}],"sha":"437bb5bd76c0d18e9e999a3b5f124a3d97c4d9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/437bb5bd76c0d18e9e999a3b5f124a3d97c4d9d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/39ba6fa4f1fe84656d85e8acddac7269b1ea4bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:29:53Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:27:49Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"A platform that is down dims its panels, and its return brings them back (HLIN-T-0087)\n\nThe owner''s answer, implemented. The page counts the shell''s own\n`unreachable` and `timeout` refusals from `/p/`, per platform; after three\nin a row that platform''s `ready` panels are `stale`, and the platform''s\nfirst answer of any kind clears it. Three because one gesture can cost two\nrequests (a write and the read after it), and it matches the three missed\nheartbeats before `unavailable`.\n\nWhen the shell''s subscription to a platform''s event stream connects again\nafter ending, every surface holding its modules is sent a `changed` for\neach of its panels, so running modules refetch and one given up on is\nmounted again, with nobody clicking. The shell now subscribes again after\none second, doubling to the old thirty while it keeps failing, so a\nplatform restarted in a moment is noticed in a moment.\n\nWidgets built on `hlin-widget-module` offer *Try again* when a read cannot\nreach the platform, and retry by themselves on `changed` as before.\nHLIN-S-0007 *Panel states*, `changed` and the request proxy say all this.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"bc82f3cfcfdc7a8253de925a730d1266f5f9a603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/bc82f3cfcfdc7a8253de925a730d1266f5f9a603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/39ba6fa4f1fe84656d85e8acddac7269b1ea4bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_