ts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:42:03Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:07:51Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Record HLIN-T-0071: the containment matrix, load times, and a rate finding\n\nHLIN-S-0007 gains *Containment*: the matrix, settled, and how the browsers\ndiffer. Every row holds in all four. A module that spins freezes the whole\npage, heartbeat included, everywhere but full Chromium, which runs sandboxed\nframes in their own process; that replaces the matrix as the open question.\n\nLoad times on release builds are in the task, with where the cached\nmodule''s ~480 ms goes (the page''s init resend clock). One e2e test still\nfails in the full suite: the shell''s rate bucket ends a held stream once\nits pooled connection to the platform has grown large buffers. The cause\nand the fix to consider are in the task.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"30cac4a9383bc680f443273a955fbc89f66f8383","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/30cac4a9383bc680f443273a955fbc89f66f8383"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/113ad428aa154e164eac030b3cad01ef679853b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received