/commits/77980802afdc287bb12bf1a9f108c003e6ce106d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:41:43Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:07:51Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"A module built with the SDK, and one that tries to escape (HLIN-T-0071)\n\nThe sample platform''s annotations panel is a Leptos module on hlin-module:\nit reads the notes inside the surface''s range as the viewer, pins one with a\nwrite whose token is bound to it, and says `changed` so the same panel in\nanother browser reads again. `demo up` builds it and the sample platforms\nserve it from `--module-dir`. A third sample platform, smelter, lets a\nsurface hold modules from three.\n\nThe hostile module (`ui/hostile`, plain JS) tries every way out of its frame\nwhen a test asks; `containment.spec.js` runs the matrix, and passes in\nChromium, full Chromium, Firefox and WebKit (`HLIN_BROWSERS`).\n`performance.spec.js` asserts NFR-1.1: on a release build, a cached module\nis ready in about 480 ms and six modules from three platforms draw within\nabout 560 ms, cold.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"511cc1bf5b1285d800d0b124169e93c61b01629f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/511cc1bf5b1285d800d0b124169e93c61b01629f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/77980802afdc287bb12bf1a9f108c003e6ce106d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","