 in view are ready in 572 ms and drawn in 588 ms cold (1.75 s over\na throttled 50 Mbit/s link), 535 ms warm. NFR-1.1 is met with room. Weight\nis the cost: 7.7 MB for the first screen, 12.5 MB for all twenty modules,\nnone of it compressed (4.0 MB gzipped), and 20 to 22 MB of renderer memory\nper mounted frame.\n\nTwo criteria are met in part and say so. The budget holds once\nsuspensions finish, but up to 18 frames are in the document while\nscrolling, because a frame being suspended is no longer counted. And a\nkilled platform''s panel on an open page stays `ready`, its module saying\nit cannot reach its platform; only a page opened afterwards falls back.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"47325b5ecebc72bf484ad1c96e44030bfc85bf7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/47325b5ecebc72bf484ad1c96e44030bfc85bf7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/7e329783356d6ddb38e6b00b7763de7af2437617","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/7e329783356d6ddb38e6b00b7763de7af2437617","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDdlMzI5NzgzMzU2ZDZkZGIzOGU2YjAwYjc3NjNkZTdhZjI0Mzc2MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/477ec94796825fea948295d4182508b960515e4e","sha":"477ec94796825fea948295d4182508b960515e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/477ec94796825fea948295d4182508b960515e4e"}],"sha":"7e329783356d6ddb38e6b00b7763de7af2437617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/7e329783356d6ddb38e6b00b7763de7af2437617"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/477ec94796825fea948295d4182508b960515e4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:35:43Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:35:43Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Measure twenty widgets, kill one, and keep a note''s draft (HLIN-T-0084)\n\n`angreal e2e twenty-measure` runs a new suite against the twenty-widget\ndemo, three times, and prints medians: cold and warm time from navigation\nto every widget in view `ready` and to its first content, recorded inside\neach document as it happens; bytes over the wire by kind; JS heap and the\nbrowser''s resident memory; frames mounted while scrolling. It asserts the\nsettled budget and that nothing in view is unmounted, that scrolled-away\nwidgets get their state back, times a bump between browsers, and kills the\ndice widget''s process and brings it back with the new `angreal demo\nrestart <widget>`. Everything lands in e2e/measurements/ (ignored).\n\n`e2e twenty` photographs after first content, a viewport at a time, rather\nthan at `ready` and full page, where the frames were empty.\n\nThe notes module had no `suspend` hook, so a half-written note was lost\nwhen the budget unmounted it. It now hands the draft and its revision to\nthe shell and takes them back.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"861592224adbca190571977953d139a65fb634ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/861592224adbca190571977953d139a65fb634ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/477ec94796825fea948295d4182508b960515e4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey