8211 to 8217), so \"Twenty\" places them\nafter the poll in the initiative''s order, and the twenty browser suite now\nproves a shout reaches a second browser without a reload.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"86607309f431b9651a1e6166daa7f58fdebeb803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/86607309f431b9651a1e6166daa7f58fdebeb803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/b80cfbf5d8904101077cd882c2b1c0b042018c94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/b80cfbf5d8904101077cd882c2b1c0b042018c94","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGI4MGNmYmY1ZDg5MDQxMDEwNzdjZDg4MmMyYjFjMGIwNDIwMThjOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3","sha":"c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3"}],"sha":"b80cfbf5d8904101077cd882c2b1c0b042018c94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/b80cfbf5d8904101077cd882c2b1c0b042018c94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:45:36Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:45:54Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Widgets eighteen to twenty: a streamed deploy log, a converter, meetings (HLIN-T-0083)\n\n`deploys` is the first real use of module streaming: its module holds one\nlong read of newline-delimited JSON through the shell with `fetch_stream`\nand `BodyReader`, and the platform writes a synthetic line a second, only as\nthe connection takes it, and stops when the reader goes. A reconnect carries\non from the last line it has. `converter` does everything in its module,\nasks for nothing and declares no fallback, saying why. `meetings` shows\ntoday''s synthetic meetings with a per-person answer to each.\n\nNo change to the SDK or the widget kit was needed; what a second streaming\nwidget would copy, and the small additive fixes, are recorded in the task.\nTwenty''s browser suite gains a check that deploy lines arrive on an\nuntouched page.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"478c34d6fb537a7a43014196dadaae41c8756e61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/478c34d6fb537a7a43014196dadaae41c8756e61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/c77ba0cfa32ba4bd57702e7b0131a6d9cdb579d3","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKGM3N2JhMGNmYTMyYmE0YmQ1Nzc