e":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Let demo up build the browser''s WebAssembly optimised, for honest measurements\n\n`angreal demo up --release` builds the frontend and every module with Trunk''s\nrelease profile, which is what a deployment serves: each widget module drops\nfrom about 2.8 MB to 0.57 MB, the frontend from 8.2 MB to 1.9 MB. The profile\nis part of a module''s fingerprint, so switching rebuilds rather than reusing\nthe other profile''s output. Shell and platform binaries stay debug: the demo\nsigns in with `dev`, which a release shell refuses.\n\nThe first numbers are recorded against HLIN-T-0084, which measures twenty.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"baff684657c6694d2d3340e053efd39b5f4f6154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/baff684657c6694d2d3340e053efd39b5f4f6154"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/6713791969bbd5b0e5cc111792513d7d470807e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/6713791969bbd5b0e5cc111792513d7d470807e8","node_id":"C_kwDOUSU9_toAKDY3MTM3OTE5NjliYmQ1YjBlNWNjMTExNzkyNTEzZDdkNDcwODA3ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/colliery-io/hlin/commit/7b36242b0a903478bbe8a8aa9095a834b1cea305","sha":"7b36242b0a903478bbe8a8aa9095a834b1cea305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/7b36242b0a903478bbe8a8aa9095a834b1cea305"}],"sha":"6713791969bbd5b0e5cc111792513d7d470807e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/6713791969bbd5b0e5cc111792513d7d470807e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/7b36242b0a903478bbe8a8aa9095a834b1cea305/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:10:27Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:12:40Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Twenty widgets: the support crates, the flavour, and the first three (HLIN-T-0080)\n\nThe template the other widget tasks of HLIN-I-0012 copy, proved on three:\n\n- crates/widgets/hlin-widget-support: what a platform needs to host a\n  module, once. A widget is a short description the manifest is built\n  from (and checked against hlin-manifest before it will start); reads\n  take a verified viewer, writes a token bound to the request and an\n  Idempotency-Key, and Platform::write replays repeats, remembers only\n  writes that happened, and announces `changed` on the event stream. It\n  also serves the module''s files, the fallback, health and the manifest,\n  and a `testing` feature calls a widget the way the shell does. Its docs\n  hold the steps for adding a widget.\n- crates/widgets/hlin-widget-module: the module side. Connect, fetch\n  again when told, writes with a retry, refusals in the platform''s words,\n  and one stylesheet written only against the shell''s --hlin-* tokens.\n- clock (8201), counter (8202) and poll (8203), each a server with its\n  own rules and tests, and a Leptos module.\n- `angreal demo up --with twenty` reads one list, WIDGETS: builds the\n  modules that changed (one cargo build for all, then Trunk in parallel;\n  a content stamp skips the rest), starts each widget, runs the shell on\n  dev sign-in with a configuration listing them, and publishes \"Twenty\",\n  three across. `angreal e2e twenty` proves every widget ready and the\n  counter and poll in step between two browsers without a reload.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"10539c36aa619a6b8d47371347731117ada1cc41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/10539c36aa619a6b8d47371347731117ada1cc41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/7b36242b0a903478bbe8a8aa9095a834b1cea305","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fal