ail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Walk Alice and Bob through the collaborative demo in two browsers at once\n\nwalkthrough.spec.js signs Alice and Bob in through Dex in two browser\ncontexts on \"The team\" and never reloads either page: Alice adds an item and\nBob''s checklist shows it; Bob crosses it off and Alice''s shows it crossed;\nBob''s edit of her post is refused in the feed''s words. Carol, in a third,\nreads the feed and is refused a post and the team list. Each cross-browser\nstep waits up to a bound rather than sleeping, and prints how long the\nchange took to arrive (tens of milliseconds). `angreal e2e walkthrough` runs\nit and refuses a shell that does not sign people in, as `e2e signin` does.\n\nPropagation needed no fix. The README''s \"not yet\" about it is replaced.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"643528e7ff37589792f88620148d4aeff0e7fd5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/643528e7ff37589792f88620148d4aeff0e7fd5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/66dcf32352788054c8fb978ae6d5636952dc0586","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanbstorey","id":6005970,"login":"dylanbstorey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDU5NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/repos","site_admin":false,"