s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/commits/c2faf754debce745aa7b6400a5da366ecd9b63ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:31:38Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:32:01Z","email":"dylan.storey@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Storey"},"message":"Serve the demo''s modules from the address people open (HLIN-T-0066)\n\nThe shell''s origin defaulted to http://localhost:8080, but `demo up` prints,\nand the browser suite opens, http://127.0.0.1:8080. A module''s CSP names the\norigin in `frame-ancestors` and the page''s `frame-src` names it too, so every\nmodule frame in the demo was refused. The four sample-platform flavours now\nset `public_url` to 127.0.0.1, as the collaborative one already did.\n\nThe hand-written modules draw in the system''s colours until the shell sends\na theme (HLIN-T-0067), so they are legible on a dark pack. The task records\nwhat was built, what was found, the decisions it left open, and the checks.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4t8VQeZrx8j1J4qmNuQQT","tree":{"sha":"4a18db8e174b955eec91463a8f16c869bfa88844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/trees/4a18db8e174b955eec91463a8f16c869bfa88844"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colliery-io/hlin/git/commits/c2faf754debce745aa7b6400a5da366ecd9b63ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6005970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanbstorey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user