blished while it is subscribed. Mounting one panel at a time meant a rate edited in People never reached Delivery, and People saw no over-capacity until Delivery had been opened.\n\nNavigation now switches which panel is visible rather than which remote exists. Each panel keeps its own error boundary, so a failing remote is still reported in place.","tree":{"sha":"f8b6ecde631e9b22d00f530469545a8299747847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/git/trees/f8b6ecde631e9b22d00f530469545a8299747847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/git/commits/484341a6aa87a2b18a8f8d5310c9157f838dc0c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63741855?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khattasallaman","id":63741855,"login":"khattasallaman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzQxODU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/commit/484341a6aa87a2b18a8f8d5310c9157f838dc0c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUSqoSdoAKDQ4NDM0MWE2YWE4N2EyYjE4YThmOGQ1MzEwYzkxNTdmODM4ZGMwYzc","parents"