ent sideways. Horizontal overflow now belongs to the grid, with the person column pinned while the months scroll.\n\nBelow tablet width the tree and grid stack behind a panel toggle instead of competing for one row. Each tree row also carried four always-visible buttons that buried the names they sat beside, so the actions moved into a per-row menu.","tree":{"sha":"3be22d41c271b78dde9b20dafda1bd0bb97d9072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/git/trees/3be22d41c271b78dde9b20dafda1bd0bb97d9072"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/git/commits/f7cca3990b4d5b35f4b85c8828c428097b112f8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63741855?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khattasallaman","id":63741855,"login":"khattasallaman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzQxODU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khattasallaman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khattasallaman/baseline-planning-suite/commit/f7cca3990b4d5b35f4b85c8828c428097b112f8f","node_id":"C_kwDOUSqoSdoAKGY3Y2NhMzk5MGI0ZDViMzVmNGI4NWM4ODI4YzQyODA5N2IxMTJmOGY","parents