ini system: NestJS/TypeORM backend, Next.js frontend, Docker Compose. Details:\n- The NestJS backend with Products CRUD API (GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE + GET by id), TypeORM migrations, Zod-validated env config, and Swagger docs have been added;\n- The Next.js (App Router + Tailwind) frontend with add/edit/delete UI, a quantity stepper, and status badges have also been added;\n- Enforced snake_case over the DB/HTTP boundary and camelCase in app code;\n- Added docker-compose.yml running postgres, backend, and frontend together;\n- Added README with run instructions and a technology overview","tree":{"sha":"29cb9930a43f7f82505c2bdfab36fc510abd1663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PetsaYuri/inventory-mini-system/git/trees/29cb9930a43f7f82505c2bdfab36fc510abd1663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PetsaYuri/inventory-mini-system/git/commits/fc5abf26fb96e922d1429c8ad810eaa660af4739","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98687604?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PetsaYuri","id":98687604,"login":"PetsaYuri","node_id":"U_kgDOBeHadA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PetsaYuri","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PetsaYuri/inventory-