er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markpomerant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markpomerant/kos-codex-2/commits/23d39b93d82fdfae6685dcb0ede7ce786ded0512/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:26:07Z","email":"mpomerant@coca-cola.com","name":"Mark Pomerant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:26:07Z","email":"mpomerant@coca-cola.com","name":"Mark Pomerant"},"message":"feat(codex): build the KOS codex against the codex backend\n\n- Add the Nx workspace, CI and build scripts for the codex UI and its Java backend module.\n- Add 32 Storybook pages, each a model, hook, component, story and MDX built with the kosui tooling.\n- Foundations open with communication patterns, model relationships, computed properties and prop keys.\n- Run every story against the codex backend with no mock layer; a device model drives backend events.\n- Extract snippets with the snippet extractor and render them with the snippet-viewer component.\n- Record tooling gaps, per-page notes and requested backend endpoints under planning/.","tree":{"sha":"f8d6da4c2cd4f6c372567b221a6a4d85eed2c769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markpomerant/kos-codex-2/git/trees/f8d6da4c2cd4f6c372567b221a6a4d85eed2c769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markpomerant/kos-codex-2/git/commits/23d39b93d82fdfae6685dcb0ede7ce786ded0512","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115945922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markpomerant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markpomerant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markpomerant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markpomerant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/markpomerant","id":115945922,"login":"markpomerant","node_id":"U_kgDOBukxwg","org