://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/0987f718d2e38311745dd3a1c882635b6e05e09f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:45:18Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T05:45:18Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs: unificar encabezados y quitar las tablas de leyenda de línea\n\nLos cinco README usaban tres variantes del mismo encabezado —«Cómo está\narmada», «Correrla», «Corriendo la demo»—. Quedan «Arquitectura» y «Correr\nla demo», idénticos en las cuatro apps: cambiar de app en la demo no debería\nobligar a reorientarse en el índice.\n\nSe quitan además las tablas «Línea | Significa», que explicaban convenciones\nde Mermaid caja por caja, y los bloques de «Estado» con conteos de tests, que\nenvejecen en cuanto se agrega una suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bb351a6e309fe2b277416098b45f960badc91b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/1bb351a6e309fe2b277416098b45f960badc91b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/0987f718d2e38311745dd3a1c882635b6e05e09f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bb351a6e309fe2b277416098b45f960badc91b6\nparent 5726ab401873b8d0af680c65b681bdddfcc8ec1e\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789710318 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789710318 -0500\n\ndocs: unificar encabezados y quitar las tablas de leyenda de línea\n\nLos cinco README usaban tres variantes del mismo encabezado —«Cómo está\narmada», «Correrla», «Corriendo la demo»—. Quedan «Arquitectura» y «Correr\nla demo», idénticos en las cuatro apps: cambiar de app en la demo no debería\nobligar a reorientarse en el índice.\n\nSe quitan además las tablas «Línea | Significa», que explicaban convenciones\nde Mermaid caja por caja, y los bloques de «Estado» con conteos de tests, que\nenvejecen en cuanto se agrega una suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOZX1X+gh0lmmGg3PsdmK0+9S6kuiD/1uUidLY3L9HLSVBTO1v6poQ4mah9csOn//e\nm1BF44xBUSVPTqdB2AkgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T05:45:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/0987f718d2e38311745dd3a1c882635b6e05e09f","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDA5ODdmNzE4ZDJlMzgzMTE3NDVkZDNhMWM4O