cac, que tocó el archivo y no volvió a correr Prettier —el\nmodo de fallo que PENDING.md predice para un proyecto sin CI—.\n\nEs sólo un reajuste de línea en un texto de ayuda: colapsando espacios el\narchivo es idéntico al anterior, así que no cambia lo que se renderiza. Los 102\ntests siguen en verde y el gate vuelve a salir en 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDmKmZHE9nPCVdK9ivuNPpiYXdUBocb5oS527FhZWhOahQ7mTlQExXVR9yCrtgrn3M\n8UtXhMHbx3NV7yclosrAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/4ad2bec913fe9f60ac62609890cf6c94c47dfd0f","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDRhZDJiZWM5MTNmZTlmNjBhYzYyNjA5ODkwY2Y2Yzk0YzQ3ZGZkMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f","sha":"3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f"}],"sha":"4ad2bec913fe9f60ac62609890cf6c94c47dfd0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/4ad2bec913fe9f60ac62609890cf6c94c47dfd0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:26:17Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:26:17Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(web-angular): leyenda, glosario, y la explicación del symlink medida\n\nEl README declaraba el contrato en v2.3.0 cuando `cases.json` dice 2.4.0.\n\nY explicaba mal por qué hace falta el chequeo de `response.ok`: decía que el\ndev-server contesta el `index.html` del SPA con status 200. Medido, un `.wasm`\nque no está da 404; el fallback del SPA existe pero no se aplica a una ruta con\nextensión de archivo. La conclusión seguía en pie —404 también es\n`!response.ok`—, pero el mecanismo era otro. Se reemplaza por la tabla de las\ntres respuestas reales, que de paso confirma que el dev-server sí sirve\n`application/wasm`.\n\nSe agrega algo que no estaba dicho: el mensaje de error nombra el paquete que\nfalta construir, pero sale sólo por la consola del navegador. En pantalla queda\nuna página en blanco.\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, con leyenda y glosario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fece3270c11cc3155192af6cd41b284caeec09f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/fece3270c11cc3155192af6cd41b284caeec09f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f","verification":{"payload":"tree fece3270c11cc3155192af6cd41b284caeec09f5\nparent 7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698377 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698377 -0500\n\ndocs(web-angular): leyenda, glosario, y la explicación del symlink medida\n\nEl README declaraba el contrato en v2.3.0 cuando `cases.json` dice 2.4.0.\n\nY explicaba mal por qué hace falta el chequeo de `response.ok`: decía que el\ndev-server contesta el `index.html` del SPA con status 200. Medido, un `.wasm`\nque no está da 404; el fallback del SPA existe pero no se aplica a una ruta con\nextensión de archivo. La conclusión seguía en pie —404 también es\n`!response.ok`—, pero el mecanismo era otro. Se reemplaza por la tabla de las\ntres respuestas reales, que de paso confirma que el dev-server sí sirve\n`application/wasm`.\n\nSe agrega algo que no estaba dicho: el mensaje de error nombra el paquete que\nfalta construir, pero sale sólo por la consola del navegador. En pantalla queda\nuna página en blanco.\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, con leyenda y glosario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPusLq1KSuUUGvayXq8qarjnaxlRgeHVho8DtNDKPm8gFnGyqzoeqj45ItosLF+hT3\neRuXGdS5Jy4fyqBTxV0QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDNmOWMzZWNlN2NjYjI1ZDVkNmIzMzU4NGMxYmEyOTQwYTE5YTZkOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905","sha":"7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905"}],"sha":"3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3f9c3ece7ccb25d5d6b33584c1ba2940a19a6d8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:26:07Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:26:07Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(react-native): el paso de codegen que faltaba, y cuatro afirmaciones falsas\n\nProbar el README desde un clone limpio encontró un paso que no estaba\ndocumentado en ningún archivo del subproyecto. `bob build` corre tres targets,\nno uno: el tercero es el codegen de React Native, que escribe\n`android/generated/` e `ios/generated/`. Su `codegenConfig` declara\n`includesGeneratedCode: true`, o sea que Gradle y CocoaPods no los regeneran\nporque confían en que ya están. Con el `--ignore-scripts` del Paso 0 nunca se\ngeneran, están gitignoreados, y nada los repone: Android muere con\n`Unresolved reference ''NativeCoreFinancieroSpec''` e iOS con\n`fatal error: ''CoreFinancieroSpec.h'' file not found`, sin nombrar la causa.\nSe documenta `pnpm exec bob build --target codegen`, y en iOS repetir\n`pod install`, porque el de `ubrn:ios` corre antes de que `ios/generated/`\nexista.\n\nTres afirmaciones más que la ejecución desmintió: la suite no da 129 con los\ntres comandos que listaba —falta `wasm:generate`, y sin él son 92—; los tests\nno necesitan el toolchain nativo, porque `jest.config.js` remapea `./bindings`\nal módulo de N-API y ninguna suite toca lo que produce ubrn; y `BancoApp.test`\nno cae por `src/bindings` sino por ese mismo módulo. Los tiempos se anotan\ntambién en frío: 3:21 y 3:05 desde un clone limpio, contra ~1:01 y ~12 s con\ncargo tibio.\n\nSe documenta además el diálogo de permiso de red local que aparece en Android\n17: lo pide React Native, no esta app, sólo en debug y sólo para alcanzar a\nMetro. El manifiesto fusionado de release no lo lleva.\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, con leyenda y glosario. Los dos tests se quedan en\nel dibujo a propósito: son la razón de ser de las salidas N-API y WASM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6556a3aee3ea1a0c551ae8882d794cab55680f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/d6556a3aee3ea1a0c551ae8882d794cab55680f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905","verification":{"payload":"tree d6556a3aee3ea1a0c551ae8882d794cab55680f2\nparent f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698367 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698367 -0500\n\ndocs(react-native): el paso de codegen que faltaba, y cuatro afirmaciones falsas\n\nProbar el README desde un clone limpio encontró un paso que no estaba\ndocumentado en ningún archivo del subproyecto. `bob build` corre tres targets,\nno uno: el tercero es el codegen de React Native, que escribe\n`android/generated/` e `ios/generated/`. Su `codegenConfig` declara\n`includesGeneratedCode: true`, o sea que Gradle y CocoaPods no los regeneran\nporque confían en que ya están. Con el `--ignore-scripts` del Paso 0 nunca se\ngeneran, están gitignoreados, y nada los repone: Android muere con\n`Unresolved reference ''NativeCoreFinancieroSpec''` e iOS con\n`fatal error: ''CoreFinancieroSpec.h'' file not found`, sin nombrar la causa.\nSe documenta `pnpm exec bob build --target codegen`, y en iOS repetir\n`pod install`, porque el de `ubrn:ios` corre antes de que `ios/generated/`\nexista.\n\nTres afirmaciones más que la ejecución desmintió: la suite no da 129 con los\ntres comandos que listaba —falta `wasm:generate`, y sin él son 92—; los tests\nno necesitan el toolchain nativo, porque `jest.config.js` remapea `./bindings`\nal módulo de N-API y ninguna suite toca lo que produce ubrn; y `BancoApp.test`\nno cae por `src/bindings` sino por ese mismo módulo. Los tiempos se anotan\ntambién en frío: 3:21 y 3:05 desde un clone limpio, contra ~1:01 y ~12 s con\ncargo tibio.\n\nSe documenta además el diálogo de permiso de red local que aparece en Android\n17: lo pide React Native, no esta app, sólo en debug y sólo para alcanzar a\nMetro. El manifiesto fusionado de release no lo lleva.\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, con leyenda y glosario. Los dos tests se quedan en\nel dibujo a propósito: son la razón de ser de las salidas N-API y WASM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQClx8paOzBaIMeHTlJ5gKF3NbXplT1j/aSBM6h8OucF27gB72S46B3c39BY6Qt/FZ0\neDrKBXYrDk6wLA3qUv9g4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDdlYmNlZDViOGIyYzJmY2U5NThhOWQxZmEwY2YwYWE0MzliZWM5MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f","sha":"f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f"}],"sha":"7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/7ebced5b8b2c2fce958a9d1fa0cf0aa439bec905"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:58Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:58Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): leyenda, glosario, y fijar el runtime del simulador\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, «Leyenda» con los estilos de línea y glosario de\ntarget, slice, modulemap, Run Script y @Observable.\n\nBUILD.md afirmaba como hecho vigente que «iPhone 17 Pro» existe y que por eso\nel destino va verbatim, sin `OS=`. Deja de ser cierto al instalarse un runtime\nmás nuevo: `OS:latest` resuelve a ese, el modelo puede no existir ahí, y\nxcodebuild corta con `Unable to find a device matching`. Se conserva la\nafirmación como registro de la Fase 3 y se le agrega la salvedad.\n\nEl bloque de iOS del Paso 1 del README raíz llevaba al mismo muro sin avisar;\nla advertencia se agrega allí en el commit del README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa82bf99d1cfeae5ac69c3f0560abb9cd239b453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/fa82bf99d1cfeae5ac69c3f0560abb9cd239b453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f","verification":{"payload":"tree fa82bf99d1cfeae5ac69c3f0560abb9cd239b453\nparent 5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698358 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698358 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): leyenda, glosario, y fijar el runtime del simulador\n\nDiagrama vaciado a nombres, «Leyenda» con los estilos de línea y glosario de\ntarget, slice, modulemap, Run Script y @Observable.\n\nBUILD.md afirmaba como hecho vigente que «iPhone 17 Pro» existe y que por eso\nel destino va verbatim, sin `OS=`. Deja de ser cierto al instalarse un runtime\nmás nuevo: `OS:latest` resuelve a ese, el modelo puede no existir ahí, y\nxcodebuild corta con `Unable to find a device matching`. Se conserva la\nafirmación como registro de la Fase 3 y se le agrega la salvedad.\n\nEl bloque de iOS del Paso 1 del README raíz llevaba al mismo muro sin avisar;\nla advertencia se agrega allí en el commit del README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKohY90PJZILHzoenzAYO0bbuc0TDvSu7eeTyAfW2YZQCYFYnepSjq/6oaHWunB00O\nxj0SaAofHHUGTHfapkRgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGY3NGRjZjllZGY1NTkxY2RiYTU2M2E1NTY2Y2M0MDhiZjY3ZmJjMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc","sha":"5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc"}],"sha":"f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f74dcf9edf5591cdba563a5566cc408bf67fbc0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:58Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:58Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(android): leyenda, glosario, y el destino de los bindings que quedó del pre-split\n\nEl diagrama tenía quince cajas con quince líneas de descripción adentro, cinco\nde ellas suites de test y una sonda apagada: contestaba dos preguntas a la vez.\nLas de test salen —ya están mejor documentadas en «Correr los tests»— y quedan\nel nombre en cada caja, una «Leyenda» con los estilos de línea, y un glosario.\n\nEl defecto que habría trabado a cualquiera está en BUILD.md: la sección de\nbindings Kotlin manda a escribir en `app/src/main/java`, pero la verificación\nque ella misma da doce líneas después mira `core-financiero/src/generated/java`,\nque es donde Gradle busca desde el split de la Fase 6. Siguiendo el texto al pie\nde la letra el binding cae en el módulo equivocado, la compilación falla por\nreferencias no resueltas, y queda un archivo generado dentro del código a mano\nde :app, que no está en .gitignore.\n\nTambién en BUILD.md: la sección de JNA decía `app/build.gradle.kts` con\n`implementation`, cuando vive en `core-financiero/build.gradle.kts` con `api`;\ny el comentario de `abiFilters` nombraba un módulo cuando el bloque está en los\ndos.\n\nEl comando de diagnóstico pasa de `ls` con comodín a `find`, por lo mismo que\nel del README raíz.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"850f3a897ac50138586df280a9420ec9be847557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/850f3a897ac50138586df280a9420ec9be847557"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/5787b890cedfc941c509896704ac86c75767b7bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 850f3a897ac50138586df280a9420ec9be847557\nparent 38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698358 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698358 -0500\n\ndocs(android): leyenda, glosario, y el destino de los bindings que quedó del pre-split\n\nEl diagrama tenía quince cajas con quince líneas de descripción adentro, cinco\nde ellas suites de test y una sonda apagada: contestaba dos preguntas a la vez.\nLas de test salen —ya están mejor documentadas en «Correr los tests»— y quedan\nel nombre en cada caja, una «Leyenda» con los estilos de línea, y un glosario.\n\nEl defecto que habría trabado a cualquiera está en BUILD.md: la sección de\nbindings Kotlin manda a escribir en `app/src/main/java`, pero la verificación\nque ella misma da doce líneas después mira `core-financiero/src/generated/java`,\nque es donde Gradle busca desde el split de la Fase 6. Siguiendo el texto al pie\nde la letra el binding cae en el módulo equivocado, la compilación falla por\nreferencias no resueltas, y queda un archivo generado dentro del código a mano\nde :app, que no está en .gitignore.\n\nTambién en BUILD.md: la sección de JNA decía `app/build.gradle.kts` con\n`implementation`, cuando vive en `core-financiero/build.gradle.kts` con `api`;\ny el comentario de `abiFilters` nombraba un módulo cuando el bloque está en los\ndos.\n\nEl comando de diagnóstico pasa de `ls` con comodín a `find`, por lo mismo que\nel del README raíz.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMiCuqPs36iHiSoUjPu8CXQdFEsA7c4ATQ4s1H2rrKDHkjat87/xB2O4gAGkovxJlv\n/vLGsQV3KNegleYDvoiQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c