ps://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(rust-core): leyenda del diagrama y tres afirmaciones que envejecieron\n\nEl diagrama usaba `graph TD` y tres estilos de flecha sin declarar, incluida\nuna gruesa que nada explicaba, y dibujaba `ffi --> domain` mientras el README\nraíz dibuja lo contrario para la misma relación. Pasa a `flowchart LR` con dos\nestilos declarados, la misma dirección que la raíz, y una leyenda que glosa\n`cdylib`, `staticlib` y `lib`.\n\nAdemás: el encabezado decía «Estado: Fase 1 completada» pero reportaba los 71\ntests, que son posteriores a la Fase 6; dos frases hablaban en futuro de la app\nAngular, que existe desde la Fase 5; y el comando de exportación a WASM seguía\nsiendo `ubrn build web`, que ya no es el subcomando real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6ddee72d6a28c58880409a6c4d816111adef802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/e6ddee72d6a28c58880409a6c4d816111adef802"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128","verification":{"payload":"tree e6ddee72d6a28c58880409a6c4d816111adef802\nparent f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698349 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698349 -0500\n\ndocs(rust-core): leyenda del diagrama y tres afirmaciones que envejecieron\n\nEl diagrama usaba `graph TD` y tres estilos de flecha sin declarar, incluida\nuna gruesa que nada explicaba, y dibujaba `ffi --> domain` mientras el README\nraíz dibuja lo contrario para la misma relación. Pasa a `flowchart LR` con dos\nestilos declarados, la misma dirección que la raíz, y una leyenda que glosa\n`cdylib`, `staticlib` y `lib`.\n\nAdemás: el encabezado decía «Estado: Fase 1 completada» pero reportaba los 71\ntests, que son posteriores a la Fase 6; dos frases hablaban en futuro de la app\nAngular, que existe desde la Fase 5; y el comando de exportación a WASM seguía\nsiendo `ubrn build web`, que ya no es el subcomando real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBC5qK0S1XYm0J4tegiNkTdnc5XYODYrukZzvcQTmN7ubUyceU3fh7+1ycfLD/X80I\nojehiw/5LaHldHh4Uluw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDM4ZWU4NGI0OTY3ZDQ3NzcwMzhkYzJmZDJmNzBhOWYzOTk4MGExMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77","sha":"f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77"}],"sha":"38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/38ee84b4967d4777038dc2fd2f70a9f39980a128"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:25:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs: rediseñar el diagrama de arquitectura y aclarar el arranque\n\nEl diagrama tenía tres o cuatro líneas de descripción dentro de cada caja y\ntres semánticas de flecha con sólo dos estilos, ninguno declarado. Ahora las\ncajas llevan sólo el nombre, la descripción vive en una tabla «Leyenda» propia\ny los dos estilos de línea están explicados. Se suma un glosario de los cinco\ntérminos que el documento usa sin definir.\n\nEl Paso 0 se reescribe entero. Probarlo desde un clone limpio destapó que su\ncomando de diagnóstico no servía: un `ls` con comodines aborta entero en zsh\ncuando un patrón no encuentra nada, o sea justo en el caso que existe para\ndiagnosticar, y nunca imprime el mensaje que el texto prometía. Lo reemplaza un\nbucle verificado en bash, zsh y sh. El texto tampoco decía desde qué estado se\narranca ni que instalar y generar son dos pasos distintos y en orden.\n\nEl Paso 1 se parte en cuatro bloques, uno por plataforma, cada uno autónomo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6464c25aa3a050deab93b9ecae1d0d918cc2aecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/6464c25aa3a050deab93b9ecae1d0d918cc2aecb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/f6543ae95570e4938c2d1ae384a91eb6d686aa77","verification":{"payload":"tree 6464c25aa3a050deab93b9ecae1d0d918cc2aecb\nparent acb621a2c2ae2bd1463c76eabca6c06f0ea8d0f8\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698349 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789698349 -0500\n\ndocs: rediseñar el diagrama de arquitectura y aclarar el arranque\n\nEl diagrama tenía tres o cuatro líneas de descripción dentro de cada caja y\ntres semánticas de flecha con sólo dos estilos, ninguno declarado. Ahora las\ncajas llevan sólo el nombre, la descripción vive en una tabla «Leyenda» propia\ny los dos estilos de línea están explicados. Se suma un glosario de los cinco\ntérminos que el documento usa sin definir.\n\nEl Paso 0 se reescribe entero. Probarlo desde un clone limpio destapó que su\ncomando de diagnóstico no servía: un `ls` con comodines aborta entero en zsh\ncuando un patrón no encuentra nada, o sea justo en el caso que existe para\ndiagnosticar, y nunca imprime el mensaje que el texto prometía. Lo reemplaza un\nbucle verificado en bash, zsh y sh. El texto tampoco decía desde qué estado se\narranca ni que instalar y generar son dos pasos distintos y en orden.\n\nEl Paso 1 se parte en cuatro bloques, uno por plataforma, cada uno autónomo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFdW0Zhk9JP0xxBzZdtZXpvRGQM0tWyYO9yLdScKB33Lw22d/25wIzhNIrIt/p1U83\nlGv+/adgCU1VkEcdRUlA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T02:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi