essage":"docs(ios): registrar la salida completa del benchmark post-split\n\nLos números de la re-medición vivían sólo en la conversación y en tres\nfilas de TESTING.md. Quedan en los dos lugares que les corresponden:\n\n- apps/ios/README.md: la salida completa de FfiCostProbe, las ocho\n  líneas, con fecha y el porqué de la corrida.\n- docs/cross-app-pending.md: la comparación contra la Fase 7, debajo del\n  cuadro de los cuatro puentes, que es su dueño único.\n\nEl cuadro de los cuatro puentes NO se edita fila por fila: las cuatro son\nde la misma campaña, en los mismos aparatos, la misma tarde, y eso es lo\núnico que las hace comparables. Las re-mediciones se anotan debajo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6891e03345c5df888015e2336d0c0a9a1e4cdf44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/6891e03345c5df888015e2336d0c0a9a1e4cdf44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/63cf5724a7b4ed059d2d580a8e6cb6b320be32e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6891e03345c5df888015e2336d0c0a9a1e4cdf44\nparent 95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668991 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668991 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): registrar la salida completa del benchmark post-split\n\nLos números de la re-medición vivían sólo en la conversación y en tres\nfilas de TESTING.md. Quedan en los dos lugares que les corresponden:\n\n- apps/ios/README.md: la salida completa de FfiCostProbe, las ocho\n  líneas, con fecha y el porqué de la corrida.\n- docs/cross-app-pending.md: la comparación contra la Fase 7, debajo del\n  cuadro de los cuatro puentes, que es su dueño único.\n\nEl cuadro de los cuatro puentes NO se edita fila por fila: las cuatro son\nde la misma campaña, en los mismos aparatos, la misma tarde, y eso es lo\núnico que las hace comparables. Las re-mediciones se anotan debajo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA4++aSbGTypKtwLe/NJijKl09O1jNb0rGAXab01Pxrghlhzau6/CTIJzZ3s6pSg4J\nps113QvVFgABtqZk0hVwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:16:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/63cf5724a7b4ed059d2d580a8e6cb6b320be32e5","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDYzY2Y1NzI0YTdiNGVkMDU5ZDJkNTgwYThlNmNiNmIzMjBiZTMyZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2","sha":"95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2"}],"sha":"63cf5724a7b4ed059d2d580a8e6cb6b320be32e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/63cf5724a7b4ed059d2d580a8e6cb6b320be32e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:15:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:15:49Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): verificar que el split no movió el piso del cruce\n\nSe volvió a correr FfiCostProbe en el mismo iPhone 12 y en Release\ndespués de partir la app en dos targets. El piso queda en 0,062 µs,\nidéntico al dígito.\n\nLo que hace concluyente la medición es la fila de control:\nNativeBaseline.add no cruza el FFI y se movió el mismo -1,4% que add,\nlo que identifica la variación como ruido entre corridas. Sin esa fila,\nun -1,4% en add no se distingue de una regresión chica.\n\nDe paso, la corrida valida la decisión de no usar `@testable` sobre el\nkit: va en Release con ENABLE_TESTABILITY=YES, que es justo la\ncombinación que habría dejado de compilar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8975695f0c20eb090d96d7d4d195156a34ac2d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/8975695f0c20eb090d96d7d4d195156a34ac2d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 8975695f0c20eb090d96d7d4d195156a34ac2d37\nparent c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668949 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668949 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): verificar que el split no movió el piso del cruce\n\nSe volvió a correr FfiCostProbe en el mismo iPhone 12 y en Release\ndespués de partir la app en dos targets. El piso queda en 0,062 µs,\nidéntico al dígito.\n\nLo que hace concluyente la medición es la fila de control:\nNativeBaseline.add no cruza el FFI y se movió el mismo -1,4% que add,\nlo que identifica la variación como ruido entre corridas. Sin esa fila,\nun -1,4% en add no se distingue de una regresión chica.\n\nDe paso, la corrida valida la decisión de no usar `@testable` sobre el\nkit: va en Release con ENABLE_TESTABILITY=YES, que es justo la\ncombinación que habría dejado de compilar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIs3o8AhXVMXbWXVaZ9lKHsy6pPGaj88lUfiiiOF/kHigPT6vhGZqMSiPSZZWeLJUC\n3vTToI/+aB2mFYuwsveQ0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:15:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDk1YTQyOGY3YWRkMjk4NmQ5ZThjNmQyNzczMzlhN2JmZDlmYzk3YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee","sha":"c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee"}],"sha":"95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/95a428f7add2986d9e8c6d277339a7bfd9fc97b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:13:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:13:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): ledger de ejecución del split de targets\n\nLos rulings no se deducen del diff: que Swift rechaza `public` en los\nrequirements de un protocolo, que los comandos de simulador necesitan\n`,OS=26.5` en esta máquina, que el `strings` con cuantificador abierto\ndevuelve un SHA que no existe, y por qué el bundle de test NO declara el\nkit en su fase Frameworks.\n\nMismo criterio que las seis fases anteriores, que también lo versionan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b615c38cdd0522e02f37d3762b93de5d37bdcebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/b615c38cdd0522e02f37d3762b93de5d37bdcebf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee","verification":{"payload":"tree b615c38cdd0522e02f37d3762b93de5d37bdcebf\nparent 2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668819 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668819 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): ledger de ejecución del split de targets\n\nLos rulings no se deducen del diff: que Swift rechaza `public` en los\nrequirements de un protocolo, que los comandos de simulador necesitan\n`,OS=26.5` en esta máquina, que el `strings` con cuantificador abierto\ndevuelve un SHA que no existe, y por qué el bundle de test NO declara el\nkit en su fase Frameworks.\n\nMismo criterio que las seis fases anteriores, que también lo versionan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJUXNvzyQnceNGpXy/TdsF7n5aj12hzY/sO63Z+Hg0v6x1si32LTVeNPkEGYeWGMSs\njWbHjhPUogovwkXLDiDAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGM5NjViNzA1ZDlhNzRkZGMyMjcyYmY4MDljZjIxZmU1OWVkZjBiZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3","sha":"2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3"}],"sha":"c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/c965b705d9a74ddc2272bf809cf21fe59edf0bee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:00:30Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:00:30Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(android,ios): cerrar los hallazgos de la revisión final del split de targets\n\nNueve correcciones de la revisión previa al PR de feat/ios-target-split:\n\n- apps/android/PENDING.md ya no dice que iOS sigue en un target único; nombra\n  CoreFinancieroKit y su naturaleza estática, y remite al PENDING de iOS.\n- apps/ios/BUILD.md corrige el largo de 959025fca (9, no 10) y reemplaza el comando\n  \"correcto\" del footgun de strings: acotar a {7} reintroducía el mismo fallo, porque\n  core.abbrev crece con la cantidad de objetos del repo. La forma nueva compara por\n  substring literal contra el SHA de HEAD en vez de extraer con una expresión regular,\n  y queda documentado que, corrida hoy, no matchea contra el XCFramework congelado en\n  959025f (esperado: esta tanda no regeneró el artefacto) junto con la corrida que sí\n  matcheó.\n- apps/ios/CONTEXT.md corrige la premisa de que uniffi emite las funciones globales en\n  el módulo de la app y de que no hay que prefijarlas: el módulo es CoreFinancieroKit y\n  el adapter sí las prefija a propósito, para desambiguar de un método homónimo.\n- apps/ios/README.md alinea el comando de diagnóstico del kit con BUILD.md (con\n  ,OS=26.5), que es el que corre en esta máquina.\n- apps/ios/CONTEXT.md vuelve a cubrir apps/ios/Generated/include/ en la prohibición de\n  editar generados, que había quedado afuera.\n- apps/ios/PENDING.md recorta a cuatro líneas el desarrollo duplicado del seam débil en\n  el ítem abierto, con un enlace interno al ítem cerrado que ya lo desarrolla completo.\n- apps/ios/BUILD.md agrega por qué el bundle de test no enlaza CoreFinancieroKit en su\n  fase Frameworks: el kit ya está dentro del binario de la app vía TEST_HOST/\n  BUNDLE_LOADER, y enlazarlo de nuevo metería una segunda copia de sus objetos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4563f63f85772e8814c90317083398c341726d18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/4563f63f85772e8814c90317083398c341726d18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3","verification":{"payload":"tree 4563f63f85772e8814c90317083398c341726d18\nparent f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668030 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668030 -0500\n\ndocs(android,ios): cerrar los hallazgos de la revisión final del split de targets\n\nNueve correcciones de la revisión previa al PR de feat/ios-target-split:\n\n- apps/android/PENDING.md ya no dice que iOS sigue en un target único; nombra\n  CoreFinancieroKit y su naturaleza estática, y remite al PENDING de iOS.\n- apps/ios/BUILD.md corrige el largo de 959025fca (9, no 10) y reemplaza el comando\n  \"correcto\" del footgun de strings: acotar a {7} reintroducía el mismo fallo, porque\n  core.abbrev crece con la cantidad de objetos del repo. La forma nueva compara por\n  substring literal contra el SHA de HEAD en vez de extraer con una expresión regular,\n  y queda documentado que, corrida hoy, no matchea contra el XCFramework congelado en\n  959025f (esperado: esta tanda no regeneró el artefacto) junto con la corrida que sí\n  matcheó.\n- apps/ios/CONTEXT.md corrige la premisa de que uniffi emite las funciones globales en\n  el módulo de la app y de que no hay que prefijarlas: el módulo es CoreFinancieroKit y\n  el adapter sí las prefija a propósito, para desambiguar de un método homónimo.\n- apps/ios/README.md alinea el comando de diagnóstico del kit con BUILD.md (con\n  ,OS=26.5), que es el que corre en esta máquina.\n- apps/ios/CONTEXT.md vuelve a cubrir apps/ios/Generated/include/ en la prohibición de\n  editar generados, que había quedado afuera.\n- apps/ios/PENDING.md recorta a cuatro líneas el desarrollo duplicado del seam débil en\n  el ítem abierto, con un enlace interno al ítem cerrado que ya lo desarrolla completo.\n- apps/ios/BUILD.md agrega por qué el bundle de test no enlaza CoreFinancieroKit en su\n  fase Frameworks: el kit ya está dentro del binario de la app vía TEST_HOST/\n  BUNDLE_LOADER, y enlazarlo de nuevo metería una segunda copia de sus objetos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAjj1RQkKISEurU2yGQg/+35tKeM2rCpK8Qk5BQCj5dlIz9q6L1ONf80Ar2npJDC7d\nF2i1sJ9lfI8DALzK4W/wQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDJjNzM0MmMzN2U5ZDdiYTRkMzg3YTRkMTFmYjI1N2Y5ZTg3MGJhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4","sha":"f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4"}],"sha":"2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/2c7342c37e9d7ba4d387a4d11fb257f9e870bab3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:00:13Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:00:13Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"fix(ios): limpiar el pbxproj del target nuevo y dar consumidor a ContractMessages.fallback\n\nBorra el Foundation.framework colgado a un iPhoneOS18.0.sdk inexistente en esta máquina\n(Swift lo enlaza solo) junto con su grupo vacío; alinea CLANG_ENABLE_OBJC_WEAK y saca las\nclaves de dylib letra muerta en un target MACH_O_TYPE=staticlib; agrega la entrada de\nTargetAttributes de CoreFinancieroKit para que Xcode no la escriba sola en el próximo save.\n\nContractMessagesTest ahora compara contra ContractMessages.fallback en vez del literal\nduplicado, así la constante public gana el consumidor que le faltaba.\n\n54 tests en 13 suites siguen en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fbb3d97f547cd004d1bb83186fa9e8a5ff1e06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/8fbb3d97f547cd004d1bb83186fa9e8a5ff1e06d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4","verification":{"payload":"tree 8fbb3d97f547cd004d1bb83186fa9e8a5ff1e06d\nparent bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668013 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789668013 -0500\n\nfix(ios): limpiar el pbxproj del target nuevo y dar consumidor a ContractMessages.fallback\n\nBorra el Foundation.framework colgado a un iPhoneOS18.0.sdk inexistente en esta máquina\n(Swift lo enlaza solo) junto con su grupo vacío; alinea CLANG_ENABLE_OBJC_WEAK y saca las\nclaves de dylib letra muerta en un target MACH_O_TYPE=staticlib; agrega la entrada de\nTargetAttributes de CoreFinancieroKit para que Xcode no la escriba sola en el próximo save.\n\nContractMessagesTest ahora compara contra ContractMessages.fallback en vez del literal\nduplicado, así la constante public gana el consumidor que le faltaba.\n\n54 tests en 13 suites siguen en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGXwm4ySCZkMWRY+GnBSrh0OJb6oAL+Ub1I+nNxqXDE+eZyqM1pPSxsyaDGrsWo0OR\na0q/cO0tmtTar5rpm7WAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGYyYThiOTkxMzQzYjNhNjk4MWFmZDRmZjViMGUwMmIyZTM5Y2RjYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a","sha":"bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a"}],"sha":"f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f2a8b991343b3a6981afd4ff5b0e02b2e39cdcc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:49:26Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:49:26Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): documentar el footgun de strings al extraer el coreVersion del .a\n\nTask 3 del plan 2026-09-17-ios-target-split encontró que\n`strings ... | grep -oE ''[0-9a-f]{7,}''` (sin límite superior) produce un\nSHA falso pero plausible: strings no separa literales &''static str\ncontiguos en un binario de Rust, así que el patrón se come caracteres del\nliteral siguiente (un mensaje de pánico) y devuelve 959025fca en vez del\n959025f real, verificado en pantalla en iOS y en Android.\n\nFaltaba documentar esto en apps/ios/BUILD.md, que es donde se explica cómo\nverificar el artefacto compilado. Se agrega la sección con el comando\ncodicioso, la causa, el comando correcto con {7} exacto, y el principio\nque la sustenta: el artefacto es una pista, no la autoridad — la pantalla\nmanda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f0506bbae94d1fa9d593da03c6c569696cb54a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/7f0506bbae94d1fa9d593da03c6c569696cb54a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f0506bbae94d1fa9d593da03c6c569696cb54a2\nparent fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789667366 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789667366 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): documentar el footgun de strings al extraer el coreVersion del .a\n\nTask 3 del plan 2026-09-17-ios-target-split encontró que\n`strings ... | grep -oE ''[0-9a-f]{7,}''` (sin límite superior) produce un\nSHA falso pero plausible: strings no separa literales &''static str\ncontiguos en un binario de Rust, así que el patrón se come caracteres del\nliteral siguiente (un mensaje de pánico) y devuelve 959025fca en vez del\n959025f real, verificado en pantalla en iOS y en Android.\n\nFaltaba documentar esto en apps/ios/BUILD.md, que es donde se explica cómo\nverificar el artefacto compilado. Se agrega la sección con el comando\ncodicioso, la causa, el comando correcto con {7} exacto, y el principio\nque la sustenta: el artefacto es una pista, no la autoridad — la pantalla\nmanda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPVu4KevRNdwKSxTQOE6diXvwz8bCMvOnP4Vd0/yVTBpejOivkhcH2OvhJHQWsDS6R\nZ1kPpYOZvwqxwnEwwk8w8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGJkMTk2MmQ3YWRkYjRlMWFmOTU4MmY3NWQ2MmZiNmZmZmY2MGZiMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c","sha":"fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c"}],"sha":"bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/bd1962d7addb4e1af9582f75d62fb6ffff60fb0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:43:27Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:43:27Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): corregir la premisa del split y cerrar el ítem del target único\n\nEl PENDING justificaba esta deuda diciendo que con el borde FFI en otro\ntarget, un test de presentación que llamara al core real no compilaría.\nEs falso: el bundle de tests hostea en la app, la app enlaza el framework,\ny los tests de ViewModel tienen que importarlo igual porque\nContractMessages, ValidCci y DomainError viven ahí.\n\nEn Android el seam lo cierra el runtime —la JVM no puede cargar la `.so`—,\nno el compilador. iOS no tiene ese mecanismo porque el core se enlaza\nestáticamente. Por eso el ítem del seam débil queda ABIERTO aunque el\nsplit ya esté hecho.\n\nEl diagrama del README pasa a mostrar los dos targets, y BUILD.md suma la\nestructura de targets, que es lo que reemplaza al script de migración\n—que no se commitea porque no es re-ejecutable—.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50da76ee2433462e0181b909d3e2863220d5f1be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/50da76ee2433462e0181b909d3e2863220d5f1be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 50da76ee2433462e0181b909d3e2863220d5f1be\nparent 60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789667007 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789667007 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): corregir la premisa del split y cerrar el ítem del target único\n\nEl PENDING justificaba esta deuda diciendo que con el borde FFI en otro\ntarget, un test de presentación que llamara al core real no compilaría.\nEs falso: el bundle de tests hostea en la app, la app enlaza el framework,\ny los tests de ViewModel tienen que importarlo igual porque\nContractMessages, ValidCci y DomainError viven ahí.\n\nEn Android el seam lo cierra el runtime —la JVM no puede cargar la `.so`—,\nno el compilador. iOS no tiene ese mecanismo porque el core se enlaza\nestáticamente. Por eso el ítem del seam débil queda ABIERTO aunque el\nsplit ya esté hecho.\n\nEl diagrama del README pasa a mostrar los dos targets, y BUILD.md suma la\nestructura de targets, que es lo que reemplaza al script de migración\n—que no se commitea porque no es re-ejecutable—.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL1EMOOlv4jZPbL8qC9kec9QWsWjdyDY7Tq07GUYAshwg4FnQS3fGkdGFVf+7NcYPj\nNNHCC5y2yKo7Tqj6TDggw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGZhNGU4NzJjNWYyOTA5N2YwMzQ5NDQyMDBjYjI1YTZhYmJhNTZhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e","sha":"60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e"}],"sha":"fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/fa4e872c5f29097f034944200cb25a6abba56a4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:36:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:36:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): corregir la extracción del coreVersion en el plan\n\nEl `grep -oE ''…[0-9a-f]{7,}''` del Step 4 era codicioso: `strings` no separa\nliterales contiguos en un binario de Rust, así que el SHA quedaba pegado al\nliteral siguiente —`called \\`Result::unwrap()\\`…`— y el patrón se comía la\n`ca`, devolviendo `959025fca`, un SHA que no existe.\n\nEl valor real es `1.0.0+959025f`, verificado en pantalla en iOS y en el\nPixel 6. El artefacto pasa a ser pista, no autoridad.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97b84db3b8fb28c68574d26a8cdb2b245111fc59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/97b84db3b8fb28c68574d26a8cdb2b245111fc59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e","verification":{"payload":"tree 97b84db3b8fb28c68574d26a8cdb2b245111fc59\nparent 92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789666599 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789666599 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): corregir la extracción del coreVersion en el plan\n\nEl `grep -oE ''…[0-9a-f]{7,}''` del Step 4 era codicioso: `strings` no separa\nliterales contiguos en un binario de Rust, así que el SHA quedaba pegado al\nliteral siguiente —`called \\`Result::unwrap()\\`…`— y el patrón se comía la\n`ca`, devolviendo `959025fca`, un SHA que no existe.\n\nEl valor real es `1.0.0+959025f`, verificado en pantalla en iOS y en el\nPixel 6. El artefacto pasa a ser pista, no autoridad.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQITAueQ5ljO1aamdpRXue1wioVyo/7bQZD/a2sG+qAFODitNR9zdbKqzVEXmnNhQEC\njVjjaK2WpkqPrz5S+1RgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDYwYjNhZGJlOTdmNjZjMzI0OGI5MWJlZjg5YzQ4NjI5NTcwNDUxM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c","sha":"92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c"}],"sha":"60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/60b3adbe97f66c3248b91bef89c486295704513e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:22:41Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:22:41Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"refactor(ios): nace el target CoreFinancieroKit con el borde FFI\n\nExtrae `Adapter/`, `Contract/` y el `core_financiero.swift` generado a un\nframework estático propio. `ios-rust-test` queda con UI, Format y el\ncontenedor, y los consume con `import CoreFinancieroKit`.\n\nEstático y no dinámico a propósito: el piso de cruce de 0,062 µs que\npublica docs/cross-app-pending.md depende de que el `.a` quede enlazado\ndentro del binario de la app. Uno dinámico metería indirección de dyld en\ncada llamada.\n\nLos tres ajustes de concurrencia del target nuevo se copian de la app\n—SWIFT_DEFAULT_ACTOR_ISOLATION, SWIFT_APPROACHABLE_CONCURRENCY y\nSWIFT_UPCOMING_FEATURE_MEMBER_IMPORT_VISIBILITY—: si no coinciden, el\nadapter cambia de aislamiento al cruzar de módulo y la app deja de\ncompilar por concurrencia, lejos de la causa.\n\nNo se usa `@testable import` sobre el kit: ENABLE_TESTABILITY solo está en\nDebug y el benchmark de la Fase 7 se mide en Release. Se pagan 40\n`public` más un init para no romper esa corrida.\n\nSin cambios de comportamiento: 54 tests en 13 suites, el mismo conteo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"529bda0d4f413307a42c3cd1de018799a95abbf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/529bda0d4f413307a42c3cd1de018799a95abbf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/92b8b3c09d88b1688260d6bc12f4da813ecff34c","verification":{"payload":"tree 529bda0d4f413307a42c3cd1de018799a95abbf6\nparent f985308659ee8cd333ae65ca2220c44ea841c3e4\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789665761 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789665761 -0500\n\nrefactor(ios): nace el target CoreFinancieroKit con el borde FFI\n\nExtrae `Adapter/`, `Contract/` y el `core_financiero.swift` generado a un\nframework estático propio. `ios-rust-test` queda con UI, Format y el\ncontenedor, y los consume con `import CoreFinancieroKit`.\n\nEstático y no dinámico a propósito: el piso de cruce de 0,062 µs que\npublica docs/cross-app-pending.md depende de que el `.a` quede enlazado\ndentro del binario de la app. Uno dinámico metería indirección de dyld en\ncada llamada.\n\nLos tres ajustes de concurrencia del target nuevo se copian de la app\n—SWIFT_DEFAULT_ACTOR_ISOLATION, SWIFT_APPROACHABLE_CONCURRENCY y\nSWIFT_UPCOMING_FEATURE_MEMBER_IMPORT_VISIBILITY—: si no coinciden, el\nadapter cambia de aislamiento al cruzar de módulo y la app deja de\ncompilar por concurrencia, lejos de la causa.\n\nNo se usa `@testable import` sobre el kit: ENABLE_TESTABILITY solo está en\nDebug y el benchmark de la Fase 7 se mide en Release. Se pagan 40\n`public` más un init para no romper esa corrida.\n\nSin cambios de comportamiento: 54 tests en 13 suites, el mismo conteo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMrlczVMJuv28wRsDaNq4YYJQaf4PV+DaeBugfIk+7n6q/Ninv01riTLrn2FmkcZSc\nxii+rPDWMBumWeRTua2wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:14:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use