l":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/f985308659ee8cd333ae65ca2220c44ea841c3e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:11:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:11:39Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(ios): rulings del preflight sobre el plan del split\n\nP1: son 40 declaraciones `public`, no 39 — contado sobre los siete archivos.\nP2: la verificación del Step 9 usaba el glob `UI/*/*.swift`, que reporta cinco\nfalsos fallos —los UiState, NativeBaseline y Palette no llevan el import—; pasa\na lista explícita.\nP3: la Task 4 no decía actualizar el `1.0.0+b719da3` del README, que está viejo:\nel artefacto en disco dice `1.0.0+959025fca`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e760f84a0ecda2895c6469ac7ecddf93ea39623e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/e760f84a0ecda2895c6469ac7ecddf93ea39623e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/f985308659ee8cd333ae65ca2220c44ea841c3e4","verification":{"payload":"tree e760f84a0ecda2895c6469ac7ecddf93ea39623e\nparent 40e56e9f28f5326ad852cfdd50a3c5bf9402d021\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789665099 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789665099 -0500\n\ndocs(ios): rulings del preflight sobre el plan del split\n\nP1: son 40 declaraciones `public`, no 39 — contado sobre los siete archivos.\nP2: la verificación del Step 9 usaba el glob `UI/*/*.swift`, que reporta cinco\nfalsos fallos —los UiState, NativeBaseline y Palette no llevan el import—; 