Q6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/9c2ab9137c6bcd4176b3883448565a2776894584/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:00:13Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:00:13Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"feat(web-angular): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 y el error Descifrado\n\nLa quinta base de código que corre `cases.json`. El mapeo no se toca acá: vive\nen `packages/contract/src/tags.ts` y ya lo actualizó el commit 41727e3, que es\nel mismo archivo que consume React Native.\n\n`contract.spec.ts` sube a v2.4.0, suma `descifrado` a las claves de primer nivel\ny al conteo por grupo (3), pasa la guardia 5 de nueve a diez nombres, y recorre\nel grupo nuevo a través de `CoreFinancieroService` —el mismo borde que usan las\npantallas, no un acceso paralelo al WASM—.\n\nSuite: **102 passed** en 15 archivos. El plan esperaba 100 porque contaba un\ncaso nuevo; el grupo trae tres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c448426fd1f81101408e3ce248cf8741feb0025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/9c448426fd1f81101408e3ce248cf8741feb0025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/9c2ab9137c6bcd4176b3883448565a2776894584","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c448426fd1f81101408e3ce248cf8741feb0025\nparent 7729115bc9cffd0ec2ae23ead72a96d8bd8aba4d\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646413 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646413 -0500\n\nfeat(web-angular): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 y el error Descifrado\n\nLa quinta base de código que corre `cases.json`. El mapeo no se toca acá: vive\nen `packages/contract/src/tags.ts` y ya lo actualizó el commit 41727e3, que es\nel mismo archivo que consume React Native.\n\n`contract.spec.ts` sube a v2.4.0, suma `descifrado` a las claves de primer nivel\ny al conteo por grupo (3), pasa la guardia 5 de nueve a diez nombres, y recorre\nel grupo nuevo a través de `CoreFinancieroService` —el mismo borde que usan las\npantallas, no un acceso paralelo al WASM—.\n\nSuite: **102 passed** en 15 archivos. El plan esperaba 100 porque contaba un\ncaso nuevo; el grupo trae tres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOtxhaq5X8b34igKJnTyg4DnjLmzU+5Tnkkc4K0soGnrnvjuDHv31RV25R8AomccPd\n0egfL3FoUr2hyw3fMKYAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starr