re/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/41727e3c911e2e70178ee046f8ef3753e4d61c5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:59:50Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:59:50Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"feat(react-native): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 por N-API y por WASM\n\nEl mapeo no es de React Native: `packages/contract/src/tags.ts` lo comparten el\ntest de contrato de RN, la app de RN y Angular. Se agrega `Decryption:\n''Descifrado''` ahí una sola vez, así que la Task 11 lo encuentra hecho.\n\n- Los dos tests de contrato —N-API y WASM, duplicados a propósito para que cada\n  runtime pueda fallar por separado— suben a v2.4.0, suman `descifrado` a las\n  claves de primer nivel y al conteo por grupo (3), pasan la guardia 5 de nueve\n  a diez nombres, y recorren el grupo nuevo por los dos caminos.\n- `contractName.test.ts` tenía `toHaveLength(9)` sobre las claves de la tabla.\n\nSuite: **126 passed, 126 total** (16 suites). Antes de esto había 7 rojos en 3\nsuites, que es el rojo que dejó el commit del contrato d52f21e.\n\nLa guardia de tipos de `src/guard.ts` quedó verificada, no supuesta: sacándole\nla entrada nueva a la tabla, `tsc` falla con TS2322 en `guard.ts:27`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf0ab7a652aa35aef1e0193eaa02d42e84183f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/bf0ab7a652aa35aef1e0193eaa02d42e84183f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/41727e3c911e2e70178ee046f8ef3753e4d61c5d","verification":{"payload":"tree bf0ab7a652aa35aef1e0193eaa02d42e84183f87\nparent e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646390 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646390 -0500\n\nfeat(react-native): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 por N-API y por WASM\n\nEl mapeo no es de React Native: `packages/contract/src/tags.ts` lo comparten el\ntest de contrato de RN, la app de RN y Angular. Se agrega `Decryption:\n''Descifrado''` ahí una sola vez, así que la Task 11 lo encuentra hecho.\n\n- Los dos tests de contrato —N-API y WASM, duplicados a propósito para que cada\n  runtime pueda fallar por separado— suben a v2.4.0, suman `descifrado` a las\n  claves de primer nivel y al conteo por grupo (3), pasan la guardia 5 de nueve\n  a diez nombres, y recorren el grupo nuevo por los dos caminos.\n- `contractName.test.ts` tenía `toHaveLength(9)` sobre las claves de la tabla.\n\nSuite: **126 passed, 126 total** (16 suites). Antes de esto había 7 rojos en 3\nsuites, que es el rojo que dejó el commit del contrato d52f21e.\n\nLa guardia de tipos de `src/guard.ts` quedó verificada, no supuesta: sacándole\nla entrada nueva a la tabla, `tsc` falla con TS2322 en `guard.ts:27`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAks7AEhFbpViGdKWub5vcGsWLb2kRPrZvvgzjjVam6R0/x6ufCBtVUX4sGdpcqMY9\n9l6mnWYKfCEzaNw4WaYgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/41727e3c911e2e70178ee046f8ef3753e4d61c5d","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDQxNzI3ZTNjOTExZTJlNzAxNzhlZTA0NmY4ZWYzNzUzZTRkNjFjNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad","sha":"e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad"}],"sha":"41727e3c911e2e70178ee046f8ef3753e4d61c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/41727e3c911e2e70178ee046f8ef3753e4d61c5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:55:31Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:55:31Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"feat(ios): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 y el error Descifrado\n\nEspejo Swift de lo que ya hicieron el núcleo (24034ee) y Android (3a7e431).\n\n- `ContractMessages.swift`: el `switch` exhaustivo sin `default` rompió la\n  compilación en sus dos ramas al regenerar el binding, que es exactamente para\n  lo que está. Cerradas con `.Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"` y, en `interpolate`,\n  devolviendo la plantilla sin tocar (el mensaje no lleva marcadores).\n- `ContractFixtures.swift`: el grupo `descifrado` se decodifica como\n  `DecryptCase`; las guardias de bundle suben a v2.4.0 y a diez mensajes.\n- `ContractTest.swift`: recorrido `descifrado` con los tres casos, la clave de\n  primer nivel nueva, el conteo del grupo en 3, y las tres guardias de nueve\n  variantes pasadas a diez —incluida la que ata `messages.es.json` del bundle,\n  que es la única que Rust no puede dar.\n- `ContractMessagesTest.swift`: el mapeo `Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"`.\n\nCorrida: `xcodebuild test -scheme ios-rust-test` sobre el simulador iPhone 17\n(iOS 27) → **48 tests en 12 suites, 0 fallos**, el salto de 47 a 48 que esperaba\nel plan. El grupo nuevo aparece como «descifrado with 3 test cases passed».\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a7169fb2563c4a0cc841c583c3818ef1736e3e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/5a7169fb2563c4a0cc841c583c3818ef1736e3e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a7169fb2563c4a0cc841c583c3818ef1736e3e0\nparent 3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646131 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789646131 -0500\n\nfeat(ios): adoptar el contrato v2.4.0 y el error Descifrado\n\nEspejo Swift de lo que ya hicieron el núcleo (24034ee) y Android (3a7e431).\n\n- `ContractMessages.swift`: el `switch` exhaustivo sin `default` rompió la\n  compilación en sus dos ramas al regenerar el binding, que es exactamente para\n  lo que está. Cerradas con `.Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"` y, en `interpolate`,\n  devolviendo la plantilla sin tocar (el mensaje no lleva marcadores).\n- `ContractFixtures.swift`: el grupo `descifrado` se decodifica como\n  `DecryptCase`; las guardias de bundle suben a v2.4.0 y a diez mensajes.\n- `ContractTest.swift`: recorrido `descifrado` con los tres casos, la clave de\n  primer nivel nueva, el conteo del grupo en 3, y las tres guardias de nueve\n  variantes pasadas a diez —incluida la que ata `messages.es.json` del bundle,\n  que es la única que Rust no puede dar.\n- `ContractMessagesTest.swift`: el mapeo `Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"`.\n\nCorrida: `xcodebuild test -scheme ios-rust-test` sobre el simulador iPhone 17\n(iOS 27) → **48 tests en 12 suites, 0 fallos**, el salto de 47 a 48 que esperaba\nel plan. El grupo nuevo aparece como «descifrado with 3 test cases passed».\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKqRWXMPmDQXXGpAtCnuyO1wV/BmmNa8rFVcwM4LvFmDrm7xWsfTwBHytp2Bh2wu6A\nmwXjXMiRBN/WU3qJXnewY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKGU0OWQyN2UzMGFiYzFhNWY0NDU2N2E2ZGFlYzMyNjM1NWVmODQ1YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143","sha":"3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143"}],"sha":"e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/e49d27e30abc1a5f44567a6daec326355ef845ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:41:24Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:41:24Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(superpowers): versionar el ledger de la Fase 6, que el árbol tenía ignorado\n\n`.superpowers/sdd/.gitignore` estaba modificado en el árbol de trabajo a `*` a\nsecas, sin las dos excepciones `!*/` y `!*/progress.md`. Efecto: el ledger de\nesta fase quedaba invisible para git mientras los de las fases 1, 3, 4 y 5 sí\nestán versionados, y CLAUDE.md cita el de la Fase 1 como documento vigente.\n\nSe restauró el .gitignore a la versión de HEAD (el cambio nunca estuvo\ncommiteado) y se agrega el progress.md de la Fase 6 — bloque 0, con los rulings\nde las tareas 1 a 8 y el cierre del fix round de la Task 8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"603d71cd9048ca997ab2d27d7f1c734b91ad4efc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/603d71cd9048ca997ab2d27d7f1c734b91ad4efc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143","verification":{"payload":"tree 603d71cd9048ca997ab2d27d7f1c734b91ad4efc\nparent e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789645284 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789645284 -0500\n\ndocs(superpowers): versionar el ledger de la Fase 6, que el árbol tenía ignorado\n\n`.superpowers/sdd/.gitignore` estaba modificado en el árbol de trabajo a `*` a\nsecas, sin las dos excepciones `!*/` y `!*/progress.md`. Efecto: el ledger de\nesta fase quedaba invisible para git mientras los de las fases 1, 3, 4 y 5 sí\nestán versionados, y CLAUDE.md cita el de la Fase 1 como documento vigente.\n\nSe restauró el .gitignore a la versión de HEAD (el cambio nunca estuvo\ncommiteado) y se agrega el progress.md de la Fase 6 — bloque 0, con los rulings\nde las tareas 1 a 8 y el cierre del fix round de la Task 8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA32X/dlJw6pKd7BjHx/JcibrzYTyqVv+ohGdSlwvTrDges6Ng/Up5+s0zs2Wfl8LU\nCwx3V+pvXImwv8/RpsQg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDMwOTBjOGNjMGM3YTM2MDc0MzYxN2QxYjBiN2FmNmI5MjY0ZTYxNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f","sha":"e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f"}],"sha":"3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/3090c8cc0c7a360743617d1b0b7af6b9264e6143"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:41:07Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:41:07Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"test(android): la guardia de mensajes cubre las diez variantes, no nueve\n\n`theMessagesAssetCoversTheNineErrorVariants` quedó afirmando que cubría las\nnueve variantes del core cuando ya son diez: no fallaba, porque sólo verifica\nque los nombres que lista tengan mensaje no vacío, pero una guardia que dice\ncubrir algo que no cubre es exactamente el defecto que esta fase vino a\ncorregir.\n\n- Se agrega `DomainException.Decryption` a la lista de variantes construidas, y\n  el conteo derivado de nombres de contrato distintos sube de 9 a 10. El set\n  sigue saliendo de `contractName()` sobre variantes reales, no tipeado: si dos\n  colisionaran, el set se reduce y esto falla.\n- Se renombran la guardia y `theNineVariantsMapToTheContractNames` (JVM), que\n  además asierta el mapeo `Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"`.\n- Comentarios al día: los 28 casos del contrato son 31, y los nueve mensajes de\n  `messages.es.json` son diez.\n\nSuites tras el cambio: JVM 29/29 y instrumentada 16/16 sobre el AVD Pixel_9_Pro\n(arm64, el mismo slice arm64-v8a que el Pixel 6 de la corrida anterior).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"249583ea9b9e701bbd0af61e7f4d16173b1591d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/249583ea9b9e701bbd0af61e7f4d16173b1591d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/e91f4aea168d6f23e8ea58ad619472ea44fdd26f","verification":{"payload":"tree 249583ea9b9e701bbd0af61e7f4d16173b1591d1\nparent 3a7e431798c376a4313e3f4d84f0757581f45ee3\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789645267 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789645267 -0500\n\ntest(android): la guardia de mensajes cubre las diez variantes, no nueve\n\n`theMessagesAssetCoversTheNineErrorVariants` quedó afirmando que cubría las\nnueve variantes del core cuando ya son diez: no fallaba, porque sólo verifica\nque los nombres que lista tengan mensaje no vacío, pero una guardia que dice\ncubrir algo que no cubre es exactamente el defecto que esta fase vino a\ncorregir.\n\n- Se agrega `DomainException.Decryption` a la lista de variantes construidas, y\n  el conteo derivado de nombres de contrato distintos sube de 9 a 10. El set\n  sigue saliendo de `contractName()` sobre variantes reales, no tipeado: si dos\n  colisionaran, el set se reduce y esto falla.\n- Se renombran la guardia y `theNineVariantsMapToTheContractNames` (JVM), que\n  además asierta el mapeo `Decryption -> \"Descifrado\"`.\n- Comentarios al día: los 28 casos del contrato son 31, y los nueve mensajes de\n  `messages.es.json` son diez.\n\nSuites tras el cambio: JVM 29/29 y instrumentada 16/16 sobre el AVD Pixel_9_Pro\n(arm64, el mismo slice arm64-v8a que el Pixel 6 de la corrida anterior).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAh1MqcIgUjAdsYwiIkKTe5jL3b5TnkPwsvuUAZy8g+nqjcftB/EB2AFlmvKm0mRJq\nw0y78JSM4pqz+5mKJ2zQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842