s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/7f964db082dc3efe0ed1084b8ef09fabde51154d","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDdmOTY0ZGIwODJkYzNlZmUwZWQxMDg0YjhlZjA5ZmFiZGU1MTE1NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08","sha":"5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08"}],"sha":"7f964db082dc3efe0ed1084b8ef09fabde51154d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/7f964db082dc3efe0ed1084b8ef09fabde51154d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:33:32Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:33:32Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(superpowers): planes de los dos bloques de la Fase 6\n\nDos planes y no uno, porque el Bloque 0 es precondición del Bloque 1: hasta\nque el contrato v2.4.0 no esté en verde en las cinco bases, Android no tiene\ncontra qué compilar.\n\nEl Bloque 0 son doce tareas: la variante Decryption, el reparto de prepare()\nen crypto.rs —que es lo que hace que un nonce inválido pasado a decrypt deje\nde reportarse como error de cifrado—, el contrato en su commit propio, las\nguardias, y la adopción por las cuatro apps terminando con una regeneración\ndesde el mismo HEAD.\n\nEl Bloque 1 son once: el módulo :core-financiero, el reparto de las suites,\nel test que faltaba del adapter real, la rotación, la guardia del @Immutable,\nlas dos divergencias de paridad y el recorte de los cuatro PENDING.md contra\nun docs/cross-app-pending.md nuevo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"370db52ae0297c3c3bae02423dd98be509562b0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/370db52ae0297c3c3bae02423dd98be509562b0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08","verification":{"payload":"tree 370db52ae0297c3c3bae02423dd98be509562b0b\nparent 01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789619612 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789619612 -0500\n\ndocs(superpowers): planes de los dos bloques de la Fase 6\n\nDos planes y no uno, porque el Bloque 0 es precondición del Bloque 1: hasta\nque el contrato v2.4.0 no esté en verde en las cinco bases, Android no tiene\ncontra qué compilar.\n\nEl Bloque 0 son doce tareas: la variante Decryption, el reparto de prepare()\nen crypto.rs —que es lo que hace que un nonce inválido pasado a decrypt deje\nde reportarse como error de cifrado—, el contrato en su commit propio, las\nguardias, y la adopción por las cuatro apps terminando con una regeneración\ndesde el mismo HEAD.\n\nEl Bloque 1 son once: el módulo :core-financiero, el reparto de las suites,\nel test que faltaba del adapter real, la rotación, la guardia del @Immutable,\nlas dos divergencias de paridad y el recorte de los cuatro PENDING.md contra\nun docs/cross-app-pending.md nuevo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOtwSDP2Sqz6XmEwb7lu9eHunqKrvJ6kcsTRkm2EOjmnI6T3KzVWtfLYAKvEIPZda2\n5otTInQbl8Uhfh5e03QwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08","node_id":"C_kwDOUS7obdoAKDVkZThhMjc0MGUwOWI2YjNkYjljMzZhY2E0NTEzMDYyOWVjY2VkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commit/01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281","sha":"01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281"}],"sha":"5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/5de8a2740e09b6b3db9c36aca45130629ecced08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure","id":11746842,"login":"tohure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzQ2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/commits/01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:23:51Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:23:51Z","email":"11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo Huamán"},"message":"docs(superpowers): spec de la Fase 6 — contrato v2.4.0 y hardening de Android\n\nDos bloques con dependencia real entre ellos. El Bloque 0 sube el contrato a\nv2.4.0 para separar el error de descifrado del de cifrado: hoy las cuatro apps\nmuestran «No se pudo cifrar los datos de la tarjeta» cuando lo que falló fue un\ndescifrado, que es justo lo que la demo ejercita en vivo. Toca las cinco bases\nde código porque cases.json es un archivo único y las cinco asertan su versión.\n\nEl Bloque 1 cierra los pendientes de apps/android: extrae :core-financiero como\nAndroid Library, verifica el runCatching del adapter contra la librería real,\nsobrevive a la rotación, y alinea el hex en mayúsculas con docs/ui-spec.md, que\nes donde Android diverge de su propia spec.\n\nEl inventario se rehízo contra el código y encontró dos documentos que le\nmienten: el abiFilters que Android declara pendiente y ya está aplicado, y la\nreverificación cruzada que React Native declara abierta y se cerró en la Fase 5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d2c1a17ad6b94875feef8c5cbfaf294b32e31f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/trees/0d2c1a17ad6b94875feef8c5cbfaf294b32e31f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tohure/rust-core-cross-app/git/commits/01d6db2030b6004a6af8a8a4f9ea9d651a80b281","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d2c1a17ad6b94875feef8c5cbfaf294b32e31f9\nparent 0e26e330bca057147996a06b6869d0699b4def9c\nauthor Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789619031 -0500\ncommitter Carlo Huamán <11746842+tohure@users.noreply.github.com> 1789619031 -0500\n\ndocs(superpowers): spec de la Fase 6 — contrato v2.4.0 y hardening de Android\n\nDos bloques con dependencia real entre ellos. El Bloque 0 sube el contrato a\nv2.4.0 para separar el error de descifrado del de cifrado: hoy las cuatro apps\nmuestran «No se pudo cifrar los datos de la tarjeta» cuando lo que falló fue un\ndescifrado, que es justo lo que la demo ejercita en vivo. Toca las cinco bases\nde código porque cases.json es un archivo único y las cinco asertan su versión.\n\nEl Bloque 1 cierra los pendientes de apps/android: extrae :core-financiero como\nAndroid Library, verifica el runCatching del adapter contra la librería real,\nsobrevive a la rotación, y alinea el hex en mayúsculas con docs/ui-spec.md, que\nes donde Android diverge de su propia spec.\n\nEl inventario se rehízo contra el código y encontró dos documentos que le\nmienten: el abiFilters que Android declara pendiente y ya está aplicado, y la\nreverificación cruzada que React Native declara abierta y se cerró en la Fase 5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYwo/ItiWFOwhIDQ4kB3xMHezGh\nT5/ikeR/s+7VPfnxwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPhl8wnGxSpjrCnEafI33ofieCVGlOAWwDsr5t5huf8HNljIJ0fXOaZqHOdWKluR0x\neOalnCPWrCj+Hw8FUGtAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T15:57:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11746842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tohure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tohure"