ervedAt":"2026-10-09T00:35:06.440Z","repositoryId":1362056926,"sha":"8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"Rob102194","providerType":"User"},"email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-09T00:26:25Z","committedDate":"2026-09-09T00:26:25Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Rob102194","providerType":"User"},"email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:35:06.440Z","repositoryId":1362056926,"sha":"dcebb684add1d5078a148cb983bba2b91b54c6a3"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"Rob102194","providerType":"User"},"email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-09T00:25:13Z","committedDate":"2026-09-09T00:25:13Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Rob102194","providerType":"User"},"email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:35:06.440Z","repositoryId":1362056926,"sha":"1e9e59c1860f2ebfb28c1c3ffd749e774dce598d"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:35:06.440Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/5344dcd106bb30ea03eb0ff88e1de3a81c16f030/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T01:18:27Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T01:18:27Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"feat(admin): pantallas de Administracion de catalogos (Hito 4)\n\nBackend: RepoCategorias.Actualizar + binding ActualizarCategoria\n(faltaba nombre/activo editable para categorias, como ya tenian\nsucursales e insumos).\n\nFrontend:\n- componentes/ui/{Boton,Campo,Dialogo}: primitivos reutilizables;\n  Dialogo envuelve Radix Dialog (foco atrapado, cierre con Esc).\n- componentes/formularios/{FormularioSucursal,FormularioCategoria,\n  FormularioInsumo,FormularioTasa}: react-hook-form + zod, pensados\n  para reusarse tal cual como alta al vuelo desde el grid (Hito 5).\n- componentes/SelectorSucursal: selector de sucursal activa en la barra\n  superior con alta rapida.\n- paginas/Administracion: pestanas Sucursales / Categorias\n  (compra·gasto) / Insumos / Tasas de cambio (historial + tasa vigente\n  hoy); cada entidad con alta, edicion y activar/desactivar en dialogo.\n- servicios/{api,hooks}: actualizarCategoria, useActualizarSucursal,\n  useActualizarInsumo, useActualizarCategoria, useTasaVigente.\n\nVerificado: go build/vet/test -race + golangci-lint 0 issues; tsc +\neslint + prettier + vitest (7, incluye alta de insumo por dialogo y\nvalidacion zod bloqueando el envio) + vite build; wails build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1334cc414a26170fa147c6ee44a91b4755a13ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/c1334cc414a26170fa147c6ee44a91b4755a13ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/5344dcd106bb30ea03eb0ff88e1de3a81c16f030","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/5344dcd106bb30ea03eb0ff88e1de3a81c16f030","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKDUzNDRkY2QxMDZiYjMwZWEwM2ViMGZmODhlMWRlM2E4MWMxNmYwMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c","sha":"af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c"}],"sha":"5344dcd106bb30ea03eb0ff88e1de3a81c16f030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/5344dcd106bb30ea03eb0ff88e1de3a81c16f030"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:45:36Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:45:36Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"feat(binding): metodos de Wails y servicios del frontend (Hito 3)\n\nComposition root (app.go / main.go): los repos SQLite, el caso de uso\nGuardarCierre y idgen.UUID se inyectan en App.\n\nBinding (dto.go, bindings.go, errores_binding.go):\n- DTOs de transporte: fechas y decimales como texto, dinero en enteros;\n  no se exponen tipos de dominio crudos.\n- Metodos: ListarSucursales/CrearSucursal/ActualizarSucursal,\n  SeleccionarSucursal, ListarCategorias/CrearCategoria,\n  ListarInsumos/CrearInsumo/ActualizarInsumo,\n  ListarTasas/RegistrarTasa/TasaVigente, GuardarCierre, CargarCierre,\n  IndicadoresInsumo.\n- Normalizacion de errores: los de validacion del dominio pasan con su\n  mensaje; los tecnicos se registran y se devuelve uno generico.\n  dominio.EsValidacion clasifica los centinelas.\n\nFrontend:\n- servicios/api.ts: unica envoltura tipada sobre los bindings.\n- servicios/hooks.ts: React Query (queries + mutaciones con invalidacion).\n- componentes/Toast.tsx + servicios/errores.ts: avisos con manejador de\n  errores global que consume el QueryClient.\n- pagina Diagnostico: consola minima que ejercita cada metodo del binding\n  contra la BD real (sucursales, categorias, insumos, tasas, cierre e\n  indicadores).\n\nVerificado: go build/vet/test -race + golangci-lint 0 issues;\ntsc + eslint + vitest (5) + vite build; wails build -nopackage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d98e4ee0ec514b273a664c7082996fb7db2124c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/d98e4ee0ec514b273a664c7082996fb7db2124c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKGFmNmMyYzJkMzRhZjRjNmRmOTdhNGI4NTlkNzFmZDE1NzYyNzhhM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/871189ef1d1c3667455945143d4280ac2664d1e3","sha":"871189ef1d1c3667455945143d4280ac2664d1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/871189ef1d1c3667455945143d4280ac2664d1e3"}],"sha":"af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/af6c2c2d34af4c6df97a4b859d71fd1576278a3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/871189ef1d1c3667455945143d4280ac2664d1e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:24:38Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T00:24:38Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"feat(persistencia): repositorios SQLite reales (Hito 2)\n\ninternal/infraestructura/persistencia/sqlite:\n\n- RepoCierres (implementa puertos.RepositorioCierres): Guardar en una\n  unica transaccion -> upsert de cabecera conservando creado_en, borrado\n  y reinsercion completa de lineas; ante error (p. ej. FK de insumo\n  inexistente) revierte todo. PorFecha reconstruye el cierre con\n  round-trip de decimal, Fecha y Centavos.\n- RepoSucursales, RepoCategorias, RepoInsumos, RepoTasas: CRUD basico;\n  RepoTasas.Vigente(fecha) devuelve la tasa aplicable a una fecha.\n  RepoInsumos implementa puertos.RepositorioInsumos.\n- Indicadores: CPPMensual y UltimoCosto; el SQL solo filtra/ordena y el\n  calculo lo hace dominio/costeo (una unica implementacion de la\n  formula).\n- Deteccion de violacion UNIQUE -> ErrYaExiste; fila ausente en UPDATE\n  -> puertos.ErrNoEncontrado.\n\nConsultas escritas a mano con database/sql; se descarta sqlc para no\nsumar otro generador al CI (documentado en CLAUDE.md).\n\nDominio: nuevo tipo TasaCambio con Validar().\n\nPruebas de integracion contra SQLite temporal en disco: guardado y\nrecuperacion, reemplazo por fecha, rollback ante FID invalida, CRUD de\ncatalogos, tasa vigente, e integracion del caso de uso GuardarCierre +\nrepos reales + indicadores.\n\nVerificado: go build/vet/test ./... -race y golangci-lint -> 0 issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c109399018258ef924a4466c1aa716858feaada6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/c109399018258ef924a4466c1aa716858feaada6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/871189ef1d1c3667455945143d4280ac2664d1e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.