yml al conjunto estándar\n\n- misspell con locale US marcaba todo el vocabulario en español como\n  error; revive exigía comentario en cada constante; ambos además\n  recorrían frontend/node_modules.\n- Se deja el conjunto estándar (errcheck, govet, ineffassign,\n  staticcheck, unused) y se excluye frontend/. gosec/revive/misspell\n  se podrán reintroducir afinados más adelante.\n\nVerificado: golangci-lint v2.1.6 run ./... -> 0 issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jo37PZBWq8HsgRitWuDCJq","tree":{"sha":"d18dda005d0d48fef332f955e76716f4311a9ef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/d18dda005d0d48fef332f955e76716f4311a9ef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/73b12ddc355e0c229d54d756496e88cba5811dcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/73b12ddc355e0c229d54d756496e88cba5811