 Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jo37PZBWq8HsgRitWuDCJq","tree":{"sha":"896b866c3c4f006e961ee550bbb3466ef31f27e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/896b866c3c4f006e961ee550bbb3466ef31f27e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/699532b2fe4e6a758c44d8c53409a7cef3139787","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/699532b2fe4e6a758c44d8c53409a7cef3139787","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKDY5OTUzMmIyZmU0ZTZhNzU4YzQ0ZDhjNTM0MDlhN2NlZjMxMzk3ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94","sha":"f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94"}],"sha":"699532b2fe4e6a758c44d8c53409a7cef3139787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/699532b2fe4e6a758c44d8c53409a7cef3139787"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T02:16:23Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T02:16:23Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"feat(nucleo): dominio y caso de uso GuardarCierre (Hito 1)\n\nDominio (lógica pura, cubierta por pruebas de tabla):\n\n- redondeo: política única de redondeo a entero, mitad hacia afuera de\n  cero. Todo el resto del dominio la reutiliza.\n- unidades: AUnidadBase (kg/g/lb/l/ml/u -> g/ml/u entero), DeUnidadBase\n  para lectura y Compatible por familia de magnitud.\n- moneda: NormalizarACUP (CUP pasa igual; USD/EUR por tasa \"CUP por\n  unidad\") y TasaEfectiva (1 para CUP, positiva para el resto).\n- costeo: CostoUnitarioBaseCUP, CPPMensual (Sigma costo / Sigma cantidad\n  del mes) y UltimoCosto (adquisicion mas reciente, desempate por\n  secuencia).\n- modelos con invariantes Validar(), errores centinela y tipo Fecha\n  (fecha civil YYYY-MM-DD).\n\nAplicacion:\n\n- puertos: RepositorioInsumos, RepositorioCierres, Reloj, GeneradorID y\n  el agregado Cierre.\n- GuardarCierre: normaliza cada linea a CUP y a unidad base, arma las\n  entidades, calcula el total y persiste el lote; reutiliza el id si ya\n  existe cierre para (sucursal, fecha). Errores con contexto de linea.\n\nInfraestructura:\n\n- memoria: repositorios en memoria para las pruebas de casos de uso.\n- idgen (UUID v4) y reloj (hora del sistema): adaptadores reales, aun\n  sin cablear en main (llega en el Hito 3).\n\nVerificado: go build/vet/test ./... -race en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jo37PZBWq8HsgRitWuDCJq","tree":{"sha":"f93aaf50d020d8a79a7d1ea8170e2413205a2718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/f93aaf50d020d8a79a7d1ea8170e2413205a2718"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKGY1YzdmMTIxOWNlMzJhMmRlODJiMGFjNGMxMDIxNWYzZWE1NzlhOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91","sha":"ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91"}],"sha":"f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/f5c7f1219ce32a2de82b0ac4c10215f3ea579a94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T01:57:15Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T01:57:15Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"ci: construir el frontend antes del build del núcleo\n\nEl job `nucleo` ejecutaba `go build ./...` sin `frontend/dist`, por lo\nque `//go:embed all:frontend/dist` fallaba en un runner limpio. Ahora:\n\n- `interfaz` compila el frontend y publica `frontend/dist` como artefacto.\n- `nucleo` depende de `interfaz`, recupera el artefacto y luego compila,\n  vetea, testea y pasa golangci-lint.\n- `empaquetado` también depende de `interfaz` (wails build compila el\n  frontend por su cuenta).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jo37PZBWq8HsgRitWuDCJq","tree":{"sha":"5e4f4875865e1ae83ce499840a134165e4480b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/5e4f4875865e1ae83ce499840a134165e4480b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKGVhNTAxMmZiZjZhOThhOTQ3Y2UxOWZlZDc0ZTMwMTBhZjA0OWNhOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4","sha":"8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4"}],"sha":"ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/ea5012fbf6a98a947ce19fed74e3010af049ca91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/commits/8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T01:51:39Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T01:51:39Z","email":"rob.perez.1021@gmail.com","name":"Rob102194"},"message":"fix(ci): mantener frontend/dist/.gitkeep para //go:embed\n\nEl job de CI del núcleo ejecuta `go build ./...` sin compilar el\nfrontend, y `//go:embed all:frontend/dist` falla si el directorio no\nexiste en un checkout limpio. Se versiona un marcador y se ajusta\n.gitignore para seguir ignorando el contenido generado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jo37PZBWq8HsgRitWuDCJq","tree":{"sha":"ac368faca385b624cb9b41949b10bd690a4b6a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/trees/ac368faca385b624cb9b41949b10bd690a4b6a94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rob102194/acgg-app/git/commits/8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135027320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194","id":135027320,"login":"Rob102194","node_id":"U_kgDOCAxaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rob102194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/8c93c25821d49eff1581f7b07b29a280ec1084a4","node_id":"C_kwDOUS9W3toAKDhjOTNjMjU4MjFkNDllZmYxNTgxZjdiMDdiMjlhMjgwZWMxMDg0YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rob102194/acgg-app/commit/dcebb684add1d5078a148cb983bba2b91b5